<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JER" style="id">- Biblica® Open Asante Twi Contemporary Bible 2020</book>
  <para style="h">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc1">Odiyifoɔ Yeremia Nwoma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yer</para>
  <para style="mt2">Odiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yeremia</para>
  <para style="mt2">Nwoma</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JER 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 1:1"/>Nsɛm a ɛfiri Yeremia nkyɛn nie. Yeremia yɛ Hilkia babarima a na ɔyɛ Anatot asɔfoɔ no mu baako wɔ Benyamin asase so. <verse eid="JER 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 1:2"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa ne nkyɛn wɔ Yosia a ɔyɛ Yuda ɔhene Amon babarima adedie afe a ɛtɔ so dumiɛnsa mu. <verse eid="JER 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 1:3"/>Ɛtoaa so wɔ Yuda ɔhene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim ɛberɛ so kɔsii Yuda ɔhene Yosia babarima Sedekia ɛberɛ so a nnipa a wɔte Yerusalem kɔɔ nkoasom mu wɔ adedie afe a ɛtɔ so dubaako no bosome a ɛtɔ so enum.<verse eid="JER 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Frɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 1:4"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ,<verse eid="JER 1:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 1:5"/>“Ansa na merebɔ wo wɔ awotwaa mu no, na menim wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">ansa na wɔrebɛwo wo no, meyii wo sii nkyɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:5">meyɛɛ wo sɛ odiyifoɔ maa aman no.”<verse eid="JER 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 1:6"/>Mekaa sɛ, “Aa, Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mennim kasa; meyɛ abɔfra.”<verse eid="JER 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 1:7"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Nka sɛ ‘meyɛ abɔfra.’ Ɛsɛ sɛ wokɔ obiara a mɛsoma wo ne nkyɛn na woka asɛm biara a mɛhyɛ wo sɛ ka no. <verse eid="JER 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 1:8"/>Nsuro wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ meka wo ho, na magye wo,” deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 1:9"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tenee ne nsa de kaa mʼano na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Seesei mede me nsɛm ahyɛ wʼanomu. <verse eid="JER 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 1:10"/>Hwɛ, ɛnnɛ mede wo asi aman ne ahennie so sɛ, tutu na dwiri gu, sɛe na tu gu, kyekyere na dua.”<verse eid="JER 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 1:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wohunu yi, Yeremia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:11">Na mebuaa sɛ, “Mehunu sorɔno dubaa.”<verse eid="JER 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 1:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Wahunu no yie, na merehwɛ anim sɛ mʼasɛm bɛba mu.”<verse eid="JER 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 1:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn bio sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wohunu yi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 1:13">Mebuaa sɛ, “Mehunu ɛsɛn a ɛrehuru sɛ ano rekyea akyerɛ yɛn firi atifi fam.”<verse eid="JER 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 1:14"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Wɔbɛfiri atifi fam de amanehunu aba wɔn a wɔte asase no so nyinaa so. <verse eid="JER 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 1:15"/>Merebɛfrɛ atifi ahennie mu nnipa nyinaa,” deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">“Wɔn ahemfo de wɔn ahennwa bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">abɛsisi Yerusalem kuropɔn apono ano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:15">wɔbɛto ahyɛ nʼafasuo a atwa ahyia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:15">ne Yuda nkuro nyinaa so.<verse eid="JER 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 1:16"/>Mɛbu me nkurɔfoɔ atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">wɔ wɔn amumuyɛ sɛ wɔagya me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 1:16">sɛ wɔhye nnuhwam ma anyame foforɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 1:16">na wɔkoto sɔre deɛ wɔde wɔn nsa ayɛ.<verse eid="JER 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 1:17"/>“Siesie wo ho! Sɔre na ka deɛ mɛka akyerɛ wo biara kyerɛ wɔn. Mma wɔmmmɔ wo hu, anyɛ saa a mɛma woabɔ hu wɔ wɔn anim. <verse eid="JER 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 1:18"/>Ɛnnɛ, mayɛ wo kuropɔn a ɛwɔ banbɔ, dadeɛ dum ne kɔbere ɔfasuo sɛ wobɛsɔre atia asase no nyinaa, Yuda ahemfo, nʼadwumayɛfoɔ, asɔfoɔ ne nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so. <verse eid="JER 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 1:19"/>Wɔbɛko atia wo nanso wɔrentumi nni wo so nkonim, ɛfiri sɛ meka wo ho, na mɛgye wo,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 1:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JER 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Israel Pa Onyankopɔn Akyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 2:1"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me so: <verse eid="JER 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 2:2"/>“Kɔpae mu ka ma Yerusalem nte:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">“Mekae sɛdeɛ wode wo ho maa me wo mmabunu berɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">sɛdeɛ wo dɔɔ me wʼayeforɔ berɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:2">na wodii mʼakyi wɔ ɛserɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:2">asase a wɔnnuaa so hwee.<verse eid="JER 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 2:3"/>Na Israel yɛ kronkron ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">ne twaberɛ mu abukan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:3">wɔn a wɔdii nʼani no, wɔbuu wɔn fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">na amanehunu baa wɔn so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:3">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 2:4"/>Montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Ao Yakob fiefoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:4">mo Israel mmusuakuo nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 2:5"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">“Mfomsoɔ bɛn na mo agyanom hunuu wɔ me ho a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">ɛma wɔtwee wɔn ho kɔɔ akyirikyiri sei?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:5">Wɔdii ahoni a wɔn ho nni mfasoɔ akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:5">ma wɔn ankasa bɛyɛɛ ahuhufoɔ.<verse eid="JER 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 2:6"/>Wɔammisa sɛ, ‘Ɛhe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">Deɛ ɔyii yɛn firii Misraim</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">na ɔde yɛn faa ɛserɛ wesee so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">anweatam ne amenamena asase</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:6">a awo na ayɛ owubɔn no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:6">Na ɛyɛ asase a obiara mfa so na obiara nte soɔ no.’<verse eid="JER 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 2:7"/>Mede mo bɛduaa asase bereɛ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">sɛ monni so nnuaba ne ɛso nnepa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:7">Nanso mobɛguu mʼasase ho fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:7">na moyɛɛ mʼagyapadeɛ akyiwadeɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 2:8"/>Asɔfoɔ no ammisa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">‘Ɛhe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Wɔn a wɔde mmara yɛ adwuma no anhwehwɛ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">ntuanofoɔ sɔre tiaa me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:8">Adiyifoɔ no de Baal hyɛɛ nkɔm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:8">na wɔdii ahoni huhuo akyi.<verse eid="JER 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 2:9"/>“Ɛno enti, merebɔ mo kwaadu bio,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:9">“Na mɛbɔ mo mma mma kwaadu.<verse eid="JER 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 2:10"/>Montwa nkɔ Kitim mpoano nkɔ hwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">monsoma nkɔ Kedar nkɔhwehwɛ mu yie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:10">monhwɛ sɛ biribi a ɛte sei asi wɔ hɔ:<verse eid="JER 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 2:11"/>Ɔman bi asesa wɔn anyame pɛn anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">Nso wɔnnyɛ anyame mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:11">Nanso me nkurɔfoɔ de wɔn animuonyam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:11">asesa ahoni huhuo.<verse eid="JER 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 2:12"/>Ao ɔsorosoro, momma mo ho nnwiri mo yei ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">na mo ho nwoso akomatuo mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:12">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 2:13"/>“Me nkurɔfoɔ ayɛ bɔne ahodoɔ mmienu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">Wɔapa mʼakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">me a meyɛ nkwa asutire no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:13">na wɔatutu wɔn ankasa nsukora amena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:13">amena a ɛho apaapae a ɛntumi nkora nsuo.<verse eid="JER 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 2:14"/>Israel yɛ akoa anaa ɔsomfoɔ firi awoɔ mu anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:14">Adɛn enti na wayɛ afodeɛ yi?<verse eid="JER 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 2:15"/>Agyata abobɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">wɔapɔ no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:15">Wɔasɛe nʼasase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:15">wɔahyehye ne nkuro ayɛ no amanfo.<verse eid="JER 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 2:16"/>Afei, Memfis ne Tapanhes mmarima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:16">ayi wo tiri so nwi.<verse eid="JER 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 2:17"/>Ɛnyɛ wo na woama yei aba wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">sɛ wopaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:17">wɔ ɛberɛ a ɔrekyerɛ wo ɛkwan?<verse eid="JER 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 2:18"/>Afei adɛn enti na mokɔ Misraim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">kɔnom Sihor mu nsuo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:18">Na adɛn enti na mokɔ Asiria</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:18">kɔnom Asubɔnten no mu nsuo?<verse eid="JER 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 2:19"/>Wo amumuyɛ bɛtwe wʼaso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">wʼakyirisane bɛka wʼanim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">Enti dwene ho na hunu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">sɛ wopa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn akyi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:19">na woannya ne ho suro a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">ɛyɛ bɔne ne ɔyea ma wo.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:19">Awurade, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 2:20"/>“Mmerɛ bi atwam, wobubuu wo kɔnnua mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">na wotetee wo nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">na wokaa sɛ, ‘Merensom wo!’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">Nokorɛm, wɔ kokoɔ biara so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:20">ne dua biara a adendan ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:20">na wotena bɔɔ adwaman.<verse eid="JER 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 2:21"/>Meduaa wo sɛ bobe amapa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">a ɛfiri bobe ase a ɛyɛ pa ara mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:21">Na ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wodanee wʼakyi kyerɛɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:21">bɛyɛɛ bobe a anyini asɛeɛ wɔ wura mu yi?<verse eid="JER 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 2:22"/>Sɛ wode soda</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">ne samina bebree dware mpo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:22">wʼafɔdie nkekaawa da so wɔ hɔ ara,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:22">sɛdeɛ Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 2:23"/>“Ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na woaka sɛ, ‘Meho nguu fi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">mennii Baalnom akyi’?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Hwɛ sɛdeɛ woyɛɛ wo ho wɔ bɔnhwa no mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">dwene deɛ woayɛ no ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:23">Woyɛ yoma bereɛ hoɔharefoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:23">a wotu mmirika kɔ ha ba ha,<verse eid="JER 2:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 2:24"/>wiram afunumu a anweatam so tena akokwa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">ɔhuahua ɛberɛ a ɔpɛ sɛ onini hyia no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">Sɛ nʼakɔnnɔ no ano yɛ den a hwan na ɔbɛsianka no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:24">Anini biara a wɔtaa no no nha wɔn ho bebree;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:24">ɛduru ɛberɛ a wɔhyia no a, wɔbɛnya no.<verse eid="JER 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 2:25"/>Ntu mmirika kɔsi sɛ wobɛyi wo mpaboa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">na wo mene mu bɛwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:25">Nanso wokaa sɛ, ‘Ɛho nni mfasoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">Mepɛ ananafoɔ anyame,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:25">na ɛsɛ sɛ medi wɔn akyi.’<verse eid="JER 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 2:26"/>“Sɛdeɛ wɔkyere ɔkorɔmfoɔ a wɔgu nʼanim ase no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">saa na wɔagu Israel efie anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:26">wɔn ankasa, wɔn ahemfo ne wɔn adwumayɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:26">wɔn asɔfoɔ ne wɔn adiyifoɔ.<verse eid="JER 2:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 2:27"/>Wɔka kyerɛ dua sɛ, ‘Woyɛ mʼagya,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">ne ɛboɔ sɛ, ‘Wo na wowoo me.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">Wɔadane wɔn akyi akyerɛ me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">na ɛnyɛ wɔn anim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:27">nanso sɛ amanehunu bi ba wɔn so a, wɔka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:27">‘Bra bɛgye yɛn!’<verse eid="JER 2:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 2:28"/>Anyame a moyɛ maa mo ho no wɔ he?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Momma wɔmmra sɛ wobɛtu agye mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">ɛberɛ a mowɔ amanehunu mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:28">Ɛfiri sɛ mowɔ anyame bebree</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:28">te sɛ deɛ mowɔ nkuro bebree no, Ao Yuda.<verse eid="JER 2:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 2:29"/>“Adɛn enti na mobɔ me soboɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">Mo nyinaa ayɛ dɔm atia me,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:29">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 2:30"/>“Metwee mo nkurɔfoɔ aso kwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">wɔamfa me ntenesoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:30">Wʼakofena akunkum wʼadiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:30">te sɛ gyata a nʼani abereɛ.<verse eid="JER 2:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 2:31"/>“Mo nnɛmmafoɔ, monnwene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">“Mayɛ sɛ anweatam ama Israel anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">Anaasɛ asase a ɛso aduru sum kabii anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:31">Adɛn enti na me nkurɔfoɔ ka sɛ, ‘Yɛwɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ yɛkyinkyin;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:31">yɛremma wo nkyɛn bio.’<verse eid="JER 2:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 2:32"/>Ɔbaabunu werɛ firi ne mpompranneɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">ayeforɔyere werɛ bɛfiri nʼahyehyɛdeɛ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:32">Nanso me nkurɔfoɔ werɛ afiri me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:32">nna a wɔntumi nkan.<verse eid="JER 2:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 2:33"/>Hwɛ nyansa a mowɔ de pɛ mo adɔfoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:33">Mmaa a wɔnsɛ hwee koraa tumi sua mo akwan.<verse eid="JER 2:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 2:34"/>Mo aduradeɛ mu, nnipa hunu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">ahiafoɔ a wɔdi bem mogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:34">nanso moankyere wɔn sɛ wɔrebubu akɔ mo dan mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:34">Yeinom nyinaa akyi<verse eid="JER 2:34"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 2:35"/>woka sɛ, ‘Medi bem;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">ne bo mfuu me.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:35">Nanso mɛbu wo atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:35">ɛfiri sɛ wo ka sɛ, ‘Menyɛɛ bɔne biara.’<verse eid="JER 2:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 2:36"/>Adɛn enti na wokyinkyini se,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">sesa wʼakwan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:36">Misraim bɛdi wo hwammɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:36">sɛdeɛ Asiria yɛeɛ no.<verse eid="JER 2:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 2:37"/>Afei wobɛfiri saa beaeɛ hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">a wo nsa gu wo tiri so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 2:37">Ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo wɔn a wode wo ho too wɔn so no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 2:37">wɔremmoa wo.<verse eid="JER 2:37"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JER 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JER 3"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 3:1"/>“Sɛ ɔbarima gyaa ne yere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">na ɔbaa no kɔware ɔbarima foforɔ a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">ɛsɛ sɛ ɔbarima no sane kɔ ɔbaa no nkyɛn anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">Ɛremma asase no ho ngu fi koraa anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:1">Nanso, wo ne adɔfoɔ bebree abɔ adwaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">na seesei deɛ wobɛsane aba me nkyɛn anaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:1">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 3:2"/>“Ma wʼani so hwɛ nkokoɔ no so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">Baabi wɔ hɔ a wɔntoo wo monnaa da anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Wotenaa kwankyɛn twɛnee adɔfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">wotenaa sɛ mmoahwɛfoɔ a wɔdi atutena wɔ anweatam so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:2">Woagu asase no ho fi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:2">wode wʼadwamammɔ ne wʼamumuyɛ na ayɛ.<verse eid="JER 3:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 3:3"/>Enti wɔatwe obosuo asan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">na osutɔberɛ nsuo antɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:3">Nanso wʼanim ayɛ sɛ odwamanfoɔ a ɔmfɛre hwee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:3">wʼani nwu hwee.<verse eid="JER 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 3:4"/>Nanso, woka kyerɛ me sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:4">‘Mʼagya, mʼadamfo firi me mmabunuberɛ mu,<verse eid="JER 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 3:5"/>wobo bɛfu biribiara anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">Wʼabofuhyeɛ no bɛkɔ so daa anaa?’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:5">Sei na wokasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:5">nanso woyɛ bɔne nyinaa sɛdeɛ wotumi.”<verse eid="JER 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Israel A Ɔnni Nokorɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 3:6"/>Ɔhene Yosia adedie berɛ so no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Woahunu deɛ Israel a ɔnni nokorɛ no ayɛ? Wakɔ nkokoɔ nyinaa so ne dua adendan nyinaa ase akɔsɛe awadeɛ wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JER 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 3:7"/>Mesusuu sɛ, anka wayɛ yeinom nyinaa akyi no, ɔbɛsane aba me nkyɛn, nanso wamma, na ne nuabaa Yuda a ɔno nso nka nokorɛ no hunuiɛ. <verse eid="JER 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 3:8"/>Memaa Israel a ɔnni nokorɛ no awaregyaeɛ nwoma na mepamoo no ɛsiane nʼawaresɛe abrabɔ. Nanso mehunuu sɛ ne nuabaa Yuda a ɔnni nokorɛ no ansuro; ɔno nso kɔbɔɔ awaresɛeɛ bra. <verse eid="JER 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 3:9"/>Esiane sɛ Israel adwamammɔ anyɛ no asɛm hia enti, ɔde efi kaa asase no na ɔne aboɔ ne nnua bɔɔ adwaman. <verse eid="JER 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 3:10"/>Yeinom nyinaa akyi no, ne nuabaa Yuda a ɔnni nokorɛ no ansane nʼakyi nokorɛm amma me nkyɛn. Ɔde nʼanim na ɛkyerɛeɛ,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 3:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Israel a ɔnni nokorɛ no tene sene Yuda nkontompo ni. <verse eid="JER 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 3:12"/>Kɔ, fa wʼani kyerɛ atifi fam kɔka saa nsɛm yi kyerɛ wɔn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">“ ‘Sane wʼakyi, Israel a ɔnni nokorɛ,’ Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Meremmuna nkyerɛ wo bio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:12">ɛfiri sɛ meyɛ mmɔborɔhunufoɔ,’ sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:12">‘Me bo renfu afebɔɔ.<verse eid="JER 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 3:13"/>Gye wo afɔdie to mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">woayɛ dɔm atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">woakyekyɛ wʼadɔeɛ mu ama ananafoɔ anyame</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">wɔ dua biara a adendan ase,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:13">na woanyɛ ɔsetie amma me,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:13">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 3:14"/>“Monsane mo akyi, mo akyirisanfoɔ,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, “ɛfiri sɛ meyɛ mo kunu. Mɛyi wo; ɔbaako bɛfiri kuro mu na mmienu afiri abusuakuo mu, na mede mo aba Sion. <verse eid="JER 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 3:15"/>Afei mɛma mo nnwanhwɛfoɔ a wɔda mʼakoma so, wɔn a wɔde nimdeɛ ne nteaseɛ bɛkyerɛ mo ɛkwan. <verse eid="JER 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 3:16"/>Saa nna no mu, sɛ mo dɔɔso bebree wɔ asase no so a,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “nnipa renka bio sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn ani agyina apam adaka no.’ Ɛremma wɔn adwene mu anaa wɔrenka saa bio; na wɔrenyɛ apam adaka foforɔ nso. <verse eid="JER 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 3:17"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, wɔbɛfrɛ Yerusalem <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Ahennwa, na amanaman nyinaa bɛhyia wɔ Yerusalem abɛkamfo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din. Na wɔrenni wɔn akoma bɔne a ɛma wɔn yɛ asoɔden no akyi bio. <verse eid="JER 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 3:18"/>Saa nna no mu, Yudafie bɛka Israel efie ho, na wɔabɔ mu afiri atifi fam asase bi so aba asase a mede maa mo agyanom sɛ agyapadeɛ no so.<verse eid="JER 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 3:19"/>“Mʼankasa mekaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">‘Anka ɛbɛyɛ me anigye sɛ mɛyɛ mo sɛ mma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">na mama mo asase a ɛyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">agyapadeɛ a ɛdi mu ma ɔman biara.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:19">Mesusuiɛ sɛ mobɛfrɛ me ‘Agya’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:19">na monnane mo ho mfiri mʼakyi.<verse eid="JER 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 3:20"/>Nanso, sɛdeɛ ɔbaa a ɔnni ne kunu nokorɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">saa ara na moanni me nokorɛ, Ao Israel efie,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:20">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 3:21"/>Wɔte esu bi wɔ nkokoɔ no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">ɛyɛ Israelfoɔ agyaadwotwa ne nkotosrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:21">ɛfiri sɛ wɔakyeakyea wɔn akwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:21">na wɔn werɛ afiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 3:22"/>“Monsane mmra, ɔyera mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">mɛsa mo akyirisane yadeɛ no.”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 3:22"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:22">“Aane, yɛbɛba wo nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:22">ɛfiri sɛ wo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 3:23"/>Nokorɛm, ahoni hooyɛ wɔ nkokoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">ne mmepɔ so no yɛ nnaadaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:23">nokorɛm, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:23">na Israel nkwagyeɛ wɔ.<verse eid="JER 3:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 3:24"/>Ɛfiri yɛn mmɔfraase, anyame huhuo adi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">yɛn agyanom nsa ano adwuma so aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:24">wɔn nnwankuo ne anantwie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:24">wɔn mmammarima ne wɔn mmammaa.<verse eid="JER 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 3:25"/>Momma yɛmfa yɛn aniwuo nneda fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">na yɛn ahohora nkata yɛn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">Yɛayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">yɛn ne yɛn agyanom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 3:25">ɛfiri yɛn mmɔfraase bɛsi ɛnnɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 3:25">yɛanyɛ ɔsetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn.”<verse eid="JER 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JER 4"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 4:1"/>“Sɛ wobɛsane wʼakyi a Ao, Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">sane bra me nkyɛn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:1">“Sɛ woyi wʼahoni a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ firi mʼani so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:1">na sɛ woammane bio,<verse eid="JER 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 4:2"/>na sɛ, nokorɛ, pɛyɛ ne tenenee mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">woka ntam sɛ, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi,’ a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:2">afei mobɛyɛ nhyira ama aman no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:2">na ne mu na wɔbɛnya animuonyam.”<verse eid="JER 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 4:3"/>Yei ne asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛ Yuda mmarima ne Yerusalem:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:3">“Monsiesie mo asase a wɔmfuntum da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:3">na monnnua wɔ nkasɛɛ mu.<verse eid="JER 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 4:4"/>Montwitwa mo ho twetia mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">montwitwa mo akoma twetia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">mo Yuda mmarima ne Yerusalemfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:4">anyɛ saa a mʼabufuhyeɛ bɛsɔre na adɛre sɛ ogya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">Mo bɔne a moayɛ enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:4">ɛbɛhye a obiara rennum.”<verse eid="JER 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Amanehunu A Ɛfiri Atifi Fam</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 4:5"/>“Bɔ nkaeɛ wɔ Yuda na pae mu ka wɔ Yerusalem sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Hyɛn totorobɛnto no wɔ asase no nyinaa so!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:5">Team denden sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">‘Mommoaboa mo ho ano!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:5">Momma yɛn nnwane nkɔ kuropɔn a wɔabɔ ho ban no so!’<verse eid="JER 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 4:6"/>Momma frankaa so na monkɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">monnwane nkɔbɔ mo ho adwaa!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:6">Ɛfiri sɛ mede amanehunu firi atifi fam reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:6">ɔsɛeɛ a ɛyɛ hu.”<verse eid="JER 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 4:7"/>Gyata bi afiri ne tu mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">ɔbɔaman bi asi mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Wafiri ne tenabea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">sɛ ɔrebɛsɛe wʼasase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:7">Wo nkuro bɛbubu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:7">na ada mpan.<verse eid="JER 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 4:8"/>Enti fira ayitoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">di awerɛhoɔ na twa adwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:8">ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuhyeɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:8">nnane mfirii yɛn so.<verse eid="JER 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 4:9"/>“Saa ɛda no,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">“ɔhene no ne adwumayɛfoɔ no bɛbɔ hu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:9">asɔfoɔ no bo bɛtu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:9">na adiyifoɔ no ho bɛdwiri wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 4:10"/>Afei, mekaa sɛ, “Aa, Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woadaadaa nnipa yi ne Yerusalem. Wokaa sɛ, ‘Mobɛnya asomdwoeɛ,’ wɔ ɛberɛ a akofena da yɛn mene mu.”<verse eid="JER 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 4:11"/>Saa ɛberɛ no wɔbɛka akyerɛ nnipa yi ne Yerusalem sɛ, “Mframa a emu yɛ hyeɛ bɛbɔ afiri nkokoɔ wesee a ɛwɔ anweatam so aba me nkurɔfoɔ so, ɛnyɛ deɛ ɛpɔ ho anaa ɛhuhu soɔ; <verse eid="JER 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 4:12"/>mframa a ano yɛ den boro saa no firi me nkyɛn. Afei, mepae mu ka mʼatemmuo a ɛtia wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 4:13"/>Hwɛ! Ɔreba sɛ omununkum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">ne nteaseɛnam reba sɛ, ntwahoframa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:13">nʼapɔnkɔ ho yɛ herɛ sene akɔdeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:13">Yɛnnue! Yɛawu!<verse eid="JER 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 4:14"/>Ao, Yerusalem, yi bɔne firi wʼakoma mu na woanya nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:14">Wode adwemmɔne bɛhyɛ wo mu akɔsi da bɛn?<verse eid="JER 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 4:15"/>Ɛnne bi rebɔ kaseɛ firi Dan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:15">ɛrebɔ amanehunu ho dawuro firi Efraim nkokoɔ so.<verse eid="JER 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 4:16"/>“Monka yei nkyerɛ aman no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">mommɔ no dawuro nkyerɛ Yerusalem sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:16">‘Atuafoɔ dɔm firi akyirikyiri asase bi so reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:16">wɔma ɔko nteamu so de tia Yuda nkuropɔn.<verse eid="JER 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 4:17"/>Wɔtwa kuropɔn no ho hyia sɛ mmarima a wɔrewɛn afuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">ɛfiri sɛ me nkurɔfoɔ ate me so atua,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:17">sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.<verse eid="JER 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 4:18"/>“Wʼankasa abrabɔ ne nneyɛeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">na ɛde yei aba wo so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:18">Yei yɛ wʼasotwe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Ɛyɛ nwono!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:18">Ɛwowɔ akoma!”<verse eid="JER 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 4:19"/>Ao mʼahoyera, mʼahoyera!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Mede ɔyea nukanuka me mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Ao mʼakoma ɔyeadie!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">Mʼakoma bɔ paripari wɔ me mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">mentumi nyɛ komm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:19">Ɛfiri sɛ, mate totorobɛnto no nnyegyeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:19">mate ɔko frɛ no.<verse eid="JER 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 4:20"/>Amanehunu di amanehunu akyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">asase no nyinaa asɛe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:20">Wɔasɛe me ntomadan prɛko pɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:20">ne me hintabea mpofirim.<verse eid="JER 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 4:21"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ mehwɛ ɔko frankaa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:21">na metie totorobɛnto no nnyegyeeɛ kɔsi da bɛn?<verse eid="JER 4:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 4:22"/>“Me nkurɔfoɔ yɛ nkwaseafoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">wɔnnim me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Wɔyɛ mma a wɔnni adwen;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">wɔnte hwee ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:22">Wɔwɔ bɔneyɛ ho nyansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:22">na wɔnnim sɛdeɛ wɔyɛ papa.”<verse eid="JER 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 4:23"/>Mehwɛeɛ asase no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:23">na ɛnni bɔbea na hwee nni so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:23">mehwɛɛ ɔsorosoro, na wɔn hann no nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 4:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 4:24"/>Mehwɛeɛ mmepɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">na wɔrewosowoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:24">na nkokoɔ no nyinaa rehinhim.<verse eid="JER 4:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 4:25"/>Mehwɛeɛ, na nnipa nni hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:25">ewiem anomaa biara atu kɔ.<verse eid="JER 4:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 4:26"/>Mehwɛeɛ, na nsasebereɛ no adane anweatam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">na ne nkuro nyinaa asɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:26">wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim, wɔ nʼabufuhyeɛ anim.<verse eid="JER 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 4:27"/>Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:27">“Wɔbɛsɛe asase no nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:27">mmom merensɛe no korakora.<verse eid="JER 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 4:28"/>Enti asase bɛdi awerɛhoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">na ɔsorosoro bɛduru sum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:28">ɛfiri sɛ makasa na merentwe nsan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:28">Masi gyinaeɛ na mennane no.”<verse eid="JER 4:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 4:29"/>Apɔnkɔsotefoɔ ne agyantofoɔ nnyegyeeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">ma kuro biara sofoɔ dwane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Ebinom kɔhyɛ nkyɛkyerɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">ebinom foro kɔ abotan mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:29">Nkuro no nyinaa so ada mpan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:29">na obiara nte so.<verse eid="JER 4:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 4:30"/>Ɛdeɛn na woreyɛ Ao wo a woasɛe woɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Adɛn na wofira kɔben</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">de sikakɔkɔɔ agudeɛ asiesie wo ho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Adɛn na wode nnuro keka wʼani?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">Wohyehyɛ wo ho kwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:30">Wʼadɔfoɔ bu wo animtia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:30">wɔrepɛ wo akum wo.<verse eid="JER 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 4:31"/>Mete osu bi te sɛ ɔbaa a awoɔ aka no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">mete apinisie te sɛ ɔbaa a ɔrebɔne awoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">Ɔbabaa Sion su te sɛ deɛ nisupɔporɔ ahini no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">ɔtrɛ ne nsa mu na ɔka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 4:31">“Afei deɛ, meretɔ baha;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 4:31">wɔde me kra ama awudifoɔ.”<verse eid="JER 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JER 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Obiara Nyɛ Ɔteneneeni</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 5:1"/>“Monni akɔneaba wɔ Yerusalem mmɔntene so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">monhwɛ mo ho nhyia nhwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">monhwehwɛ adwaberem nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">Sɛ mohunu onipa baako mpo a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:1">ɔyɛ pɛ na ɔdi nokorɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:1">mede kuropɔn yi ho bɛkyɛ no.<verse eid="JER 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 5:2"/>Ɛwom sɛ wɔka sɛ, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:2">nanso wɔda so ka ntam hunu.”<verse eid="JER 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 5:3"/>Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wopɛ nokorɛ enti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">wobɔɔ wɔn hwee fam, nanso wɔante yea biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">wodwerɛɛ wɔn, nanso wɔpoo ntenesoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:3">Wɔyɛɛ wɔn anim denden kyenee ɔboɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:3">na wɔpoo ahunu.<verse eid="JER 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 5:4"/>Mesusuu sɛ, “Yeinom nko ara ne ahiafoɔ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">wɔyɛ nkwaseafoɔ nso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:4">ɛfiri sɛ wɔnnim <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akwan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:4">deɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 5:5"/>Enti mɛkɔ ntuanofoɔ no nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">akɔkasa akyerɛ wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">ampa ara wɔnim <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">deɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn hwehwɛ.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:5">Nanso wɔn nso de adwene korɔ abubu kɔnnua no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:5">atete nkyehoma no mu.<verse eid="JER 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 5:6"/>Ɛno enti gyata bi a ɔfiri kwaeɛm bɛto ahyɛ wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">pataku bi a ɔfiri anweatam so bɛtete wɔn mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">Ɔsebɔ bi bɛtɛ wɔn abɛn wɔn nkuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">na obiara a ɔbɛyi ne ti no ɔbɛtete ne mu nketenkete,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:6">ɛfiri sɛ wɔn adɔnyɛ no ano yɛ den</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:6">na wɔn akyirisane aboro so.<verse eid="JER 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 5:7"/>“Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ mede mo ho kyɛ mo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">Mo mma apo me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">wɔde anyame a wɔnyɛ anyame aka ntam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:7">Memaa wɔn deɛ wɔhia nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">nanso, wɔbɔɔ adwamam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:7">na wɔbɔɔ yuu kɔɔ adwamanfoɔ afie mu.<verse eid="JER 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 5:8"/>Mpɔnkɔnini aniberefoɔ a wɔhwɛ wɔn yie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:8">wɔn mu biara su di ne yɔnko yere akyi.<verse eid="JER 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 5:9"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ metwe wɔn aso wɔ yei ho?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:9">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ mʼankasa metɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:9">ɔman a ɛte sei so were anaa?<verse eid="JER 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 5:10"/>“Momfa ne bobe nturo no mu na monsɛe no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">nanso monnsɛe no koraa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:10">Mompempan ne mman no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:10">ɛfiri sɛ saa nnipa yi nyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea.<verse eid="JER 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 5:11"/>Israel fiefoɔ ne Yuda fiefoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">anni me nokorɛ koraa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 5:12"/>Wɔadi atorɔ afa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɔrenyɛ hwee!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:12">Ɔhaw biara remma yɛn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:12">yɛrenhunu akofena anaa ɛkɔm da.<verse eid="JER 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 5:13"/>Adiyifoɔ no yɛ mframa bi kɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">na asɛm no nte wɔn mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:13">enti momma deɛ wɔka no mmra wɔn so.”<verse eid="JER 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 5:14"/>Enti yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Onyankopɔn seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">“Esiane sɛ nnipa no aka saa nsɛm yi enti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:14">mɛyɛ me nsɛm a ɛwɔ wʼanomu no ogya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:14">na saa nnipa yi ayɛ nnyina a ogya no bɛhye.<verse eid="JER 5:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 5:15"/>Ao, Israel fiefoɔ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">“Mede ɔman bi a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri rebɛtia wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:15">tete ɔman a ɛyɛ ɔmantease,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">nnipa a monnim wɔn kasa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:15">na monnte wɔn kasa ase.<verse eid="JER 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 5:16"/>Wɔn agyan mmɔtɔwa te sɛ damena a ano da hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:16">wɔn nyinaa yɛ nnɔmmarima.<verse eid="JER 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 5:17"/>Wɔbɛsɛe mo nnɔbaeɛ ne mo aduane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">asɛe mo mmammarima ne mo mmammaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">wɔbɛsɛe mo nnwankuo ne mo anantwikuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">asɛe mo bobe ne mo mmɔrɔdɔma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:17">Wɔde akofena bɛsɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:17">nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ banbɔ a mode mo werɛ ahyɛ mu no.<verse eid="JER 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 5:18"/>“Afei saa nna no mu mpo,” sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, “Merensɛe mo korakora. <verse eid="JER 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 5:19"/>Na sɛ nnipa no bisa sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn, ayɛ yɛn sei’ a, mobɛka akyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Sɛdeɛ moagya me hɔ akɔsom ananafoɔ anyame wɔ mo ankasa mo asase so no, saa ara na seesei mobɛsom ananafoɔ wɔ asase a ɛnyɛ mo dea so.’<verse eid="JER 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 5:20"/>“Monka yei nkyerɛ Yakob fiefoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:20">na mo mpae mu nka wɔ Yuda sɛ:<verse eid="JER 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 5:21"/>Montie, mo nkwaseafoɔ ne nnipa a monni adwene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">mowɔ ani nso monhunu adeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:21">na mowɔ aso nso monte asɛm:<verse eid="JER 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 5:22"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ mosuro me anaa?” Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ mo ho popo wɔ mʼanim anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Mede anwea ato hyeɛ ama ɛpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ɛhyeɛ a ɛwɔ hɔ daa a ɛrentumi ntra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:22">Asorɔkye bɛbɔ nanso ɛrentumi mmu mfa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:22">ɛbɛhuru so nanso ɛrentumi ntra.<verse eid="JER 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 5:23"/>Nanso, saa nnipa yi wɔ asoɔden ne atuateɛ akoma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:23">wɔatwe wɔn ho afiri me ho kɔ.<verse eid="JER 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 5:24"/>Wɔnnka nkyerɛ wɔn ho sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">‘Momma yɛnsuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:24">a ɔma osu tɔ wɔ ne mmerɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:24">deɛ ɔma yɛn awerɛhyɛmu wɔ ɔtwaberɛ nnapɛn a wahyɛ no ho.’<verse eid="JER 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 5:25"/>Mo amumuyɛ abɔ yeinom agu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:25">mo bɔne ama adepa abɔ mo.<verse eid="JER 5:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 5:26"/>“Amumuyɛfoɔ bi wɔ me nkurɔfoɔ yi mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">a wɔtɛ sɛ nnipa a wɔsum nnomaa afidie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:26">na wɔte sɛ wɔn a wɔsum mfidie yi nnipa.<verse eid="JER 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 5:27"/>Sɛdeɛ nnomaa ahyɛ kɛntɛn ma no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:27">saa ara na nsisie ahyɛ wɔn afie ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:27">wɔayeyɛ adefoɔ na wɔanya tumi.<verse eid="JER 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 5:28"/>Wɔadodɔre sradeɛ ama wɔn ho ayɛ srasra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:28">Wɔn amumuyɛsɛm no nni awieeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">wɔnnka nwisiaa asɛm mma wɔn nni bem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:28">na wɔmmɔ ahiafoɔ tumi ho ban.<verse eid="JER 5:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 5:29"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ metwe wɔn aso wɔ yeinom ho anaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:29">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ mʼankasa metɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:29">ɔman a ɛte sei so were anaa?<verse eid="JER 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 5:30"/>“Adeɛ a ɛyɛ hu ne ahodwirie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:30">asi wɔ asase no so:<verse eid="JER 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 5:31"/>Adiyifoɔ no hyɛ nkɔntorɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">asɔfoɔ no de wɔn dibea di tumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 5:31">na me nkurɔfoɔ no pɛ no saa ara.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 5:31">Nanso awieeɛ no, ɛdeɛn na wobɛyɛ?”<verse eid="JER 5:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JER 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Atamfoɔ Atwa Yerusalem Ho Ahyia</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 6:1"/>“Benyaminfoɔ monnwane nkɔbɔ mo ho adwaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Monnwane mfiri Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Monhyɛne totorobɛnto no wɔ Tekoa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">Monsi frankaa no wɔ Bet-Hakerem!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:1">Ɛfiri sɛ amanehunu bobɔ firi atifi fam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:1">ɔsɛeɛ bi a ɛyɛ hu.<verse eid="JER 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 6:2"/>Mɛsɛe Ɔbabaa Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:2">ɔhoɔfɛfoɔ sɔɔnɔ no.<verse eid="JER 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 6:3"/>Atamfoɔ bɛba abɛtwa ne ho ahyia te sɛ nnwanhwɛfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">wɔbɛsisi wɔn ntomadan atwa ne ho ahyia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:3">na wɔn mu biara bɛhwɛ ne kyɛfa so.”<verse eid="JER 6:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 6:4"/>“Monsiesie mo ho ne no nkɔko!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">Monsɔre, momma yɛnkɔto nhyɛ ne so owigyinaeɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:4">Nanso, hwɛ, onwunu redwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:4">na anwummerɛ sunsumma reyɛ tenten.<verse eid="JER 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 6:5"/>Enti, monsɔre momma yɛnkɔto nhyɛ ne so anadwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:5">na yɛnsɛe nʼaban hodoɔ!”<verse eid="JER 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 6:6"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">“Montwitwa nnua no ngu fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">na monsisi epie ntia Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:6">Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwe kuropɔn yi aso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:6">nhyɛsoɔ ahyɛ no ma.<verse eid="JER 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 6:7"/>Sɛdeɛ abura pu ne nsuo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">saa ara nso na ɔpu nʼamumuyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:7">Wɔte awurukasɛm ne ɔsɛeɛ nka wɔ ne mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:7">ne yadeɛ ne nʼapirakuro wɔ mʼanim daa.<verse eid="JER 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 6:8"/>Fa kɔkɔbɔ, Ao Yerusalem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">anyɛ saa a metwe me ho afiri wo ho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:8">na mama wʼasase ada mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:8">a obiara ntumi ntena soɔ.”<verse eid="JER 6:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 6:9"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">“Ma wɔnyiyi Israel nkaeɛfoɔ no mu yie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">sɛdeɛ wɔyiyi bobe mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:9">fa wo nsa fa mman no so bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:9">sɛ obi a ɔretete bobe aba.”<verse eid="JER 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 6:10"/>Hwan na mɛtumi akasa akyerɛ no na mabɔ no kɔkɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">Hwan na ɔbɛtie me?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">Wɔn aso asisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">enti wɔnte asɛm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:10">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm yɛ akyiwadeɛ ma wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:10">na wɔn ani nnye ho.<verse eid="JER 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 6:11"/>Nanso <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuhyeɛ ahyɛ me ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">na mentumi nkora so.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 6:11"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">“Hwie gu mmɔfra a wɔwɔ mmɔntene so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">ne mmaranteɛ a wɔahyia;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:11">ɛbɛka okunu ne ɔyere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:11">mmasiriwa ne wɔn a onyini adoko wɔn.<verse eid="JER 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 6:12"/>Sɛ metene me nsa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">wɔ wɔn a wɔte asase no so a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:12">wɔbɛdane wɔn afie ama afoforɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">na wɔn mfuo ne wɔn yerenom bɛka ho,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:12">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 6:13"/>“Ɛfiri akumaa so kɔsi ɔkɛseɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">wɔn nyinaa yɛ adifudepɛfoɔ de pɛ ahonya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:13">adiyifoɔ ne asɔfoɔ te saa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:13">wɔn nyinaa yɛ asisifoɔ.<verse eid="JER 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 6:14"/>Wɔmia me nkurɔfoɔ apirakuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">te sɛ deɛ ɛnyɛ hu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:14">Wɔka sɛ, ‘Asomdwoeɛ, asomdwoeɛ’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:14">wɔ mmerɛ a asomdwoeɛ nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 6:15"/>Wɔn ani wu wɔ wɔn animguaseɛ nneyɛɛ no ho anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">Dabi, wɔn ani nnwu koraa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">wɔnnim fɛreɛ mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:15">Enti sɛ metwe wɔn aso a, wɔbɛtotɔ wɔ atɔfoɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">wɔbɛhwehwe ase,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:15">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 6:16"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">“Monnyina nkwantanan no so na monhwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">mommisa tete akwan no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:16">mommisa baabi a ɛkwan pa no da na monnante so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">na mobɛnya homeɛ ama mo akra.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:16">Nanso mokaa sɛ, ‘yɛnnante so.’<verse eid="JER 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 6:17"/>Mede awɛmfoɔ sisii mo so na mekaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:17">‘Montie totorobɛnto nnyegyeeɛ no!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:17">Nanso, mokaa sɛ, ‘Yɛrentie.’<verse eid="JER 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 6:18"/>Ɛno enti, monyɛ aso, Ao amanaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">monhwɛ, Ao adansefoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:18">deɛ ɛbɛto wɔn.<verse eid="JER 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 6:19"/>Yɛ aso, Ao asase:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">Mede amanehunu reba saa nnipa yi so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">wɔn nneyɛɛ so aba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:19">ɛfiri sɛ wɔantie me nsɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:19">na wɔapo me mmara.<verse eid="JER 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 6:20"/>Nnuhwam a ɛfiri Seba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">anaa ahwedeɛ pa a ɛfiri akyirikyiri asase so fa me ho bɛn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:20">Mennye wo hyeɛ afɔdeɛ no nto mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:20">wʼafɔrebɔ ahodoɔ no nsɔ mʼani.”<verse eid="JER 6:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 6:21"/>Ɛno enti, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:21">“Mede akwansideɛ bɛgu saa nkurɔfoɔ yi anim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">Agyanom ne mmammarima nyinaa bɛsuntisunti wɔ so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:21">ayɔnkofoɔ ne nnamfonom bɛyera.”<verse eid="JER 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 6:22"/>Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">“Monhwɛ, akodɔm bi reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">wɔfiri atifi fam asase so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:22">wɔrekanyane ɔman kɛseɛ bi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:22">afiri nsase ano.<verse eid="JER 6:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 6:23"/>Wɔkurakura bɛmma ne pea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">wɔn tirim yɛ den, na wɔnni ahummɔborɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">Wɔn nnyegyeeɛ te sɛ ɛpo asorɔkye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">Sɛ wɔtete wɔn apɔnkɔ so a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:23">wɔba te sɛ mmarima a wɔrekɔ ɔko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:23">Wɔrebɛto ahyɛ wo so, Ao Ɔbabaa Sion.”<verse eid="JER 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 6:24"/>Yɛate wɔn ho nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">na yɛn nsa sesa yɛn ho sɛ deɛ awu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:24">Ehu akyekyere yɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:24">ɔyea aba wɔn so, te sɛ ɔbaa a ɔreko awoɔ.<verse eid="JER 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 6:25"/>Mfiri adi nkɔ wiram</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">na nnante akwan no so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:25">ɛfiri sɛ ɔtamfoɔ no wɔ akofena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:25">na baabiara ayɛ hu.<verse eid="JER 6:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 6:26"/>Ao me nkurɔfoɔ, monfira ayitoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">na mommunimuni nsõ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">Momfa adwadwotwa yaaya nni awerɛhoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">sɛdeɛ wɔsu ma ɔbabarima korɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:26">ɛfiri sɛ mpofirim ara ɔsɛefoɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:26">bɛba yɛn so.<verse eid="JER 6:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 6:27"/>“Mayɛ wo obi a ɔsɔ fagudeɛ hwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">na me nkurɔfoɔ yɛ dadeben,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:27">a wobɛhwɛ wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:27">na woasɔ wɔn akwan ahwɛ.<verse eid="JER 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 6:28"/>Wɔn nyinaa yɛ atuatefoɔ a wɔyɛ den,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">wɔnenam di nsekuro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:28">Wɔyɛ den sɛ kɔbere ne dadeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:28">wɔn nyinaa yɛ wɔn adeɛ wɔ porɔeɛ ɛkwan so.<verse eid="JER 6:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 6:29"/>Afa no bɔ mframa denden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">de ogya nane sumpii no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 6:29">nanso ahobereɛ no yɛ ɔkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:29">Ɛntumi nyiyii bɔne no mfirii wɔn mu.<verse eid="JER 6:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 6:30"/>Mɛfrɛ wɔn dwetɛ a wɔapo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 6:30">ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 6:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JER 7"/>
  <para style="s1">Atorɔ Nyamesom Ho Nni Mfasoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 7:1"/>Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn: <verse eid="JER 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 7:2"/>“Gyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no ɛpono ano, na ka saa asɛm yi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 7:2">“ ‘Montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo nnipa a mo wɔ Yuda nyinaa a mofa apono yi ano kɔsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. <verse eid="JER 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 7:3"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ: Monsesa mo akwan ne mo nneyɛɛ, na mɛma mo atena ha. <verse eid="JER 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 7:4"/>Mommfa mo ho nto nnaadaasɛm so na monnka sɛ, “Yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan!” <verse eid="JER 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 7:5"/>Sɛ mosesa mo akwan ne mo nneyɛɛ nokorɛm, na mone mo ho mo ho di no tenenee mu, <verse eid="JER 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 7:6"/>sɛ moanhyɛ ɔhɔhoɔ, awisiaa anaa okunafoɔ so, na moanhwie mogya a ɛdi bem angu wɔ ha, na moanni anyame foforɔ akyi ankɔ mo ara ɔsɛeɛ mu a, <verse eid="JER 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 7:7"/>ɛnneɛ mɛma mo atena ha, asase a mede maa mo agyanom afebɔɔ no. <verse eid="JER 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 7:8"/>Nanso monhwɛ, mode mo ho ato nnaadaa nsɛm a ɛho nni mfasoɔ so.<verse eid="JER 7:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 7:9"/>“ ‘Mobɛbɔ korɔno na moadi awu, mobɛbɔ adwaman na moadi adansekurumu, mobɛhye nnuhwam ama Baal na moadi anyame foforɔ a monnim wɔn akyi, <verse eid="JER 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 7:10"/>na afei, moaba abɛgyina mʼanim wɔ efie a medin da so na moaka sɛ, “Yɛnni ɔhaw,” sɛ moyɛ akyiwadeɛ yi nyinaa a na monni ɔhaw anaa? <verse eid="JER 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 7:11"/>Na efie a medin da soɔ yi, abɛyɛ adwotwafoɔ tu ama mo anaa? Nanso megu so rehyɛ! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 7:12"/>“ ‘Na afei monkɔ Silo, beaeɛ bi a, medii ɛkan bɔɔ atenaeɛ de me Din too so, na monhwɛ deɛ meyɛɛ no ɛsiane me nkurɔfoɔ Israelfoɔ amumuyɛ enti. <verse eid="JER 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 7:13"/>Ɛberɛ a moreyɛ yeinom nyinaa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, mekasa kyerɛɛ mo mpɛn bebree, nanso moantie; mefrɛɛ mo, nanso moannye so. <verse eid="JER 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 7:14"/>Ɛno enti, sɛdeɛ meyɛɛ Silo no, mede bɛyɛ efie a me Din da so no, asɔredan a mode mo ho to so, beaeɛ a mede maa mo ne mo agyanom. <verse eid="JER 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 7:15"/>Mɛpam mo afiri mʼanim sɛdeɛ meyɛɛ mo nuanom Efraimfoɔ no.’<verse eid="JER 7:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 7:16"/>“Enti mommmɔ mpaeɛ mma saa nnipa yi, monnsrɛ na monni mma wɔn nso; monnsrɛ me ɛfiri sɛ merentie mo. <verse eid="JER 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 7:17"/>Monhunu deɛ wɔreyɛ wɔ Yuda nkuro no mu ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so anaa? <verse eid="JER 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 7:18"/>Mmɔfra boaboa anyina ano, na agyanom sɔ ogya no ano, mmaa fɔtɔ asikyiresiam de to burodo ma Ɔsoro Hemmaa. Na wɔgu nsã ma anyame foforɔ de hyɛ me abufuo. <verse eid="JER 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 7:19"/>Na ɛyɛ me na wɔrehyɛ me abufuo anaa? <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. Na ɛnyɛ wɔn mmom na wɔreha wɔn ho, hyɛ wɔn ho aniwuo anaa?<verse eid="JER 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 7:20"/>“Ɛno enti, deɛ Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Wɔbɛhwie mʼabufuo ne mʼabufuhyeɛ agu beaeɛ yi so, agu nnipa ne mmoa, mfuo so nnua ne asase no so aba so, na ɛbɛdɛre a ɛrennum.<verse eid="JER 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 7:21"/>“ ‘Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ: Monkɔ so, momfa mo ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔ nka mo afɔrebɔ a aka no ho, na mo ankasa monwe ɛnam no! <verse eid="JER 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 7:22"/>Na ɛberɛ a meyii mo agyanom firii Misraim na mekasa kyerɛɛ wɔn no, manhyɛ wɔn mmara a ɛfa ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔ ne afɔrebɔ ho nko ara, <verse eid="JER 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 7:23"/>mmom mede saa mmara yi kaa ho: Monyɛ ɔsetie mma me, na mɛyɛ mo Onyankopɔn, na moayɛ me nkurɔfoɔ. Monnante akwan nyinaa a mɛhyɛ mo no so, na asi mo yie. <verse eid="JER 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 7:24"/>Nanso, wɔantie na wɔannyɛ aso; mmom, wɔfiri wɔn akoma bɔne mu yɛɛ asobrakyeɛ. Wɔsane wɔn akyi na wɔankɔ wɔn anim. <verse eid="JER 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 7:25"/>Ɛfiri ɛberɛ a mo agyanom firii Misraim de bɛsi ɛnnɛ yi, da biara da ne ɛberɛ biara mesomaa me nkoa adiyifoɔ baa mo nkyɛn. <verse eid="JER 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 7:26"/>Nanso wɔantie me na wɔanyɛ aso. Wɔde asoɔden yɛɛ bɔne boroo wɔn agyanom deɛ so.’<verse eid="JER 7:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 7:27"/>“Sɛ moka yeinom nyinaa kyerɛ wɔn a, wɔrentie mo; sɛ mofrɛ wɔn a wɔrennye so. <verse eid="JER 7:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 7:28"/>Ɛno enti monka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Yei ne ɔman a ɔnyɛɛ ɔsetie mmaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ne Onyankopɔn, na ɔmfaa ntenesoɔ. Nokorɛ asa, na afiri wɔn ano. <verse eid="JER 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 7:29"/>Monyi mo tirinwi na monto ngu, montwa agyaadwoɔ wɔ nkokoɔ no so, ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo, na wagyae saa awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ yi a wɔwɔ na abufuhyeɛ no ase akyi di.<verse eid="JER 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Okum Bɔnhwa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 7:30"/>“ ‘Yudafoɔ ayɛ bɔne mʼani so, sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. Wɔde ahoni a, ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ asisi efie a me Din da so de agu ho fi. <verse eid="JER 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 7:31"/>Wɔasisi Tofet sorɔnsorɔmmea wɔ Ben Hinom bɔnhwa mu ɛhɔ na wɔhye wɔn mmammarima ne wɔn mmammaa. Adeɛ a manhyɛ wɔn na amma mʼadwene mu nso. <verse eid="JER 7:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 7:32"/>Ɛno enti, monhwɛ yie na nna no reba, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, a wɔremfrɛ hɔ Tofet anaa Hinom Bɔnhwa bio, na mmom, wɔbɛfrɛ no Okum Bɔnhwa, ɛfiri sɛ wɔbɛsie awufoɔ wɔ Tofet kɔsi sɛ ɛhɔ bɛyɛ ma. <verse eid="JER 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 7:33"/>Na afei saa nnipa yi afunu bɛyɛ aduane ama ewiem nnomaa ne asase so mmoa, na ɛrenka obiara wɔ hɔ a ɔbɛpam wɔn. <verse eid="JER 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 7:34"/>Mede ahosɛpɛ ne anigyeɛ nnyegyeɛ, ayeforɔ ne ayeforɔkunu nne a ɛwɔ Yuda nkuro ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so, bɛba awieeɛ ɛfiri sɛ asase no bɛda mpan.’ ”<verse eid="JER 7:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JER 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 8:1"/>“ ‘Saa ɛberɛ no, sɛdeɛ Awurade seɛ nie, wɔbɛyiyi Yuda ahemfo ne adwumayɛfoɔ nnompe, asɔfoɔ ne adiyifoɔ nnompe ne Yerusalemfoɔ nnompe afiri wɔn nnamena mu. <verse eid="JER 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 8:2"/>Wɔbɛsɛ no kɛtɛ wɔ awia ne ɔsrane ne ɔsorosoro nsoromma nyinaa a wɔdɔɔɛ na wɔsomeeɛ na wɔdii akyire no ase. Wɔremmoa wɔn ano na wɔrensie wɔn, mmom, wɔbɛyɛ sɛ sumina a ɛgugu fam. <verse eid="JER 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 8:3"/>Saa ɔman bɔne yi nkaeɛfoɔ no, baabiara a mɛtwa wɔn asuo akɔ no, wɔbɛpɛ sɛ wɔbɛwu sene sɛ wɔbɛtena nkwa mu, sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.’<verse eid="JER 8:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bɔne Ne Asotwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 8:4"/>“Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:4">“ ‘Sɛ nnipa hwe ase a, wɔnsɔre anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:4">Sɛ onipa dane ne ho a, ɔnsane nʼakyi anaa?<verse eid="JER 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 8:5"/>Afei adɛn enti na saa nnipa yi adane wɔn ho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">Adɛn enti na Yerusalem dane ne ho daa yi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:5">Wɔkura nnaadaa mu pintinn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:5">na wɔmpɛ sɛ wɔsane wɔn akyi.<verse eid="JER 8:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 8:6"/>Mawɛn maso matie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">nanso wɔnnka deɛ ɛtene.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Wɔn mu biara nnu ne ho wɔ nʼamumuyɛ ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">na ɔka sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na mayɛ?”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:6">Obiara fa ɔno ara ɛkwan so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:6">te sɛ ɔpɔnkɔ a ɔrebɔ hyia dɔm.<verse eid="JER 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 8:7"/>Mpo asukɔnkɔn a ɔwɔ ewiem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">nim ne mmerɛ a wɔahyehyɛ ama no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">na aturukuku, asomfena ne anyankuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">hunu ɛberɛ a wɔtu kɔtena baabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:7">nanso me nkurɔfoɔ nnim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:7">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hwehwɛ.<verse eid="JER 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 8:8"/>“ ‘Adɛn na motumi ka sɛ, “Yɛnim nyansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">ɛfiri sɛ yɛwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmara,”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:8">wɔ ɛberɛ a atwerɛfoɔ twerɛdua torofoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:8">de atorɔ adanedane mu?<verse eid="JER 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 8:9"/>Anyansafoɔ no anim bɛgu ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">wɔn ho bɛdwiri wɔn na afidie ayi wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:9">Sɛ wɔapo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm no a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:9">na ɛdeɛn nyansa na wɔwɔ?<verse eid="JER 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 8:10"/>Mede wɔn yerenom bɛma mmarimma foforɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">ne wɔn mfuo nso ama afoforɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">Ɛfiri akumaa so kɔsi ɔkɛseɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">wɔn nyinaa yɛ adifudepɛfoɔ de pɛ ahonya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:10">adiyifoɔ ne asɔfoɔ te saa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:10">wɔn nyinaa yɛ asisifoɔ.<verse eid="JER 8:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 8:11"/>Wɔmia me nkurɔfoɔ apirakuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">te sɛ deɛ ɛnyɛ hu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:11">Wɔka sɛ, “Asomdwoeɛ, asomdwoeɛ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:11">wɔ mmerɛ a asomdwoeɛ nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 8:12"/>Wɔn ani wu wɔ wɔn animguaseɛ nneyɛɛ no ho anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Dabi, wɔn ani nnwu koraa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">wɔnnim fɛreɛ mpo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">Enti wɔbɛtotɔ wɔ atɔfoɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:12">sɛ metwe wɔn aso a, wɔbɛhwehwe ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:12">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 8:13"/>“ ‘Mɛfa wɔn otwa berɛ nnɔbaeɛ akɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">Aba biara remma bobe nnua no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Aba biara remma borɔdɔma nnua no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">ɛso nhahan bɛdwindwan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:13">Deɛ mede ama wɔn no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:13">wɔbɛgye afiri wɔn nsam.’ ”<verse eid="JER 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 8:14"/>Adɛn enti na yɛtete ha?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">Mommoaboa mo ho ano!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Momma yɛnnwane nkɔ nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ banbɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">na yɛnkɔwuwu wɔ hɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:14">Ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn abu yɛn kumfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">na wama yɛn nsuo a awuduro wɔ mu sɛ yɛnnom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:14">ɛfiri sɛ yɛayɛ bɔne atia no.<verse eid="JER 8:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 8:15"/>Yɛhwɛɛ ɛkwan sɛ yɛbɛnya asomdwoeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">nanso biribi pa biara amfiri mu amma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:15">yɛhwɛɛ ayaresa berɛ ɛkwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:15">nanso ehu nko ara na ɛkaa yɛn.<verse eid="JER 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 8:16"/>Wɔte atamfoɔ no apɔnkɔ homee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">firi Dan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">na wɔn apɔnkɔnini su</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">ma asase no nyinaa woso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:16">Wɔaba sɛ wɔrebɛsɛe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">asase no ne ɛso nneɛma nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:16">kuropɔn no ne wɔn a wɔtete mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 8:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 8:17"/>“Hwɛ, mɛsoma awɔ a wɔn ano wɔ borɔ aba mo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">nhurutoa a wɔntumi nnwodwo wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:17">na wɔbɛkeka mo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:17">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 8:18"/>Ao mʼawerɛhoɔ mu ɔwerɛkyekyefoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:18">mʼakoma aboto wɔ me mu.<verse eid="JER 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 8:19"/>Tie me nkurɔfoɔ sufrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">a ɛfiri akyirikyiri asase so:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nni Sion anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">Ne Ɔhene no nni hɔ bio anaa?”</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 8:19"/>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:19">“Adɛn enti na wɔde wɔn nsɛsodeɛ ahyɛ me abufuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:19">wɔn ananafoɔ ahoni huhuo no?”<verse eid="JER 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 8:20"/>“Otwa berɛ no atwam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">ahuhuro berɛ no aba awieeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:20">na wɔnnyee yɛn nkwa.”<verse eid="JER 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 8:21"/>Sɛ wɔadwerɛ me nkurɔfoɔ no enti, wɔadwerɛ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:21">medi awerɛhoɔ, na ahodwirie akyekyere me.<verse eid="JER 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 8:22"/>Aduro bi nni Gilead anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">Ɔyaresafoɔ bi nni hɔ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 8:22">Na afei adɛn enti na ayaresa nni hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 8:22">mma me nkurɔfoɔ apirakuro?<verse eid="JER 8:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JER 9"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 9:1"/>Ao, sɛ me etiri yɛ asutire,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">na mʼaniwa yɛ nisuo abura a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:1">anka mɛsu awia ne anadwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:1">ama me nkurɔfoɔ a wɔakunkum wɔn no.<verse eid="JER 9:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 9:2"/>Ao, sɛ mewɔ akwantufoɔ asoeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">wɔ anweatam no so a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">anka mɛgya me nkurɔfoɔ hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">na mafiri wɔn nkyɛn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:2">ɛfiri sɛ wɔn nyinaa yɛ awaresɛefoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:2">nnipa kuo a wɔnni nokorɛ.<verse eid="JER 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 9:3"/>“Wɔsiesie wɔn tɛkrɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">te sɛ agyan de di atorɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Ɛnyɛ nokorɛ so na wɔnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">di yie wɔ asase yi so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:3">Wɔyɛ bɔne toatoa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">na wɔnnye me nto mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:3">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 9:4"/>“Monhwɛ yie wɔ mo nnamfonom ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">monnnye mo nuammarima mpo nni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:4">Ɛfiri sɛ onuabarima biara yɛ ɔdaadaafoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:4">na adamfo biara yɛ osekuni.<verse eid="JER 9:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 9:5"/>Adamfo daadaa adamfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">na wɔn mu biara nka nokorɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:5">Wɔn tɛkrɛma akokwa atorodie mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:5">na wɔde bɔneyɛ ha wɔn ho.<verse eid="JER 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 9:6"/>Wote nnaadaa mfimfini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">na wɔn nnaadaa mu wɔmpɛ sɛ wɔgye me to mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:6">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 9:7"/>Ɛno enti, sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">“Hwɛ, mɛnane wɔn asɔ wɔn ahwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:7">na ɛdeɛn bio na mɛtumi ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:7">ɛsiane me nkurɔfoɔ yi bɔne nti?<verse eid="JER 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 9:8"/>Wɔn tɛkrɛma yɛ agyan a ano wɔ borɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">ɛka nnaadaasɛm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:8">Obiara kasa asomdwoeɛ mu kyerɛ ne yɔnko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:8">nanso nʼakoma mu deɛ, ɔsum no afidie.<verse eid="JER 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 9:9"/>Ɛnsɛ sɛ metwe wɔn aso wɔ yei ho?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:9">“Ɛnsɛ sɛ mʼankasa metɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:9">ɔman a ɛte sei so awere anaa?”<verse eid="JER 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 9:10"/>Mɛsu na mɛtwa adwo ama mmepɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">mɛbɔ abubuo a ɛfa anweatam adidibea ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Ayɛ fo na obi mfa hɔ bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">na wɔnte anantwie su wɔ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:10">Ewiem nnomaa no atutu kɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:10">na mmoa no nso adwane kɔ.<verse eid="JER 9:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 9:11"/>“Mɛyɛ Yerusalem mmubuiɛ sie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">sakraman atuo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:11">na mɛma Yuda nkuro ada mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:11">sɛdeɛ obiara ntumi ntena hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 9:12"/>Onipa bɛn na ɔnim nyansa ara sɛ ɔbɛte yei ase? Hwan na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyerɛkyerɛ no a ɔbɛtumi akyerɛ aseɛ? Adɛn enti na wɔasɛe asase no ama ada mpan sɛ anweatam a obiara ntumi mfa soɔ?<verse eid="JER 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 9:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa sɛ, “Esiane sɛ wɔapo me mmara a mehyɛ maa wɔn no enti, wɔanyɛ ɔsetie amma me na wɔanni me mmara so. <verse eid="JER 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 9:14"/>Mmom, wɔadi wɔn akoma asoɔden akyi, wɔadi Baalnom akyi sɛdeɛ wɔn agyanom kyerɛɛ wɔn no.” <verse eid="JER 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 9:15"/>Ɛno enti, deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ nie: “Hwɛ, mɛma saa nnipa yi adi aduane a ɛyɛ nwono na wɔanom nsuo a wɔde awuduro afra. <verse eid="JER 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 9:16"/>Mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete amanaman a wɔn anaa wɔn agyanom nnim so, na mede akofena bɛtaa wɔn kɔsi sɛ mɛsɛe wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 9:17"/>Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tumfoɔ seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:17">“Dwene ho! Frɛ mmaa agyaadwotwafoɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:17">frɛ wɔn a wɔakwadare mu pa ara.<verse eid="JER 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 9:18"/>Ma wɔmmra ntɛm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">mmesu ngu yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:18">kɔsi sɛ yɛn ani so bɛtaataa nisuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:18">na nisuo adware yɛn.<verse eid="JER 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 9:19"/>Wɔte agyaadwotwa nnyegyeeɛ firi Sion sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">‘Wɔasɛe yɛn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">Yɛn anim agu ase yie!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:19">Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛtu firi yɛn asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:19">ɛfiri sɛ, yɛn afie abubu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 9:20"/>Afei, Ao mmaa, montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">monyɛ aso mma nsɛm a ɛfiri nʼanom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:20">Monkyerɛ mo mmammaa sɛdeɛ wɔtwa dwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:20">monkyerɛ mo ho mo ho abubuo bɔ.<verse eid="JER 9:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 9:21"/>Owuo aforo afa yɛn mpomma mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">ahyɛne yɛn aban mu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:21">apamo mmɔfra afiri mmɔntene so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:21">ne mmeranteɛ afiri ɔman adwaberem.<verse eid="JER 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 9:22"/>Ka sɛ, “Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">“ ‘Nnipa afunu bɛdeda hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">te sɛ sumina a ɛgugu petee mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:22">te sɛ aburoo a otwafoɔ atwa agu nʼakyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:22">a obiara mmoaboaa ano.’ ”<verse eid="JER 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 9:23"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">“Mma onyansafoɔ mfa ne nyansa nhyehyɛ ne ho</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:23">anaa ɔhoɔdenfoɔ mfa nʼahoɔden nhyehyɛ ne ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:23">anaa ɔdefoɔ mfa nʼahonya nhyehyɛ ne ho.<verse eid="JER 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 9:24"/>Mmom ma deɛ ɔhyehyɛ ne ho nhyehyɛ ne ho sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">ɔwɔ nhunumu, na ɔnim sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">me ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔyɛ adɔeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">na ɔbu atɛntenenee na ɔyɛ adetenenee wɔ asase so</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 9:24">ɛfiri sɛ yeinom na ɛsɔ mʼani,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 9:24">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 9:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 9:25"/>“Nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “A mɛtwe wɔn a wɔatwa twetia wɔ honam fam nko ara no nyinaa aso: <verse eid="JER 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 9:26"/>Misraimfoɔ, Yudafoɔ, Edomfoɔ, Amonfoɔ, Moabfoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtete anweatam a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri nsase so nyinaa. Na nokorɛm, saa aman yi nyinaa yɛ momonotofoɔ na mpo Israel fiefoɔ nyinaa yɛ akoma mu momonotofoɔ.”<verse eid="JER 9:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JER 10"/>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Ne Ahoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 10:1"/>Montie deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛ mo, Ao Israel fiefoɔ. <verse eid="JER 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 10:2"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:2">“Monnsua amanaman no akwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">na momma ewiem nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ mmɔ mo hu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:2">Ɛwom sɛ yeinom bɔ amanaman no hu<verse eid="JER 10:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 10:3"/>nanso nkurɔfoɔ no amanneɛ nka hwee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">wɔtwa dua firi kwaeɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:3">na odwumfoɔ de ne fitiiɛ asene.<verse eid="JER 10:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 10:4"/>Wɔde dwetɛ ne sikakɔkɔɔ hyehyɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">wɔde nnadewa ne asaeɛ bobɔ si hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:4">sɛdeɛ ɛrenhwe fam.<verse eid="JER 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 10:5"/>Ɛte sɛ kaakaammotobi a ɛsi ɛferɛ mfikyifuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">wɔn ahoni no ntumi nkasa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">ɛsɛ sɛ wɔsoa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">ɛfiri sɛ wɔntumi nnante.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:5">Monnsuro wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">wɔrentumi nha mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:5">na wɔrentumi nyɛ adepa biara nso.”<verse eid="JER 10:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 10:6"/>Obiara nte sɛ wo, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">woyɛ kɛseɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:6">na wo din wɔ tumi.<verse eid="JER 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 10:7"/>Hwan na ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔdi wo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Ao, amansanhene?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">Yei na ɛfata woɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:7">Amanaman no so anyansafoɔ nyinaa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">ne wɔn ahennie nyinaa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:7">obiara ne wo nsɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 10:8"/>Wɔn nyinaa yɛ adwenemherɛfoɔ ne nkwaseafoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:8">dua ahoni a ɛho nni mfasoɔ na ɛma wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 10:9"/>Wɔde dwetɛ a wɔaboro firi Tarsis ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">ne sikakɔkɔɔ nso firi Ufas ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:9">Ɛyɛ deɛ odwumfoɔ ne sikadwumfoɔ ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">a wɔde ntoma bibire ne beredum afira no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:9">Ne nyinaa yɛ adwumfoɔ anyansafoɔ nsa ano adwuma.<verse eid="JER 10:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 10:10"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne nokorɛ Onyankopɔn no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">ɔno ne Onyankopɔn teasefoɔ, daapem Ɔhene no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:10">Sɛ ne bo fu a, asase woso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:10">na amanaman no ntumi nnyina nʼabufuhyeɛ ano.<verse eid="JER 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 10:11"/>“Ka yei kyerɛ wɔn: ‘Saa anyame a ɛnyɛ wɔn na wɔyɛɛ ɔsoro ne asase no bɛyera afiri asase so ne ɔsorosoro ase.’ ”<verse eid="JER 10:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 10:12"/>Nanso, Onyankopɔn de ne tumi bɔɔ asase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">ɔtoo ewiase fapem wɔ ne nyansa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:12">na ɔde ne nhunumu trɛɛ ɔsorosoro mu.<verse eid="JER 10:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 10:13"/>Sɛ ɔdwidwa aprannaa a, ɔsorosoro nsuo bobom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">ɔma omununkum ma ne ho so firi nsase ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:13">Ɔde ayerɛmo ka osutɔ ho ba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:13">na ɔgyaa mframa mu firi nʼakoradan mu.<verse eid="JER 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 10:14"/>Onipa biara nnim nyansa, na ɔnni nimdeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">sikadwumfoɔ biara anim gu ase, ɛsiane nʼahoni enti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:14">Ne nsɛsodeɛ yɛ atorɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:14">wɔnni ahomeɛ biara wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="JER 10:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 10:15"/>Wɔn ho nni mfasoɔ, na wɔyɛ aseredeɛ nneɛma.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:15">Sɛ wɔn atemmuo duru so a, wɔbɛyera.<verse eid="JER 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 10:16"/>Deɛ ɔyɛ Yakob Kyɛfa no nte sɛ yeinom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">ɛfiri sɛ ɔno ne adeɛ nyinaa Yɛfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:16">a Israel, abusua a ɛyɛ nʼagyapadeɛ nso ka ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:16">Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din.<verse eid="JER 10:16"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔsɛeɛ A Ɛreba</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 10:17"/>Mommoaboa mo ahodeɛ ano mfiri asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:17">mo a motete nkuro a wɔatua mu.<verse eid="JER 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 10:18"/>Na yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">“Saa ɛberɛ yi mɛto wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">wɔtete asase yi so atwene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:18">mede amanehunu bɛba wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:18">sɛdeɛ wɔbɛfa wɔn nnommum.”<verse eid="JER 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 10:19"/>Me pira yi enti mennue;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">mʼapirakuro yɛ koankorɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:19">Nanso mehyɛɛ me ho den sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:19">“Yei ne me yadeɛ, na ɛsɛ sɛ memia mʼani.”<verse eid="JER 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 10:20"/>Wɔasɛe me ntomadan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">wɔatwitwa ne nhoma nyinaa mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:20">Wɔafa me mma nyinaa kɔ a merenhunu wɔn bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">anka obiara a ɔbɛsi me ntomadan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:20">anaa ɔbɛsiesie me suhyɛ.<verse eid="JER 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 10:21"/>Nnwanhwɛfoɔ no yɛ adwenemherɛfoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">Wɔmmisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akyiri ɛkwan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:21">ɛno enti ɛnsi wɔn yie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:21">na wɔn nnwankuo no abɔ ahwete.<verse eid="JER 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 10:22"/>Montie! Amaneɛ no reba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">basabasayɛ kɛseɛ a ɛfiri atifi fam asase bi so!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:22">Ɛbɛma Yuda nkuro ada mpan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:22">na ayɛ sakraman atuo.<verse eid="JER 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Mpaeɛbɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 10:23"/>Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, menim sɛ, onipa nkwa nyɛ ne dea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:23">na ɛnyɛ onipa na ɔkyerɛkyerɛ nʼanammɔntuo.<verse eid="JER 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 10:24"/>Tene me so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔ tenenee mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">mfiri wʼabofuo mu ntwe mʼaso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:24">anyɛ saa a, mɛwu.<verse eid="JER 10:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 10:25"/>Hwie wʼabufuhyeɛ no gu amanaman</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">a wɔnnye wo ntom no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">nnipa a wɔmmɔ wo din no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 10:25">Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔasɛe Yakob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">wɔasɛe no koraa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 10:25">na wɔasɛe nʼasase a wɔwoo no too so.<verse eid="JER 10:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JER 11"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔabu Apam No So</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 11:1"/>Asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn nie: <verse eid="JER 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 11:2"/>“Tie apam yi mu nhyehyɛeɛ na ka kyerɛ Yudafoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 11:3"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: ‘Nnome nka onipa a ɔnni apam yi mu nhyehyɛeɛ so, <verse eid="JER 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 11:4"/>deɛ mehyɛ maa mo agyanom ɛberɛ a meyii wɔn firii Misraim, fononoo a wɔnane dadeɛ wo mu no.’ Mekaa sɛ, ‘Monyɛ ɔsetie mma me na monyɛ biribiara mehyɛ mo, na mobɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ na mayɛ mo Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="JER 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 11:5"/>Na afei mɛma ntam a mekaa mo agyanom sɛ, mema wɔn asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ resene wɔ so no aba mu,’ asase mote so ɛnnɛ yi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 11:5">Mebuaa sɛ, “Amen, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.”<verse eid="JER 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 11:6"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Bɔ saa asɛm yi ho dawuro wɔ Yuda nkuro ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so sɛ: ‘Montie apam yi ho nhyehyɛeɛ na monni so. <verse eid="JER 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 11:7"/>Ɛfiri ɛberɛ a, meyii mo agyanom firii Misraim bɛsi ɛnnɛ yi, mebɔɔ wɔn kɔkɔ ɛberɛ biara sɛ, “Monyɛ ɔsetie mma me.” <verse eid="JER 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 11:8"/>Nanso, wɔantie na wɔamfa no asɛm; na mmom, wɔdii asoɔden a ɛfiri wɔn akoma bɔne mu akyi. Ɛno enti memaa nnomea a ɛfiri apam a mahyɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnni so na wɔanni so no mu baa wɔn so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 11:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 11:9"/>Na afei <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Atuateɛ apam bi wɔ Yudafoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem ntam. <verse eid="JER 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 11:10"/>Wɔasane kɔ wɔn agyanom a wɔampɛsɛ wɔtie mʼasɛm no, bɔne ho. Wɔadi anyame foforɔ akyi akɔsom wɔn. Yerusalem fiefoɔ ne Yuda fiefoɔ abu apam a me ne wɔn agyanom yɛeɛ no so. <verse eid="JER 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 11:11"/>Ɛno enti deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: ‘Mede amanehunu a wɔrentumi nnwane mfiri mu bɛba wɔn so. Ɛwom sɛ, wɔsufrɛ me deɛ, nanso merennye wɔn so. <verse eid="JER 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 11:12"/>Yuda nkuro ne Yerusalemfoɔ bɛkɔ akɔsu afrɛ anyame a wɔhye nnuhwam ma wɔn no, nanso sɛ amanehunu ba a wɔrentumi mmoa wɔn koraa. <verse eid="JER 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 11:13"/>Ao Yuda, wowɔ anyame a wɔn dodoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ wo nkuro; na afɔrebukyia a moasisi sɛ mobɛhye nnuhwam wɔ so ama animguaseɛ nyame Baal no dɔɔso sɛ Yerusalem mmɔntene.’<verse eid="JER 11:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 11:14"/>“Mmɔ mpaeɛ mma saa nnipa yi, nni mma wɔn na nsrɛ mma wɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, sɛ wɔsu frɛ me wɔ wɔn amanehunu mu a, merennye wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 11:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 11:15"/>“Ɛdeɛn na medɔfo reyɛ wɔ mʼasɔredan mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">ɛberɛ a wayɛ nsɛmmɔne bebree no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">Mpaeɛbɔ ne afɔdeɛ bɛtumi abɔ wʼasotwe no agu anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:15">Sɛ woyɛ wʼamumuyɛsɛm a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:15">na wʼani agye.”<verse eid="JER 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 11:16"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, frɛɛ wo ngo dua a anyini frɔmm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">a ɛso aba a ɛyɛ fɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:16">Nanso ɔde ahum kɛseɛ bi huiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">bɛto mu ogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:16">na ne mman bɛbubu.<verse eid="JER 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 11:17"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔduaa wo no ahyɛ amanehunu ho nkɔm wɔ wo ho, ɛfiri sɛ, Israel fiefoɔ ne Yuda fiefoɔ ayɛ bɔne ahyɛ me abufuo sɛ wɔhye nnuhwam ma Baal.<verse eid="JER 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Tirisopam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 11:18"/>Esiane sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yii ɛpɔ a wɔabɔ kyerɛɛ me no enti, mehunuuɛ, ɛfiri sɛ saa ɛberɛ no ɔde deɛ wɔreyɛ no kyerɛɛ me. <verse eid="JER 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 11:19"/>Meyɛɛ sɛ odwammaa a ɔdwoɔ a wɔde no rekɔ akɔkum no; amma mʼadwene mu sɛ wɔabɔ wɔn tirim po atia me sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:19">“Momma yɛnsɛe dua no ne nʼaba no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">momma yɛntwa no mfiri ateasefoɔ asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:19">sɛdeɛ wɔnnkae ne din bio.”<verse eid="JER 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 11:20"/>Nanso Ao, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo a wobu atɛntenenee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">na wosɔ akoma ne adwene hwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 11:20">ma menhunu wʼaweretɔ wɔ wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 11:20">na wo nsam na mede me nsɛm nyinaa hyɛ.<verse eid="JER 11:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 11:21"/>Ɛno enti deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Anatot mmarimma a wɔrepɛ wo akum wo na wɔka sɛ, “Nhyɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu anyɛ saa a, wobɛwu wɔ yɛn nsa ano,” <verse eid="JER 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 11:22"/>Ɛno enti, deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Mɛtwe wɔn aso. Wɔn mmeranteɛ bɛwuwu akofena ano, na ɛkɔm bɛkunkum wɔn mmammarima ne mmammaa. <verse eid="JER 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 11:23"/>Wɔrennya wɔn nkaeɛfoɔ biara mpo, ɛfiri sɛ mede amanehunu bɛba Anatotfoɔ so wɔ wɔn asotwe afe mu.”<verse eid="JER 11:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JER 12"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Anwiinwii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 12:1"/>Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, sɛ mede asɛm to wʼanim ɛberɛ biara a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">mehunu sɛ wobu atɛntenenee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:1">Ɛno enti, mepɛ sɛ mene wo bɛkasa afa wʼatɛntenenee ho:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Adɛn enti na amumuyɛfoɔ ɛkwan si wɔn yie?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:1">Adɛn enti na wɔn a wɔnni gyidie ho dwo wɔn?<verse eid="JER 12:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 12:2"/>Woadua wɔn, na wɔagye nhini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">wɔnyinyini na wɔso aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:2">Wɔbɔ wo din ɛberɛ biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:2">nanso wɔn akoma mmɛn wo.<verse eid="JER 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 12:3"/>Nanso, wonim me, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">wohunu me, na wosɔ mʼadwene a mewɔ wɔ wo ho hwɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:3">Twe wɔn kɔ sɛ nnwan a wɔrekɔkum wɔn!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:3">Yi wɔn si nkyɛn ma okum da!<verse eid="JER 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 12:4"/>Asase no ntwɛn nkɔsi da bɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">Prama so ɛserɛ no mpo adwan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Esiane sɛ wɔn a wɔte so no yɛ amumuyɛfoɔ enti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">mmoa ne nnomaa a wɔwɔ so awuwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:4">Na nnipa no da so ka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:4">“Ɔrenhunu deɛ ɛba yɛn so.”<verse eid="JER 12:4"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Mmuaeɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 12:5"/>“Sɛ wo ne mmarima tu mmirika</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">na sɛ wɔma wo abrɛ a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na wo ne apɔnkɔ asi mmirikakan?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:5">Sɛ wosunti wɔ asase petee so a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:5">ɛnneɛ wobɛyɛ dɛn wɔ Yordan ho nkyɛkyerɛ mu?<verse eid="JER 12:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 12:6"/>Wo nuammarima, wʼankasa abusuafoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">wɔn mpo ayi wo ama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">wɔteam denden tia wo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:6">Sɛ mpo wɔka wo ho asɛm pa a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:6">mfa wo ho nto wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 12:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 12:7"/>“Magya me nkurɔfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">mato mʼagyapadeɛ agu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:7">mede deɛ medɔ noɔ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:7">bɛhyɛ nʼatamfoɔ nsa.<verse eid="JER 12:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 12:8"/>Mʼagyapadeɛ ayɛ me sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">gyata a ɔwɔ kwaeɛm.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:8">Ɔbobɔ mu gu me so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:8">ɛno enti metane no.<verse eid="JER 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 12:9"/>Mʼagyapadeɛ ayɛ sɛ anomaa a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">nkekaeɛ sisi ne ho a ɔkyere mmoa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">nanso, nnomaa a wɔkyere mmoa atwa ne ho ahyia resosɔ no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:9">Monkɔboaboa nkekaboa nyinaa ano.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:9">Momfa wɔn mmra na wɔnkum wɔn.<verse eid="JER 12:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 12:10"/>Nnwanhwɛfoɔ bebree bɛsɛe me bobeturo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">na wɔatiatia me mfuo so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:10">wɔbɛdane me mfuo fɛfɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:10">ayɛ no asase wesee a ada mpan.<verse eid="JER 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 12:11"/>Ɛbɛyɛ asase a ada mpan a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">awo wesee na ɛda hɔ kwa wɔ mʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:11">asase no nyinaa bɛda mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:11">ɛfiri sɛ obiara nni hɔ a ɔhwɛ soɔ.<verse eid="JER 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 12:12"/>Wɔ nkokoɔ wesee a ɛwɔ anweatam no nyinaa so no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">asɛefoɔ bɛba abɛgu so bebree,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akofena bɛkunkum wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">afiri asase ano de akɔsi ano nohoa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:12">obiara remfa ne ho nni.<verse eid="JER 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 12:13"/>Wɔbɛdua atokoɔ, nso wɔbɛtwa nkasɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">wɔbɛbrɛ wɔn ho, nanso wɔrennya hwee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 12:13">Enti ma wʼani nwu wɔ wo otwa berɛ ho.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 12:13">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuhyeɛ nti.”<verse eid="JER 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 12:14"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Na amumuyɛfoɔ a wɔfa agyapadeɛ a mede maa me nkurɔfoɔ Israelfoɔ no deɛ, mɛtu wɔn afiri wɔn nsase so na mɛtu Yudafie afiri wɔn mu. <verse eid="JER 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 12:15"/>Na sɛ metu wɔn wie a, mɛhunu wɔn mmɔbɔ bio, na mede wɔn mu biara bɛba nʼagyapadeɛ ne nʼasase so. <verse eid="JER 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 12:16"/>Na sɛ wɔsua me nkurɔfoɔ akwan yie na wɔbɔ me din ka ntam sɛ, ‘Nokorɛm sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi’ a, ɛwom sɛ mmerɛ bi wɔkyerɛɛ me nkurɔfoɔ sɛdeɛ wɔde Baal kaa ntam deɛ, nanso wɔn ase bɛtim wɔ me nkurɔfoɔ mu. <verse eid="JER 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 12:17"/>Nanso, sɛ ɔman bi antie a, mɛtu nʼase, na masɛe no korakora,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 12:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JER 13"/>
  <para style="s1">Nwera Abɔsoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 13:1"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ meɛ, “Kɔ na kɔtɔ nwera abɔsoɔ bɔ wʼasene, nanso mma no nka nsuo.” <verse eid="JER 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 13:2"/>Enti, metɔɔ abɔsoɔ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛeɛ no, na mede bɔɔ mʼasene mu.<verse eid="JER 13:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 13:3"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn ne mprenu so sɛ, <verse eid="JER 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 13:4"/>“Fa abɔsoɔ a, wotɔeɛ a ɛbɔ wʼasene mu no, kɔ Eufrate ho seisei ara na fa kɔsie abotan tokuro no bi mu.” <verse eid="JER 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 13:5"/>Enti, mede kɔsiee Eufrate ho, sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me no.<verse eid="JER 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 13:6"/>Nna bebree akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Afei kɔ Eufrate ho na kɔfa abɔsoɔ a meka kyerɛɛ wo sɛ fa kɔsie hɔ no.” <verse eid="JER 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 13:7"/>Enti, mekɔɔ Eufrate ho kɔtuu abɔsoɔ no firii beaeɛ a, na mede asie hɔ no, nanso, na asu atete a ɛho nni mfasoɔ biara.<verse eid="JER 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 13:8"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 13:9"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, ‘Saa ara na mɛsɛe Yuda ahantan ne Yerusalem ahantan kyɛneɛ no. <verse eid="JER 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 13:10"/>Saa amumuyɛfoɔ yi a wɔmpɛ sɛ wɔtie mʼasɛm na wɔdi wɔn akoma den akyi na wɔdi anyame foforɔ akyi som wɔn sɔre wɔn no, wɔbɛyɛ sɛ saa abɔsoɔ yi, na wɔn ho remma mfasoɔ biara! <verse eid="JER 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 13:11"/>Sɛdeɛ abɔsoɔ kyekyere onipa asene mu no saa ara na mede Israel efie ne Yudafie nyinaa bataa me ho sɛ wɔnyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ a wɔbɛma me din so, aka mʼayɛyie na wɔahyɛ me animuonyam, nanso wɔntiee me,’ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nsã Kotokuo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 13:12"/>“Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ nie, Wɔmfa nsã nhyɛ nsã kotokuo biara ma.’ Na sɛ wɔka kyerɛ wo sɛ, ‘Yɛnim sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde nsã hyɛ nsã kotokuo biara ma a,’ <verse eid="JER 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 13:13"/>afei, ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Mede nsãborɔ bɛhyɛ wɔn a wɔtete asase yi so nyinaa ma, a ahemfo a wɔte Dawid ahennwa so, asɔfoɔ, adiyifoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem nyinaa ka ho. <verse eid="JER 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 13:14"/>Mɛtoto wɔn abobɔ wɔn ho wɔn ho, agyanom ne mmammarima nyinaa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. Meremma ahummɔborɔ anaa ayamyɛ anaa ayamhyehyeɛ nsi ɔsɛe a merebɛsɛe wɔn no ho ɛkwan.’ ”<verse eid="JER 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnommumfa Ho Ahunahuna</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 13:15"/>Montie na monyɛ aso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">na monnyɛ ahantan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:15">ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akasa.<verse eid="JER 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 13:16"/>Monhyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn, animuonyam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">ansa na wama esum aduru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">ansa na mo nan asuntisunti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">wɔ nkokoɔ a ɛso reduru sum no so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">Mo ani da hann so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:16">nanso ɔbɛdane no esum kusuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:16">na wɔasesa ayɛ no esum kabisii.<verse eid="JER 13:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 13:17"/>Nanso sɛ moantie a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">mɛsu wɔ kɔkoam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">ɛsiane mo ahantan nti;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:17">mʼani bɛtetɛ nisuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">na nisuo adware me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:17">ɛfiri sɛ, wɔbɛfa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnwankuo no akɔ nnommum mu.<verse eid="JER 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 13:18"/>Monka nkyerɛ ɔhene ne ɔhemmaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">“Momfiri mo ahennwa so nsi fam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:18">na mo animuonyam ahenkyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:18">bɛfiri mo tiri so.”<verse eid="JER 13:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 13:19"/>Wɔbɛtoto Negeb nkuropɔn apono mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">na obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛbuebue.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:19">Wɔbɛsoa Yudafoɔ akɔ sɛ atukɔfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:19">wɔbɛtwa wɔn asuo koraa.<verse eid="JER 13:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 13:20"/>Mo mpagya mo ani nhwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">wɔn a wɔfiri atifi fam reba no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:20">Nnwankuo a wɔde hyɛɛ mo nsa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:20">nnwan a mode wɔn hoahoaa mo ho wɔ he?<verse eid="JER 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 13:21"/>Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de wɔn a motetee wɔn sɛ mo apamfoɔ yɛ mo so atitire a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">ɛdeɛn na mobɛka?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:21">Na ɛrenyɛ mo yea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:21">sɛ ɔbaa a ɔreko awoɔ anaa?<verse eid="JER 13:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 13:22"/>Na sɛ wobɛbisa wo ho sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">“Adɛn enti na yei aba me so” a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:22">na ɛfiri wʼamumuyɛ bebrebe no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">Ɛno enti na wɔatete wo fam atadeɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:22">ayɛ wo onipadua basaa no.<verse eid="JER 13:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 13:23"/>Etiopiani bɛtumi asesa nʼahosuo anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">Na ɔsebɔ nso bɛtumi asesa ne ho nsisimu no?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:23">Saa ara na worentumi nyɛ papa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:23">wo a bɔneyɛ akokwa wo.<verse eid="JER 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 13:24"/>“Mɛbɔ mo ahwete sɛ ntɛtɛ a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:24">anweatam so mframa rebɔ no.<verse eid="JER 13:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 13:25"/>Yei ne deɛ mobɛnya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">mo kyɛfa a mahyɛ ama mo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:25">“ɛfiri sɛ, mo werɛ afiri me</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:25">na mo de mo ho ato anyame huhuo so.<verse eid="JER 13:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 13:26"/>Mɛpagya mo fam ntadeɛ abua mo anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:26">na wɔahunu mo ahohora.<verse eid="JER 13:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 13:27"/>Mahunu mo awaresɛeɛ ne mo akɔnnɔ bɔne ne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">mo adwamammɔ a momfɛre ho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Mahunu mo akyiwadeɛ nneyɛeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">wɔ nkokoɔ ne ɛserɛ so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 13:27">Due Ao Yerusalem!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 13:27">Mmerɛ bɛn na wo ho bɛte?”<verse eid="JER 13:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JER 14"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsuweɛ, Ɛkɔm, Akofena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 14:1"/>Yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔde maa Yeremia a ɛfa nsuweɛ ho:<verse eid="JER 14:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 14:2"/>“Yuda di awerɛhoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">ne nkuropɔn hunu amane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:2">Wɔbɔ asase no ho abubuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:2">na wɔsu wɔ Yerusalem.<verse eid="JER 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 14:3"/>Mmapɔmma soma wɔn asomfoɔ ma wɔkɔpɛ nsuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">wɔkɔhwɛ ankorɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">nanso wɔnnya nsuo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:3">Wɔde wɔn nsuhina sane ba a hwee nni mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">wɔkatakata wɔn tiri so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:3">wɔ abotuo ne abasamutuo mu.<verse eid="JER 14:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 14:4"/>Asase no apaapae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">ɛfiri sɛ osuo ntɔ wɔ asase no so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:4">akuafoɔ no bo atu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:4">na wɔkata wɔn tiri so.<verse eid="JER 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 14:5"/>Mpo ɔforotebereɛ a ɔwɔ ɛserɛ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">gya ne ba a wawo no foforɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:5">ɛfiri sɛ ɛserɛ biara nni hɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 14:6"/>Ɛsrɛ so mfunumu gyinagyina nkokoɔ wesee no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">home sɛ sakraman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:6">wɔkenakena wɔn ani hwehwɛ adidibea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:6">nanso wɔnhunu bi.”<verse eid="JER 14:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 14:7"/>Ɛwom sɛ yɛn amumuyɛ di adanseɛ tia yɛn deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">nanso Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo din enti yɛ ho biribi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:7">Yɛn akyirisane dɔɔso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:7">na yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo.<verse eid="JER 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 14:8"/>Ao, Israel Anidasoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">yɛn Agyenkwa wɔ amanehunu mmerɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:8">adɛn enti na woayɛ sɛ ɔhɔhoɔ wɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:8">te sɛ ɔkwantuni a ɔsoɛ anadwo pɛ?<verse eid="JER 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 14:9"/>Adɛn enti na woayɛ sɛ obi a adeɛ afu ne mu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">te sɛ ɔkofoɔ a ɔnni ahoɔden a ɔde boa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:9">Wowɔ yɛn ntam, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">na wo din da yɛn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:9">nnya yɛn mu!<verse eid="JER 14:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 14:10"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa saa nnipa yi ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">“Wɔn ani gye akyinkyinakyinkyini ho bebree;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">wɔmma wɔn nan nhome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:10">Ɛno enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnye wɔn nto mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">afei ɔbɛkae wɔn amumuyɛsɛm no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:10">na watwe wɔn aso wɔ wɔn bɔne ho.”<verse eid="JER 14:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 14:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Mmɔ yieyɛ ho mpaeɛ mma saa nnipa yi. <verse eid="JER 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 14:12"/>Mmom ɛwom sɛ wɔdi mmuada deɛ, nso merentie wɔn sufrɛ; ɛwom sɛ wɔbɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne aduane afɔdeɛ deɛ, nso merennye. Mmom, mede akofena ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm bɛsɛe wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 14:13"/>Nanso mekaa sɛ, “Ao, Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, adiyifoɔ no ka kyerɛ wɔn daa sɛ, ‘Monnhunu akofena na ɛkɔm remma. Nokorɛm mema mo asomdwoeɛ a ɛbɛtena hɔ daa wɔ ha.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 14:14"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Adiyifoɔ no hyɛ nkɔmtorɔ wɔ me din mu. Mensomaa wɔn mennyii wɔn, na menkasa nkyerɛɛ wɔn. Wɔrehyɛ nkɔm afa atorɔ anisoadehunu, nsumansɛm, abosonsom ne wɔn ankasa nnaadaa adwene ho. <verse eid="JER 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 14:15"/>Ɛno enti, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa adiyifoɔ a wɔde me din hyɛ nkɔm no ho nie: mensomaa wɔn nanso wɔka sɛ, ‘Akofena biara anaa ɛkɔm biara remma asase yi so.’ Saa adiyifoɔ no ara bɛtotɔ akofena ano ne ɛkɔm mu. <verse eid="JER 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 14:16"/>Na nnipa a wɔhyɛ nkɔm kyerɛ wɔn no, wɔbɛtoto wɔn agu Yerusalem mmɔntene so ɛsiane ɛkɔm ne akofena enti. Wɔrenya obiara nsie wɔn, wɔn yerenom, wɔn mmammarima anaa wɔn mmammaa. Mɛma amanehunu a ɛfata wɔn aba wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 14:17"/>“Ka saa asɛm yi kyerɛ wɔn:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">“ ‘ma nisuo nnware me anadwo ne awia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">a ɛtoɔ ntwa da</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:17">ɛfiri sɛ me babaa bunu, me nkurɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">anya apirakuro a ɛyɛ hu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:17">na ɛyɛ ahodwirie mmorosoɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 14:18"/>Sɛ mekɔ ɔman no mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">mehunu nnipa a wɔatotɔ akofena ano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">sɛ mekɔ kuropɔn no mu a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">mehunu ɛkɔm nsunsuansoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:18">Odiyifoɔ ne ɔsɔfoɔ nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:18">kɔ asase a wɔnnim so so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 14:19"/>Woapo Yuda kora anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">Wokyi Sion anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Adɛn enti na wode ɔhaw aba yɛn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">na yɛnnya ayaresa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">Yɛn ani daa asomdwoeɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">nanso ade papa biara mmaeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:19">yɛn ani daa ayaresaberɛ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:19">nanso ehubɔ na ɛbaeɛ.<verse eid="JER 14:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 14:20"/>Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛagye yɛn amumuyɛ ato mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">ne yɛn agyanom afɔdie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:20">nokorɛm yɛayɛ bɔne atia wo.<verse eid="JER 14:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 14:21"/>Na wo din enti mmu yɛn animtia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">nhura wʼanimuonyam ahennwa no ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:21">Kae wo ne yɛn apam no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:21">na mmu so.<verse eid="JER 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 14:22"/>Na amanaman ahoni ahuhuo no mu bi ma osuo tɔ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Anaasɛ ewiem bɛtumi ama obosuo apete?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 14:22">Dabi, ɛyɛ wo, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">Enti wo so na yɛn ani da,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 14:22">yɛretwɛn mmoa afiri wo hɔ.<verse eid="JER 14:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JER 15"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 15:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, “Sɛ mpo, Mose ne Samuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mose ne Samuel. Wɔgyee din ɛfiri sɛ wɔdii ntam maa Israel nnebɔneyɛfoɔ no wɔ Awurade anim. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 32:11-14">2 Mose 32.11-14</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 32:30-34">30-34</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:13-23">4 Mose 14.13-23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 9:18-20">5 Mose 9.18-20</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 9:25-29">25-29</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 7:5-9">1 Sam 7.5-9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 12:19-25">12.19-25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 99:6-8">Nnw 99.6-8</ref></char>).</char></note> bɛgyinaa mʼanim a, mʼakoma rentɔ nkɔ saa nnipa yi so. Ma wɔmfiri mʼani so! Ma wɔnkɔ! <verse eid="JER 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 15:2"/>Na sɛ wɔbisa wo sɛ, ‘Ɛhe na yɛnkorɔ’ a, ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">“ ‘Wɔn a wɔahyɛ owuo ama wɔn no bɛkɔ owuom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">wɔn a wɔahyɛ akofena ama wɔn no bɛtotɔ akofena ano;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">wɔn a wɔahyɛ ɛkɔm ama wɔn no, ɛkɔm bɛde wɔn;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:2">wɔn a wɔahyɛ nnommumfa ama wɔn no bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu.’<verse eid="JER 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 15:3"/>“Mede adesɛefoɔ ahodoɔ ɛnan bɛba wɔn so,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ: “akofena a ɛbɛkum wɔn, nkraman a ɛbɛtwe wɔn ase akɔ, ewiem nnomaa ne asase so mmoa a wɔbɛtete wɔn nam asɛe wɔn. <verse eid="JER 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 15:4"/>Mɛma wɔn ayɛ akyiwadeɛ ama asase so ahennie nyinaa ɛsiane deɛ Yudahene Hesekia babarima Manase yɛɛ wɔ Yerusalem enti.<verse eid="JER 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 15:5"/>“Hwan na ɔbɛhunu wo mmɔbɔ, Ao Yerusalem?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Hwan na ɔbɛgyam wo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:5">Hwan na ɔbɛgyina abisa sɛdeɛ wo ho teɛ?<verse eid="JER 15:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 15:6"/>Woapo me,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">“Wogu akyirisane so ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:6">Ɛno enti mɛtene me nsa wɔ wo so na masɛe wo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:6">Me yam renhyehye me mma wo bio.<verse eid="JER 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 15:7"/>Mede huhusoɔ apaawa bɛhuhu wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">wɔ asase no kuropɔn apono ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:7">Mede owuo ne adesɛeɛ bɛba me nkurɔfoɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:7">ɛfiri sɛ wɔnsesaa wɔn akwan.<verse eid="JER 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 15:8"/>Mɛma wɔn akunafoɔ adɔɔso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">asene mpoano anwea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">Mede ɔsɛefoɔ bɛba owigyinaeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">abɛtia wɔn mmeranteɛ maamenom;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:8">mpofirim mede</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:8">ɔyea ne ehu bɛba wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 15:9"/>Ɔbaatan a wawo nson bɛtɔ baha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">na wagyae mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Nʼawia bɛtɔ ɛberɛ a adeɛ nsaeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">wɔbɛgu nʼanim ase abrɛ no ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:9">Mede nkaeɛfoɔ no bɛma akofena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">wɔ wɔn atamfoɔ anim,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:9">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 15:10"/>Ao, me maame a wowoo me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">anka mewuiɛ a, anka ɛyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">Asase sofoɔ nyinaa ne me ham, di apereapereɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:10">Memfɛm obi adeɛ, na memmɔɔ obi hɔ bosea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:10">nanso obiara dome me.<verse eid="JER 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 15:11"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:11">“Nokorɛm mɛgye wo ama botaeɛ pa bi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">ampa ara mɛma wʼatamfoɔ apa wo kyɛw</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:11">wɔ amanehunu ne ahohia mmerɛ mu.<verse eid="JER 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 15:12"/>“Onipa bɛtumi abu dadeɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:12">dadeɛ a ɛfiri atifi fam, anaa kɔbere?<verse eid="JER 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 15:13"/>“Mede mo ahodeɛ ne mo akoradeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">bɛma sɛ wɔmfom a wɔrentua ka,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:13">ɛsiane mo nnebɔne nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:13">wɔ mo ɔman no mu enti.<verse eid="JER 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 15:14"/>Mede mo bɛyɛ nkoa ama mo atamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">wɔ ɔman a monnim soɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:14">mʼabufuo bɛma ogya adɛre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:14">na ɛbɛhye mo.”<verse eid="JER 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 15:15"/>Wote aseɛ, Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">kae me na hwɛ me so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">Tɔ wɔn a wɔtaa me so awere.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:15">Wowɔ abodwokyerɛ, mma me nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:15">hwɛ sɛdeɛ wo enti wɔbɔ me ahohora.<verse eid="JER 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 15:16"/>Wo nsɛm baeɛ no, mediiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">ɛyɛɛ mʼahosɛpɛ ne mʼakoma apɛdeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:16">na wo din da me so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:16">Ao, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 15:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 15:17"/>Mantena wɔn a wɔgye wɔn ani fekuo mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">Me ne wɔn annye wɔn ani;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:17">metee me ho tenaeɛ, ɛfiri sɛ wo nsa daa me so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:17">na wʼabofuo hyɛɛ me ma.<verse eid="JER 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 15:18"/>Adɛn enti na me yea to ntwa da</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">na mʼapirakuro ayɛ nkudaa a ano yɛ den?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:18">Wopɛ sɛ woyɛ sɛ nnaadaa asuwa ma me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:18">sɛ asutire a ɛweɛ anaa?<verse eid="JER 15:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 15:19"/>Enti sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">“Sɛ wosakyera wʼadwene a, mɛgye wo ato mu bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">na wasom me;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">sɛ nsɛm a ɛdi mu firi wʼanomu, na ɛnyɛ nsɛm huhuo a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">wobɛyɛ me kasamafoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:19">Ma saa nnipa yi nnane mmra wo nkyɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:19">na wo deɛ ɛnsɛ sɛ wodane kɔ wɔn nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 15:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 15:20"/>Mede wo bɛyɛ ɔfasuo ama saa nnipa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">banbɔ ɔfasuo a wɔde kɔbere ato;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">wɔ ne wo bɛdi asie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">nanso wɔrenni wɔ so nkonim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 15:20">ɛfiri sɛ me ne wo wɔ hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">sɛ mɛyi wo na magye wo nkwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:20">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 15:21"/>“Mɛgye wo nkwa afiri amumuyɛfoɔ nsam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 15:21">na mayi wo afiri atirimuɔdenfoɔ nsam.”<verse eid="JER 15:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JER 16"/>
  <para style="s1">Amanehunu Ɛda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 16:1"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ: <verse eid="JER 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 16:2"/>“Ɛnsɛ sɛ wo ware na wowo mmammarima anaa mmammaa wɔ ha.” <verse eid="JER 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 16:3"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa mmammarima ne mmammaa a wɔwo wɔn asase yi so mmaa a wɔyɛ wɔn maamenom ne mmarima a wɔyɛ wɔn agyanom no ho: <verse eid="JER 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 16:4"/>“Owuyareɛ bɛkunkum wɔn. Wɔrensu wɔn na wɔrensie wɔn, mmom wɔbɛyɛ sɛ sumina a ɛgugu fam. Wɔbɛtotɔ akofena ano na ɛkɔm bɛkunkum wɔn na wɔn afunu bɛyɛ aduane ama ewiem nnomaa ne asase so mmoa.”<verse eid="JER 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 16:5"/>“Nhyɛne efie a ayie yɛ apontoɔ wo mu; nkɔsu wɔn abia, na mma wɔn hyɛden, ɛfiri sɛ mayi me nhyira, me dɔ ne mʼahummɔborɔ afiri saa nnipa yi so,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 16:6"/>“Atitire ne mpapahwekwaa bɛwu wɔ asase yi so. Wɔrensie wɔn, na wɔrensu wɔn, na obiara remmɔ ne ho akam, na wɔn enti, obiara renyi ne ti mfa nkae wɔn. <verse eid="JER 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 16:7"/>Obiara remma wɔn a wɔdi awufoɔ no ho awerɛhoɔ no aduane mfa nkyekye wɔn werɛ, owufoɔ no agya anaa ne maame mpo, na obiara mma wɔn nsã nso mfa nkyekye wɔn werɛ.<verse eid="JER 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 16:8"/>“Na nhyɛne efie a apontoɔ kɔ so wɔ mu nkɔtena ase, nnidi na nnom. <verse eid="JER 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 16:9"/>Na yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Otumfoɔ, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ: Wo nkwanna mu a, wʼani tua no, mede ahosɛpɛ ne anigyeɛ nnyegyeɛ, ayeforɔkunu ne ayeforɔyere ahosɛpɛ nne a ɛwɔ ha no, bɛba awieeɛ.<verse eid="JER 16:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 16:10"/>“Sɛ woka yeinom nyinaa kyerɛ saa nnipa yi na wɔbisa wo sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abɔ mmɔm a ɛyɛ hu sei atia yɛn? Ɛdeɛn mfomsoɔ na yɛayɛ? Bɔne bɛn na yɛayɛ atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn’ a, <verse eid="JER 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 16:11"/>ɛnneɛ ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Ɛfiri sɛ mo agyanom gyaa me hɔ kɔdii anyame foforɔ akyi, kɔsom wɔn sɔree wɔn, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm nie. Wogyaa me na wɔanni me mmara so. <verse eid="JER 16:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 16:12"/>Na mo deɛ, moayɛ amumuyɛsɛm asene mo agyanom. Monhwɛ sɛdeɛ mo mu biara di nʼakoma bɔne asoɔden akyi wɔ ɛberɛ a anka ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ɔsetie ma me. <verse eid="JER 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 16:13"/>Ɛno enti, mɛtu mo afiri saa asase yi so de mo akɔ asase a, mo anaa sɛ mo agyanom nnim so, na ɛhɔ mobɛsom anyame foforɔ awia ne anadwo, na merenhunu mo mmɔbɔ.’<verse eid="JER 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 16:14"/>“Nanso nna no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “a nnipa renka bio sɛ, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, deɛ ɔyii Israelfoɔ firii Misraim,’ <verse eid="JER 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 16:15"/>mmom wɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi deɛ ɔyii Israelfoɔ firii atifi fam asase ne aman a ɔtuu wɔn kɔɔ so nyinaa.’ Ɛfiri sɛ mɛsane de wɔn aba asase a mede maa wɔn tete agyanom no so.<verse eid="JER 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 16:16"/>“Na seesei, mɛsoma apofofoɔ bebree a wɔbɛkyere wɔn.” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. “Ɛno akyi, mɛsoma akɔfa abɔmmɔfoɔ bebree a wɔbɛtaataa wɔn wɔ mmepɔ ne nkokoɔ nyinaa so ne abotan ntokuro mu. <verse eid="JER 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 16:17"/>Mʼani tua wɔn akwan nyinaa; ɛnsumaa me, na wɔn bɔne nso nhintaeɛ wɔ mʼani so. <verse eid="JER 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 16:18"/>Mɛtua wɔn amumuyɛ ne wɔn bɔne so ka mprenu, ɛfiri sɛ wɔde aniwudeɛ nsɛsodeɛ a ɛnni nkwa ne wɔn ahoni a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ abɛhyɛ mʼagyapadeɛ so ma de agu mʼasase ho fi.”<verse eid="JER 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 16:19"/>Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mʼahoɔden ne mʼaban,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">mʼahohia mu dwanekɔbea,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">wo nkyɛn na amanaman no bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">wɔbɛfiri nsase ano aka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:19">“Yɛn agyanom annya biribiara sɛ anyame huhuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:19">ahoni a wɔn ho nni mfasoɔ na wɔammoa wɔn.<verse eid="JER 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 16:20"/>Nnipa yɛ wɔn ankasa anyame anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:20">Aane, nanso wɔnyɛ nokorɛ anyame!”<verse eid="JER 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 16:21"/>“Ɛno enti mɛkyerɛkyerɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">saa ɛberɛ yi deɛ mɛkyerɛ wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">me tumi ne mʼahoɔden.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 16:21">Afei wɔbɛhunu sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 16:21">me din ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="JER 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JER 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JER 17"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 17:1"/>“Wɔde dadeɛ twerɛdua akrukyire Yuda bɔne,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">dadeɛ twerɛdua a ano te sɛ twerɛboɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:1">wɔ wɔn akoma apono so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:1">ne wɔn afɔrebukyia mmɛn so.<verse eid="JER 17:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 17:2"/>Mpo, wɔn mma kae</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">wɔn afɔrebukyia ne Asera afɔrebukyia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:2">a ɛwɔ nnua a adendan no nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:2">ne nkokoɔ atentene no so.<verse eid="JER 17:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 17:3"/>Me mmepɔ a ɛwɔ asase no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ne mo ahonyadeɛ ne mo akoradeɛ nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:3">mede bɛma sɛ afodeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ɛne mo sorɔnsorɔmmea nso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:3">ɛsiane mo ɔman no so bɔne enti.<verse eid="JER 17:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 17:4"/>Mo ankasa mfomsoɔ enti, mobɛhwere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">agyapadeɛ<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">agyapadeɛ—Kanaan asase.</char></note> a mede maa mo no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">Mede mo bɛyɛ nkoa ama mo atamfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">wɔ asase a monnim soɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:4">ɛfiri sɛ moahwanyane mʼabufuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:4">na ɛbɛtena hɔ daa.”<verse eid="JER 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 17:5"/>Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:5">“Nnome nka deɛ ɔde ne ho to onipa so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">deɛ ɔde ne ho to ɔhonam so pɛ nʼahoɔden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:5">na nʼakoma dane firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ho.<verse eid="JER 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 17:6"/>Ɔbɛyɛ sɛ wira a ɛwɔ nsase tamaa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">sɛ yiedie ba a, ɔrenhunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:6">ɔbɛtena anweatam a awoɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:6">ne nkyene asase a obi nte soɔ so.<verse eid="JER 17:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 17:7"/>“Nhyira nka onipa a ɔde ne ho to <char style="nd">Awurade</char> so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:7">na nʼanidasoɔ wɔ ne mu.<verse eid="JER 17:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 17:8"/>Ɔbɛyɛ sɛ dua a wɔadua no nsuo ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">na ne nhini tene kɔ nsuo no mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Sɛ ahuhuro ba a, ɔnsuro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">ne nhahan yɛ frɔmm mmerɛ nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:8">Ɔnni ɔhaw biara wɔ afe a osuo ntɔ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:8">na ɛkɔ so so aba daa.”<verse eid="JER 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 17:9"/>Akoma yɛ nnaadaa sen adeɛ nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">na ano nni aduro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:9">Hwan na ɔbɛte nʼase?<verse eid="JER 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 17:10"/>“Me <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mepɛɛpɛɛ akoma mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">na mehwehwɛ adwene mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:10">gyina so de tua onipa ka sɛdeɛ nʼabrabɔ teɛ.”<verse eid="JER 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 17:11"/>Sɛdeɛ akokɔhwedeɛ a ɔhwane nkosua a ɛnyɛ ɔno na ɔtoeɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">saa ara na onipa a ɔnya sika a ɔmfa ɛkwan pa so teɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:11">Sɛ wɔbu ne nkwa nna mu mmienu a wɔbɛgya no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:11">na awieeɛ no, ne kwasea bɛda adi.<verse eid="JER 17:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 17:12"/>Animuonyam ahennwa a ɛsi kronkronbea hɔ no firi ahyɛaseɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:12">ɛhɔ na yɛsom.<verse eid="JER 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 17:13"/>Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel anidasoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">wɔn a wɔpa wʼakyi nyinaa ani bɛwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:13">Wɔn a wɔtwe wɔn ho firi wo ho no, wɔbɛsie wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">ɛfiri sɛ wɔagya <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:13">a ɔyɛ nkwa asutire.<verse eid="JER 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 17:14"/>Sa me yadeɛ Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na me ho bɛtɔ me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">gye me na mɛnya nkwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:14">na wo ne ɔbaako a mekamfo wo.<verse eid="JER 17:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 17:15"/>Wɔbisa me daa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">“Ɛhe na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm no wɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:15">Ma ɛmmra mu seesei!”<verse eid="JER 17:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 17:16"/>Mennwane mfirii mʼadwuma sɛ wo dwanhwɛfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">wonim sɛ mempɛɛ abasamutuo da.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:16">Deɛ ɛfiri mʼanom yɛ pefee wɔ wʼanim.<verse eid="JER 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 17:17"/>Nhunahuna me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:17">wo ne me dwanekɔbea wɔ amanehunu da.<verse eid="JER 17:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 17:18"/>Ma wɔn a wɔtaa me anim nguase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">na yi me firi ahohora mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Ma wɔn mmɔ hu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">nanso mma me bo ntu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 17:18">Ma amanehunu da no mmra wɔn so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 17:18">fa ɔhawprenu sɛe wɔn.<verse eid="JER 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Monyɛ Homeda No Kronkron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 17:19"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me, “Kɔ na kɔgyina nnipa no ɛpono a Yuda ahemfo di hɔ ahyɛnfirie no; kɔgyina Yerusalem apono a aka no nso ano. <verse eid="JER 17:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 17:20"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Ao Yuda ahemfo ne Yudafoɔ nyinaa ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem a wɔfa saa apono yi mu. <verse eid="JER 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 17:21"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Monhwɛ yie na moansoa nnesoa Homeda anaa moamfa amfa Yerusalem apono mu. <verse eid="JER 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 17:22"/>Monnsoa adesoa mfiri mo afie mu na monnyɛ adwuma biara Homeda, na mmom monyɛ Homeda no kronkron, sɛdeɛ mehyɛɛ mo agyanom no. <verse eid="JER 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 17:23"/>Nanso wɔantie na wɔammu; wɔyɛɛ asoɔden, wɔantie na wɔampɛ ntenesoɔ. <verse eid="JER 17:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 17:24"/>Nanso sɛ mohwɛ yie na moyɛ ɔsetie ma me a, na moamfa nnesoa amfa saa kuropɔn yi apono mu Homeda, na sɛ moyɛ Homeda no kronkron a monnyɛ adwuma biara a, <verse eid="JER 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 17:25"/>ɛnneɛ ahemfo a wɔte Dawid ahennwa so ne wɔn adwumayɛfoɔ bɛfa saa apono yi mu. Wɔn nyinaa bɛba a wɔtete nteaseɛnam mu ne apɔnkɔ so, a Yuda mmarima ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem ka ho, na nnipa bɛtena kuropɔn yi mu daa nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 17:26"/>Nnipa bɛfiri Yuda nkuro ne nkuraase a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia no aba. Wɔbɛfiri Benyamin asase ne atɔeɛ fam nkokoɔ so. Wɔbɛfiri mmepɔ mantam ne Negeb aba a wɔde ɔhyeɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ ne afɔrebɔ, aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ, nnuhwam ne aseda afɔrebɔdeɛ reba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie. <verse eid="JER 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 17:27"/>Nanso, sɛ moanyɛ ɔsetie amma me, anyɛ Homeda no kronkron, na sɛ mosoa adesoa biara fa Yerusalem apono mu Homeda a, ɛnneɛ mɛsɔ ogya a ɛrennum da wɔ Yerusalem apono mu na abɛhye nʼaban hodoɔ’, sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.”<verse eid="JER 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JER 18"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔnwomfoɔ No Fie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 18:1"/>Yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɛbaa Yeremia nkyɛn. <verse eid="JER 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 18:2"/>“Kɔ ɔnwomfoɔ no efie, na ɛhɔ na mede mʼasɛm no bɛma wo.” <verse eid="JER 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 18:3"/>Ɛno enti, mekɔɔ ɔnwomfoɔ no efie na mehunuu no sɛ, ɔreyɛ adwuma wɔ ne ntwahodeɛ so. <verse eid="JER 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 18:4"/>Nanso kukuo a na ɔde dɔteɛ no reyɛ ho adwuma no sɛeɛ wɔ ne nsa mu; ɛno enti ɔnwomfoɔ no yɛɛ kukuo foforɔ, sɛdeɛ ɛyɛ pa ara ma no.<verse eid="JER 18:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 18:5"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ: <verse eid="JER 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 18:6"/>“Ao, Israel fiefoɔ, merentumi nyɛ mo sɛdeɛ ɔnwomfoɔ yi yɛ anaa?” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. “Sɛdeɛ dɔteɛ teɛ wɔ ɔnwomfoɔ nsa mu no, saa ara na moteɛ wɔ me nsa mu, Ao Israel fiefoɔ. <verse eid="JER 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 18:7"/>Sɛ ɛberɛ biara meka sɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtutu ɔman bi anaa ahennie bi ase, dwerɛ wɔn, sɛe wɔn a, <verse eid="JER 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 18:8"/>na sɛ ɔman a mebɔɔ no kɔkɔ no sakra firi ne bɔne ho a, mɛsesa mʼadwene na meremfa amanehunu a mesusuiɛ sɛ me de bɛba wɔn so mma bio. <verse eid="JER 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 18:9"/>Na sɛ mmerɛ foforɔ bi meka sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkyekyere ɔman anaa ahennie bi gye no si hɔ, <verse eid="JER 18:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 18:10"/>na sɛ ɔyɛ bɔne wɔ mʼani so na wanyɛ ɔsetie amma me a, ɛnneɛ mesane adwene papa a mepɛɛ sɛ meyɛ noɔ no ho.<verse eid="JER 18:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 18:11"/>“Na afei ka kyerɛ Yudafoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Hwɛ! Mede amanehunu reba mo so, na mereyɛ nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛtia mo. Ɛno enti mo mu biara nnane mfiri nʼakwammɔne so na monsiesie mo akwan ne mo nneyɛɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 18:12"/>Nanso wɔbɛbua sɛ, ‘Ɛho nni mfasoɔ. Yɛbɛkɔ so adi yɛn ara yɛn nhyehyɛeɛ so; yɛn mu biara bɛyɛ asoɔden a ɛfiri nʼakoma bɔne mu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 18:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 18:13"/>Ɛno enti deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">“Mommisa wɔ amanaman no mu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">hwan na wate biribi sɛi pɛn?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:13">Ɔbaabunu Israel ayɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:13">adeɛ bi a ɛyɛ hu yie.<verse eid="JER 18:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 18:14"/>Sukyerɛmma a ɛwɔ Lebanon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lebanon—Ɛyɛ mmepɔ atentene a ɛwɔ atifi fam no mu baako a ne ɔsorokɔ boro anammɔn ɔpedu.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">nane firi nsaneɛ mu abotan no so anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:14">Nsuo wiridudu a nʼatifi wɔ akyirikyiri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:14">gyae sene anaa?<verse eid="JER 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 18:15"/>Nanso, me nkurɔfoɔ werɛ afiri me.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">Wɔhye nnuhwam ma ahoni huhuo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">a ɛma wɔn suntisunti wɔ wɔn akwan so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ne tete atempɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:15">Wɔma wɔfa akwan nkyɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:15">ne akwan a wɔmmɔeɛ so.<verse eid="JER 18:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 18:16"/>Wɔn asase bɛda mpan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">na ayɛ adeɛ a wɔbɛbu no animtia daa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:16">wɔn a wɔtwam hɔ no ho bɛdwiri wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:16">na wɔbɛwosowoso wɔn ti.<verse eid="JER 18:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 18:17"/>Mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete wɔ wɔn atamfoɔ anim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">te sɛ deɛ apueeɛ mframa yɛ no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:17">Mɛdane mʼakyi akyerɛ wɔn, na ɛnyɛ mʼanim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:17">wɔ wɔn amanehunu da no.”<verse eid="JER 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 18:18"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “Mommra mma yɛmfa adwene ntia Yeremia; yɛremma asɔfoɔ no anaa anyansafoɔ no anaa adiyifoɔ no nkyerɛkyerɛ no nyera. Mommra na yɛntu yɛn ano ngu ne so a yɛnntie deɛ ɔbɛka biara.”<verse eid="JER 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 18:19"/>Yɛ aso ma me, Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:19">tie deɛ wɔn a wɔpam me tiri so reka!<verse eid="JER 18:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 18:20"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde bɔne tua papa so ka anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">Nanso wɔatu amena ama me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:20">Kae sɛ megyinaa wʼanim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">na mekasa maa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:20">sɛdeɛ wobɛyi wʼabufuhyeɛ afiri wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 18:21"/>Ɛno enti, ma ɛkɔm nne wɔn mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">yi wɔn ma akofena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:21">Ma wɔn yerenom nyɛ abonini ne akunafoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">ma wɔnkunkum wɔn mmarima</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:21">na wɔmfa akofena nkunkum wɔn mmeranteɛ wɔ ɔko mu.<verse eid="JER 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 18:22"/>Ma wɔnte osu wɔ wɔn afie mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">ɛberɛ a atamfoɔ atu wɔn so sa mpofirim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:22">ɛfiri sɛ, wɔatu amena ama me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:22">na wɔasumsum me nan mfidie.<verse eid="JER 18:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 18:23"/>Nanso wonim Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">ɛpɔ a wɔabɔ nyinaa sɛ wɔbɛkum me.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Mfa wɔn nsɛmmɔne nkyɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">na nyi wʼani mfiri wɔn bɔne so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 18:23">Ma wɔnni nkoguo wɔ wʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 18:23">na wo ne wɔn nni wɔ wʼabofuo mu.<verse eid="JER 18:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JER 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 19:1"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: “Kɔ na kɔtɔ dɔteɛ kuruwa firi ɔnwomfoɔ nkyɛn. Fa nnipa no mpanimfoɔ no mu bi ne asɔfoɔ no mu bi ka wo ho <verse eid="JER 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 19:2"/>na firi adi kɔ Ben Hinom Bɔnhwa a ɛbɛn Pɔthɛd Ɛpono ano no. Ɛhɔ na pae mu ka nsɛm a meka kyerɛ wo no, <verse eid="JER 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 19:3"/>sɛ, ‘Montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Ao Yuda ahemfo ne Yerusalemfoɔ. Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: Montie, mede amanehunu reba ha, na obiara a ɔbɛte no aso mu bɛyɛ no yɔnn. <verse eid="JER 19:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 19:4"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔagya me na wɔde ha ama ananafoɔ anyame; wɔahye afɔrebɔdeɛ wɔ so ama anyame a wɔn anaa wɔn agyanom, anaa Yuda ahemfo nhunuu wɔn da, na wɔde mogya a ɛdi bem ahyɛ ha ma. <verse eid="JER 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 19:5"/>Wɔasisi Baal sorɔnsorɔmmea sɛ wɔde ogya bɛhye wɔn mmammarima sɛ afɔrebɔdeɛ ama Baal, adeɛ a manhyɛ anaa mammɔ so, anaa amma mʼadwene mu. <verse eid="JER 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 19:6"/>Ɛno enti, monhwɛ yie na nna bi reba, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, a nnipa remfrɛ ha sɛ Tofet anaa Ben Hinom Bɔnhwa bio, na mmom, Okum Bɔnhwa.<verse eid="JER 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 19:7"/>“ ‘Mɛsɛe Yuda ne Yerusalem nhyehyɛeɛ wɔ ha. Mɛma wɔatotɔ wɔ akofena ano wɔ wɔn atamfoɔ a wɔrepɛ wɔn nkwa no anim, na mede wɔn afunu bɛma ewiem nnomaa ne asase so mmoa sɛ wɔn aduane. <verse eid="JER 19:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 19:8"/>Mɛsɛe saa kuropɔn yi na mayɛ no animtiabudeɛ; wɔn a wɔtwam hɔ no nyinaa ho bɛdwiri wɔn, na nʼapirakuro no enti wɔbɛdi ne ho fɛw. <verse eid="JER 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 19:9"/>Mɛma wɔawe wɔn mmammarima ne wɔn mmammaa nam, na wɔbɛfiri ahohia a atamfoɔ a wɔrepɛ wɔn nkwa no tua de bɛba wɔn so no mu awe wɔn ho wɔn ho nam.’<verse eid="JER 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 19:10"/>“Afei, bɔ kuruwa no wɔ wɔn a wɔka wo ho no anim ma wɔnhwɛ, <verse eid="JER 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 19:11"/>na ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Mɛbɔ saa ɔman yi ne kuropɔn yi sɛdeɛ wɔabɔ ɔnwomfoɔ kuruwa yi a wɔrentumi nsiesie bio. Wɔbɛsie awufoɔ wɔ Tofet kɔsi sɛ, ɛhɔ bɛyɛ ma. <verse eid="JER 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 19:12"/>Sei ara na mɛyɛ saa beaeɛ yi ne wɔn a wɔtete so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. Mɛyɛ kuropɔn yi sɛ Tofet. <verse eid="JER 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 19:13"/>Afie a ɛwɔ Yerusalem ne Yuda ahemfo ahemfie ho bɛgu fi te sɛ Tofet ha. Afie a, wɔhyee nnuhwam wɔ adan atifi maa ɔsoro asafo nyinaa na wɔguu nsã maa anyame foforɔ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 19:14"/>Afei Yeremia sane firii Tofet, baabi a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa no sɛ ɔnkɔhyɛ nkɔm hɔ no baeɛ, na ɔbɛgyinaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan abangua mu na ɔka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa sɛ, <verse eid="JER 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 19:15"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ, ‘Montie! Mede amanehunu a meka guu kuropɔn yi ne ɛho nkuraase no nyinaa so no bɛba wɔn so, ɛfiri sɛ wɔyɛɛ kɔnsenee na wɔantie me nsɛm.’ ”<verse eid="JER 19:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JER 20"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Ne Pashur</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 20:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Imer a ɔyɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu adwumayɛfoɔ so panin babarima ɔsɔfoɔ Pashur tee sɛ Yeremia rehyɛ nkɔm fa saa nneɛma yi ho no, <verse eid="JER 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 20:2"/>ɔmaa wɔboroo Yeremia, na wɔbɔɔ no dua mu wɔ Benyamin Atifi Ɛpono a ɛwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no mu hɔ. <verse eid="JER 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 20:3"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ a, Pashur sanee no no, Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> din a ɔde ama wo no nyɛ Pashur na mmom Magormisabib. <verse eid="JER 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 20:4"/>Na sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Mɛma wo ho ayɛ hu ama wʼankasa ne wo nnamfonom nyinaa, wʼankasa de wʼani bɛhunu sɛ wɔtotɔ wɔ wɔn atamfoɔ akofena ano. Mede Yuda nyinaa bɛma Babiloniahene na wasoa wɔn akɔ Babilonia anaasɛ ɔde akofena bɛkunkum wɔn. <verse eid="JER 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 20:5"/>Mede kuropɔn yi ahodeɛ nyinaa bɛma wɔn atamfoɔ; nʼadwumayɛ so aba, ne nneɛma a ɛsom bo ne Yuda ahemfo akoradeɛ nyinaa. Wɔbɛfa no sɛ afodeɛ akɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 20:6"/>Na wo Pashur, ne wo fiefoɔ nyinaa bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu wɔ Babilonia. Ɛhɔ na wo ne wo nnamfonom a wohyɛɛ wɔn nkɔmtorɔ no nyinaa bɛwuwu na wɔasie mo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 20:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Anwiinwii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 20:7"/>Ao, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woadaadaa me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">na mapene so ama woadaadaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:7">Wɔtwee me da mu nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:7">na obiara sere me.<verse eid="JER 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 20:8"/>Ɛberɛ biara a mɛkasa no, meteam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">pae mu ka akakabensɛm ne ɔsɛeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:8">Enti <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm de ahohora ne nsopa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:8">abrɛ me da mu nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 20:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 20:9"/>Sɛ meka sɛ, “Meremmɔ ne din</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">anaa merenkasa wɔ ne din mu” a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">nʼasɛm te sɛ ogya wɔ mʼakoma mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">ogya a wɔde ahyɛ me nnompe mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:9">Mede ahyɛ me mu abrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:9">nokorɛm, merentumi.<verse eid="JER 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 20:10"/>Mete asomusɛm bebree sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">“Ehu wɔ baabiara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">Montoa no! Momma yɛnkɔtoa no!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">Me nnamfonom nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">retwɛn sɛ mɛwatiri, na wɔka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:10">“Ebia wɔbɛdaadaa no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">na yɛatumi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:10">atɔ ne so were.”<verse eid="JER 20:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 20:11"/>Nanso, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka me ho sɛ dɔmmarima;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">enti mʼataafoɔ bɛsuntisunti na wɔrentumi nnyina.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:11">Wɔbɛdi nkoguo na wɔn anim bɛgu ase pasaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:11">wɔn werɛ remfiri wɔn nsopa no da.<verse eid="JER 20:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 20:12"/>Ao, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>! Wo a wɔsɔ ɔteneneeni hwɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">na wopɛɛpɛɛ akoma ne adwene mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:12">ma menhunu wʼaweretɔ wɔ wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:12">ɛfiri sɛ mede mʼasɛm dane wo.<verse eid="JER 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 20:13"/>Monto dwom mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">Monyi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:13">Ɔgye ohiani nkwa firi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:13">amumuyɛfoɔ nsam.<verse eid="JER 20:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 20:14"/>Nnome nka da a wɔwoo me!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:14">Nhyira mpare ɛda a me maame woo me.<verse eid="JER 20:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 20:15"/>Nnome nka onipa a ɔbɛbɔɔ mʼagya kaseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">deɛ ɔmaa nʼani gyeeɛ, na ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:15">“Wɔawo ɔbabarima ama wo!”<verse eid="JER 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 20:16"/>Ma saa onipa no nyɛ sɛ nkuro a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> tuguiɛ a wannya ahummɔborɔ no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 20:16">Ma ɔnte osu anɔpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:16">ne ɔko owigyinaeɛ.<verse eid="JER 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 20:17"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wankum me wɔ awotwaa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:17">amma me maame anyɛ damena amma me.<verse eid="JER 20:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 20:18"/>Adɛn koraa na mefirii awotwaa mu pueɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">bɛhunuu ɔhaw ne awerɛhoɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 20:18">na mede aniwuo rebɛwie me nkwa nna yi?<verse eid="JER 20:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JER 21"/>
  <para style="s1">Awurade Po Sedekia Abisadeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 21:1"/>Asɛm firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn ɛberɛ a, ɔhene Sedekia somaa Malkia babarima Pashur ne Maaseia babarima ɔsɔfoɔ Sefania kɔɔ ne nkyɛn. Wɔkaa sɛ, <verse eid="JER 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 21:2"/>“Bisa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ma yɛn ɛfiri sɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne yɛn rebɛdi ako. Ebia <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ anwanwadeɛ ama yɛn, sɛdeɛ ɔyɛɛ mmerɛ bi a atwam no na wafiri yɛn so akɔ.”<verse eid="JER 21:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 21:3"/>Na Yeremia buaa wɔn sɛ, “Monka nkyerɛ Sedekia sɛ, <verse eid="JER 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 21:4"/>‘Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ nie: Merebɛdane mo nsam akodeɛ atia mo, deɛ mode reko atia Babiloniahene ne Babiloniafoɔ a wɔwɔ ɔfasuo no akyi na wɔatua mo kuropɔn no. Mɛboa wɔn ano wɔ kuropɔn yi mu. <verse eid="JER 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 21:5"/>Me ara mede nsa a matene ne abasa a ɛyɛ den bɛko atia mo wɔ abufuo, anibereɛ ne abufuhyeɛ mu. <verse eid="JER 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 21:6"/>Mɛbobɔ wɔn a wɔtete kuropɔn yi mu ahwehwe fam; nnipa ne mmoa nyinaa, na ɔyaredɔm a ɛyɛ hu bɛkunkum wɔn. <verse eid="JER 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 21:7"/>Ɛno akyi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm nie, mede Yudahene Sedekia, nʼadwumayɛfoɔ ne nnipa a wɔwɔ kuropɔn yi mu a ɔyaredɔm, akofena ne ɛkɔm ankunkum wɔn no bɛma Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne wɔn atamfoɔ wɔrepɛ wɔn nkwa no. Ɔde akofena bɛkunkum wɔn; ɔrenhunu wɔn mmɔbɔ na ɔrennya ayamhyehyeɛ mma wɔn.’<verse eid="JER 21:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 21:8"/>“Ɛbio, ka kyerɛ nnipa no sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Hwɛ mede nkwa ɛkwan ne owuo ɛkwan resi mo anim. <verse eid="JER 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 21:9"/>Obiara a ɔte saa kuropɔn yi mu bɛwu wɔ akofena anaa ɛkɔm anaa ɔyaredɔm ano. Nanso obiara ɔbɛpue na ɔde ne ho akɔma Babiloniafoɔ a wɔabɛtua mo kuropɔn yi no, bɛfa ne ho adi. <verse eid="JER 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 21:10"/>Mawe ahinam sɛ, mɛyɛ kuropɔn yi bɔne na ɛnyɛ papa, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. Wɔde bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na ɔde ogya bɛhye no.’<verse eid="JER 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 21:11"/>“Deɛ ɛka ho ne sɛ, ka kyerɛ Yuda adehyefie sɛ, ‘Montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm; <verse eid="JER 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 21:12"/>Ao Dawid efie, sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">“ ‘Mommu atɛntenenee anɔpa biara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">monnye deɛ wɔabɔ no korɔno no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">mfiri ne nhyɛsofoɔ nsam,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:12">anyɛ saa a mʼabufuhyeɛ bɛsɔre na ahye sɛ ogya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">ɛsiane bɔne a moayɛ enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:12">ɛbɛhye a obiara rennum no.<verse eid="JER 21:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 21:13"/>Me ne mo anya, Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Mo a mote bɔnhwa yi atifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">abotan asaseta soɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:13">mo a moka sɛ, “Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ako atia yɛn?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:13">Hwan na ɔbɛtumi ahyɛne yɛn hintabea?”<verse eid="JER 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 21:14"/>Mɛtwe mo aso sɛdeɛ ɛfata mo nneyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 21:14">Mɛto mo kwaeɛ mu ogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 21:14">a ɛbɛhye biribiara a atwa mo ho ahyia.’ ”<verse eid="JER 21:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JER 22"/>
  <para style="s1">Atemmuo A Ɛtia Ahemfo Amumuyɛfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 22:1"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, “Siane kɔ Yudahene ahemfie na kɔpae mu ka saa asɛm yi: <verse eid="JER 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 22:2"/>‘Tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Ao, Yudahene, wo a wote Dawid ahennwa so, wo, wʼadwumayɛfoɔ ne wo nkurɔfoɔ a wɔfa apono yi mu. <verse eid="JER 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 22:3"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Monyɛ deɛ ɛtene na ɛda ɛkwan mu. Monnye deɛ wɔabɔ no korɔno mfiri ne hyɛsofoɔ nsam. Monnyɛ ɔhɔhoɔ, awisiaa ne okunafoɔ bɔne na monnyɛ wɔn basabasa nso, na monnhwie mogya a ɛdi bem ngu wɔ ha. <verse eid="JER 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 22:4"/>Sɛ moyɛ ahwɛyie na modi saa ahyɛdeɛ yi so a, ɛnneɛ ahemfo a wɔte Dawid ahennwa so ne wɔn adwumayɛfoɔ ne wɔn nkurɔfoɔ bɛfa saa ahemfie apono yi mu, a wɔtete nteaseɛnam mu ne apɔnkɔ so. <verse eid="JER 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 22:5"/>Enti sɛ moanni saa nhyehyɛeɛ yi so a, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, Meka me ho ntam sɛ, saa ahemfie yi bɛdane fituo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 22:6"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Yudahene ahemfie ho nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">“Ɛwom sɛ medɔ wo te sɛ Gilead</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">na wote sɛ Lebanon mmepɔ atifi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:6">nanso, mɛyɛ wo sɛ anweatam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:6">sɛ nkuro a obiara nte mu.<verse eid="JER 22:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 22:7"/>Mɛsoma asɛefoɔ abɛtoa mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">obiara ne nʼakodeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:7">wɔbɛtwitwa mo ntweneduro mpunan fɛfɛ no mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:7">na wɔato agu ogya no mu.<verse eid="JER 22:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 22:8"/>“Nnipa a wɔfifiri aman bebree so bɛtwam wɔ kuropɔn yi so, na wɔbɛbisabisa wɔn ho wɔn ho sɛ, ‘Adɛn enti na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayɛ saa kuropɔn kɛseɛ yi sei?’ <verse eid="JER 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 22:9"/>Na mmuaeɛ no bɛyɛ sɛ, ‘Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔagya <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn apam no akɔsɔre anyame foforɔ asom wɔn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 22:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 22:10"/>Monnsu ɔhene a wafiri mu, na monni ne ho awerɛhoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">mmom, monsu denden mma deɛ ɔkɔ nnommumfa mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:10">ɛfiri sɛ ɔrensane nʼakyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:10">na ɔrenhunu asase a wɔwoo no wɔ so no bio.<verse eid="JER 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 22:11"/>Na yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka faa Yosia babarima Salum a ɔdii nʼagya adeɛ sɛ Yudahene na wafiri ha no ho: “Ɔrensane mma bio. <verse eid="JER 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 22:12"/>Ɔbɛwu wɔ baabi a wɔafa no nnommum akɔ hɔ; na ɔrenhunu saa asase yi bio.”<verse eid="JER 22:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 22:13"/>“Nnome nka deɛ ɔmfa ɛkwan tenenee so nsi nʼahemfie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">na ɔde nsisie si nʼabansoro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:13">Nnome nka deɛ ɔma ne ɔmanfoɔ yɛ adwuma kwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:13">na ɔntua wɔn apaadie so ka.<verse eid="JER 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 22:14"/>Ɔka sɛ, ‘Mɛsi ahemfie kɛseɛ ama me ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">deɛ ɛwɔ abansoro adan a emu soso.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:14">Enti ɔyɛ mpomma akɛseɛ wɔ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">ɔde ntweneduro dura mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:14">na ɔde ahosu kɔkɔɔ hyehyɛ mu.<verse eid="JER 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 22:15"/>“Wowɔ ntweneduro bebree a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">na ɛma woyɛ ɔhene anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:15">Na wʼagya nni aduane ne nsã anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">Ɔyɛɛ deɛ ɛfa ne ɛkwan mu na ɛtene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:15">enti ɛsii no yie.<verse eid="JER 22:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 22:16"/>Ɔdii mmɔborɔni ne ohiani asɛm maa wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">enti biribiara yɛɛ yie maa no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:16">Na ɛnyɛ yei na ɛkyerɛ sɛ obi nim me anaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 22:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 22:17"/>“Mo ani ne mo akoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">wɔ mfasoɔ bɔne nko ara so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:17">sɛ mohwie mogya a ɛdi bem guo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:17">na moyɛ nhyɛsoɔ ne nsisie nso.”<verse eid="JER 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 22:18"/>Ɛno enti, yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">“Wɔrensu no sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Aa, me nuabarima! Aa me nuabaa!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:18">Wɔrensu no sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:18">‘Aa, me wura! Aa nʼahoɔfɛ!’<verse eid="JER 22:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 22:19"/>Wɔbɛsie no sɛ afunumu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">Wɔbɛtwe nʼase na wɔato no atwene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:19">Yerusalem apono akyi.”<verse eid="JER 22:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 22:20"/>“Monkɔ Lebanon nkɔ su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">momma wɔnte mo nne wɔ Basan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:20">monsu mfiri Abarim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:20">ɛfiri sɛ wɔadwerɛ mo mpamfoɔ nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 22:21"/>Mebɔɔ wo kɔkɔ, ɛberɛ a na ɛyɛ wo sɛ wʼasom adwo wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">nanso wokaa sɛ, ‘Merentie!’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:21">Yei ne ɛkwan a wonam so firi wo mmerante berɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:21">woanyɛ ɔsetie amma me.<verse eid="JER 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 22:22"/>Mframa bɛbɔ wo nnwanhwɛfoɔ nyinaa akɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">na wʼampamfoɔ nyinaa bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:22">Afei wʼani bɛwu na wʼanim agu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:22">ɛsiane wʼamumuyɛ nyinaa enti.<verse eid="JER 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 22:23"/>Mo a mote Lebanon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">na modeda ntweneduro adan mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:23">ɛrenkyɛre koraa, sɛ ɔyea ba mo so a, mobɛsi apene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:23">te sɛ ɔbaa a ɔreko awoɔ.<verse eid="JER 22:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 22:24"/>“Nokorɛm, sɛ mete ase yi,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “Mpo sɛ wo Yehoiakin, Yudahene Yehoiakim babarima yɛɛ me nsa nifa so nsɔano kaa a, anka mɛworɔ wo. <verse eid="JER 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 22:25"/>Mede wo bɛma wɔn a wɔrehwehwɛ wo kra, wɔn a wosuro wɔn no; Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne Babiloniafoɔ. <verse eid="JER 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 22:26"/>Mɛpam wo ne wo maame a ɔwoo wo akɔgu ɔman foforɔ so, baabi a ɛnyɛ hɔ na wɔwoo mo mu biara, ɛhɔ na mo baanu bɛwuwu. <verse eid="JER 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 22:27"/>Morensane mma asase a mo kɔn dɔ sɛ mobɛsane aba so no bio.”<verse eid="JER 22:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 22:28"/>Adɛn enti na saa ɔbarima Yehoiakin te sɛ ayowaa a abɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">adeɛ a obiara mpɛ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:28">Adɛn enti na wɔbɛpam ɔne ne mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:28">akɔgu asase a wɔnnim soɔ so?<verse eid="JER 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 22:29"/>Ao, asase, asase, asase!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:29">Tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm!<verse eid="JER 22:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 22:30"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">“Montwerɛ ɔbarima yi ho asɛm nto hɔ te sɛ obi a ɔnni ba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">ɔbarima a ɔrennya nkɔsoɔ ne nkwa nna nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 22:30">na nʼasefoɔ mu biara renya nkɔsoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">na wɔn mu biara rentena Dawid ahennwa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 22:30">na wɔrenni Yuda so ɔhene bio.”<verse eid="JER 22:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JER 23"/>
  <para style="s1">Tenenee Dubaa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 23:1"/>“Nnome nka nnwanhwɛfoɔ a wɔsɛe na wɔhwete me nnwankuo no” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 23:2"/>Ɛno enti yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, ka kyerɛ ahwɛfoɔ a wɔhwɛ me nkurɔfoɔ so nie: “Esiane sɛ, moabɔ me nnwankuo ahweteɛ, na moapam wɔn na moanhwɛ wɔn so yie no enti, mede asotwe bɛbrɛ mo wɔ mo bɔne a moayɛ no nti,” deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. <verse eid="JER 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 23:3"/>“Me ara ankasa mɛboaboa me nnwan nkaeɛ no afifiri aman a mapam wɔn akɔ hɔ nyinaa no so na mede wɔn bɛsane aba wɔn adidibea bio, baabi wɔbɛwowo na wɔn ase atrɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 23:4"/>Na mɛyi nnwanhwɛfoɔ a wɔbɛhwɛ wɔn so, na wɔrensuro na wɔremmɔ hu bio na wɔn mu baako mpo renyera.” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 23:5"/>“Nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">“Mɛma tenenee dubaa bi so ama Dawid,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:5">ɔhene bi a ɔbɛdi adeɛ nyansa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:5">na wayɛ deɛ ɛtene ne deɛ ɛyɛ wɔ asase yi so.<verse eid="JER 23:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 23:6"/>Ne mmerɛ so, wɔbɛgye Yuda nkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">na Israel bɛtena ase wɔ asomdwoeɛ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:6">Yei ne edin a wɔde bɛfrɛ no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:6">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Yɛn Tenenee.<verse eid="JER 23:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 23:7"/>Na afei nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “a nnipa renka bio sɛ, ‘Nokorɛm sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, deɛ ɔyii Israelfoɔ firii Misraim,’ <verse eid="JER 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 23:8"/>na mmom, wɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Nokorɛm sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi, deɛ ɔyii Israel asefoɔ firii atifi asase so ne aman nyinaa a ɔpamoo wɔn kɔɔ hɔ no so.’ Na afei wɔbɛtena wɔn ankasa asase so.”<verse eid="JER 23:8"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atorɔ Adiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 23:9"/>Ɛfa adiyifoɔ no ho no:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Mʼakoma abubu wɔ me mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">me nnompe nyinaa woso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">Mete sɛ ɔsabofoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">mete sɛ obi a nsã aboro noɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:9">ɛsiane <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:9">ne ne nsɛm kronkron no enti.<verse eid="JER 23:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 23:10"/>Awaresɛefoɔ ahyɛ asase no so ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">nnome no enti asase no awo wesee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">adidibea a ɛwɔ anweatam no so ahye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:10">Adiyifoɔ no nam ɛkwan bɔne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:10">de wɔn tumi yɛ deɛ ɛntene.<verse eid="JER 23:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 23:11"/>“Odiyifoɔ ne ɔsɔfoɔ nyinaa nsuro Onyankopɔn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">mʼasɔredan mu mpo mehunu wɔn amumuyɛsɛm,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 23:12"/>“Ɛno enti, wɔn ɛkwan so bɛyɛ torotorotoro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">wɔbɛpam wɔn akɔ esum mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">na ɛhɔ na wɔbɛhwehwe ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:12">Mede amanehunu bɛba wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">wɔ afe a wɔbɛtwe wɔn aso mu no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 23:13"/>“Samaria adiyifoɔ mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">mehunuu saa atantanneɛ yi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:13">Wɔde Baal hyɛɛ nkɔm</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:13">nam so maa me nkurɔfoɔ Israelfoɔ fom ɛkwan.<verse eid="JER 23:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 23:14"/>Na Yerusalem adiyifoɔ mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">mahunu adeɛ a ɛyɛ hu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">Wɔsɛe awadeɛ na wɔdi atorɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Wɔhyɛ wɔn a wɔyɛ bɔne no mpamuden,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">enti obiara nntwe ne ho mfiri nʼamumuyɛsɛm ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:14">Wɔn nyinaa te sɛ Sodom ma me;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:14">na Yerusalemfoɔ te sɛ Gomora.”<verse eid="JER 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 23:15"/>Ɛno enti, yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ fa adiyifoɔ no ho:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">“Mema wɔadi aduane a ɛyɛ nwono</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">na wɔanom nsuo a awuduro wɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:15">ɛfiri sɛ Yerusalem adiyifoɔ enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:15">abɔnefosɛm ahyɛ asase yi so ma.”<verse eid="JER 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 23:16"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">“Monntie nkɔm a adiyifoɔ no hyɛ kyerɛ mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">wɔma mo nya anidasoɔ a ɛnni nnyinasoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:16">Wɔbɔ wɔn tirim ka anisoadehunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:16">a ɛmfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anom.<verse eid="JER 23:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 23:17"/>Wɔkɔ so ka kyerɛ wɔn a wɔbu me animtia sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> se: Mobɛnya asomdwoeɛ.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:17">Na wɔn a wɔdi wɔn akomadenyɛ akyi no nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:17">wɔka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Ɔhaw biara remma mo so.’<verse eid="JER 23:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 23:18"/>Na wɔn mu hwan na waka <char style="nd">Awurade</char> agyinatufoɔ ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">sɛ ɔbɛhwɛ anaa ɔbɛtie nʼasɛm?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:18">Hwan na wayɛ aso ate nʼasɛm?<verse eid="JER 23:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 23:19"/>Hwɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">bɛtu abufuhyeɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:19">ntwahoframa bɛdi kyinhyia wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:19">amumuyɛfoɔ mpampam.<verse eid="JER 23:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 23:20"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo rennwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛwie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">nʼakoma mu nhyehyɛeɛ nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:20">Nna a ɛreba no mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:20">mobɛte aseɛ yie.<verse eid="JER 23:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 23:21"/>Mansoma saa adiyifoɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">nanso wɔde wɔn asɛm akyinkyini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:21">manto wɔn nkra biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:21">nanso wɔahyɛ nkɔm.<verse eid="JER 23:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 23:22"/>Sɛ wɔkaa mʼagyinatufoɔ ho a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">anka wɔbɛpae mu aka mʼasɛm akyerɛ me nkurɔfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:22">na ama wɔatwe wɔn ho afiri wɔn akwammɔne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:22">ne wɔn nneyɛɛ bɔne ho.<verse eid="JER 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 23:23"/>“Meyɛ Onyankopɔn a mebɛn nko ara anaa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:23">“na mennyɛ Onyankopɔn a mewɔ akyirikyiri nso?<verse eid="JER 23:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 23:24"/>Obi bɛtumi de ne ho asie baabi a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">merentumi nhunu no anaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 23:24">“Menyɛɛ ɔsoro ne asase so ma anaa?”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 23:24">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 23:25"/>“Mate deɛ adiyifoɔ a wɔde medin hyɛ nkɔmtorɔ no keka. Wɔkeka sɛ, ‘Mesoo daeɛ! Mesoo daeɛ!’ <verse eid="JER 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 23:26"/>Yei bɛkɔ so akɔsi da bɛn wɔ atorɔ adiyifoɔ yi akoma mu? Wɔn a wɔbɔ wɔn tirim hyɛ nnaadaa nkɔm? <verse eid="JER 23:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 23:27"/>Wɔdwene sɛ daeɛ a wɔkeka kyerɛkyerɛ wɔn ho no bɛma me nkurɔfoɔ werɛ afiri me din, sɛdeɛ Baalsom enti wɔn agyanom werɛ firii me din no. <verse eid="JER 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 23:28"/>Ma odiyifoɔ a waso daeɛ no nka nʼadaeso, na ma deɛ ɔwɔ mʼasɛm no nka no nokorɛm. Na ɛdeɛn na ntɛtɛ ne ayuo wɔ yɛ?” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 23:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 23:29"/>“Na mʼasɛm nte sɛ ogya?” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “Ɛnte sɛ asaeɛ a ɛpaapae ɔbotan mu nketenkete anaa?<verse eid="JER 23:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 23:30"/>“Ɛno nti,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “mekyi adiyifoɔ a wɔfa nsɛm a ɛfiri wɔn yɔnkonom nkyɛn, na wɔpae mu ka no sɛdeɛ ɛfiri me nkyɛn no. <verse eid="JER 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 23:31"/>Aane,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm nie, “mekyi saa adiyifoɔ a wɔde wɔn ankasa tɛkrɛmawoɔ ka sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 23:32"/>Nokorɛm, mekyi wɔn a wɔhyɛ adaeɛso ho nkɔmtorɔ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. “Wɔka kyerɛ wɔn na wɔde atorɔ nsɛm daadaa me nkurɔfoɔ ma wɔfom ɛkwan, nso mensomaa wɔn na mennyii wɔn. Wɔn ho nni mfasoɔ mma saa nnipa yi koraa,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 23:32"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Atorɔ Adiyisɛm Ne Atorɔ Adiyifoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 23:33"/>“Sɛ saa nnipa yi, anaa odiyifoɔ anaa ɔsɔfoɔ bisa mo sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm no a?’ Monka nkyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Adiyisɛm bɛn? Mɛpo mo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.’ <verse eid="JER 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 23:34"/>Sɛ odiyifoɔ bi, ɔsɔfoɔ bi anaa obi foforɔ si so dua sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm ni’ a, mɛtwe saa ɔbarima no ne ne fiefoɔ aso. <verse eid="JER 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 23:35"/>Yei ne deɛ mo mu biara kɔ so ka kyerɛ ne yɔnko anaa ne busuani: ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> mmuaeɛ ne sɛn?’ Anaa ‘Ɛdeɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka?’ <verse eid="JER 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 23:36"/>Nanso ɛnsɛ sɛ mobɔ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm’ so bio; ɛfiri sɛ, obiara asɛm bɛyɛ nʼadiyisɛm, ne saa enti modanedane nsɛm a ɛfiri Onyankopɔn, Teasefoɔ, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn nkyɛn mu. <verse eid="JER 23:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 23:37"/>Yei ne deɛ mokɔ so ka kyerɛ odiyifoɔ: ‘Mmuaeɛ bɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ama mo?’ Anaa ‘Ɛdeɛn na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka?’ <verse eid="JER 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 23:38"/>Ɛwom, mosi so dua sɛ, ‘Yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm’ nanso sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka: Mokaa sɛ, ‘Yei yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adiyisɛm,’ wɔ ɛberɛ a maka akyerɛ mo sɛ monnka saa nsɛm yi bio. <verse eid="JER 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 23:39"/>Afei, nokorɛm, me werɛ bɛfiri mo, na mapam mo ne kuropɔn a mede maa mo ne mo agyanom afiri mʼani so. <verse eid="JER 23:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 23:40"/>Na mede daa animguaseɛ, ne daa ahohora a werɛ remfi da bɛba mo so.”<verse eid="JER 23:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JER 24"/>
  <para style="s1">Borɔdɔma Nkɛntɛn Mmienu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 24:1"/>Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar faa Yudahene Yehoiakin a ɔyɛ Yehoiakim babarima, nʼadwumayɛfoɔ, nʼadwumfoɔ ne nʼatomfoɔ a wɔwɔ Yuda firii Yerusalem kɔɔ nnommumfa mu wɔ Babilonia no akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> kyerɛɛ me borɔdɔma nkɛntɛn mmienu a wɔde asisi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no anim. <verse eid="JER 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 24:2"/>Kɛntɛn baako mu borɔdɔma no yɛ papa te sɛ deɛ ɛbere ntɛm; borɔdɔma a ɛwɔ kɛntɛn a ɛka ho no mu no nyɛ mma sɛdeɛ wɔdie mpo.<verse eid="JER 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 24:3"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bisaa me sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wohunu, Yeremia?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 24:3">Mebuaa sɛ, “Borɔdɔma, deɛ ɛyɛ pa ara, ne deɛ ɛnyɛ mma sɛdeɛ wɔdie mpo.”<verse eid="JER 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 24:4"/>Ɛna <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 24:5"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: ‘Borɔdɔma papa no gyina hɔ ma atukɔfoɔ a wɔfiri Yuda, wɔn a metwaa wɔn asuo kɔɔ Babilonia asase so no. <verse eid="JER 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 24:6"/>Mɛma mʼani aku wɔn ho, ama wɔn yiedie, na mɛsane de wɔn aba ha bio. Mɛsiesie wɔn na merensɛe wɔn. Mɛdua wɔn, na merentu wɔn ase. <verse eid="JER 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 24:7"/>Mɛma wɔn akoma a wɔde bɛhunu me sɛ, me ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ, na mɛyɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔde wɔn akoma nyinaa bɛsane aba me nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 24:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 24:8"/>“ ‘Nanso te sɛ borɔdɔma a ɛnyɛ no, deɛ ɛnyɛ mma sɛdeɛ wɔdie mpo no,’ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, ‘saa ara na mɛyɛ Yudahene Sedekia, nʼadwumayɛfoɔ ne Yerusalem nkaeɛfoɔ, sɛ wɔte asase yi so anaa wɔte Misraim. <verse eid="JER 24:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 24:9"/>Mɛma wɔn ayɛ akyiwadeɛ ne mfomsodeɛ ama ahennie a ɛwɔ asase so nyinaa, wɔbɛyɛ ahɔhora na wɔabɔ wɔn din bɔne, wɔbɛyɛ asredeɛ ne mmusuo baabiara a mɛpam wɔn akɔ. <verse eid="JER 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 24:10"/>Mɛsoma akofena, ɛkɔm ne yaredɔm akɔ wɔn so kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe wɔn koraa afiri asase a mede maa wɔn ne wɔn agyanom.’ ”<verse eid="JER 24:10"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JER 25"/>
  <para style="s1">Mfeɛ Aduɔson Nkoasom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 25:1"/>Asɛm a ɛfa Yudafoɔ nyinaa ho baa Yeremia nkyɛn wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim, adedie afe a ɛtɔ so ɛnan a ɛyɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar adedie afe a ɛdi ɛkan. <verse eid="JER 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 25:2"/>Enti odiyifoɔ Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ ne wɔn a wɔtete Yerusalem nyinaa sɛ, <verse eid="JER 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 25:3"/>Mfeɛ aduonu mmiɛnsa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mfeɛ aduonu mmiɛnsa, Yosia dii ɔhene mfeɛ dunkron ɛnna Yehoiakim nso dii ɔhene mfeɛ ɛnan.</char></note> nie, ɛfiri Yudahene Amon babarima Yosia adedie afe a ɛtɔ so dumiɛnsa bɛsi ɛnnɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm aba me so na makasa akyerɛ mo mpɛn bebree, nanso monntieɛ.<verse eid="JER 25:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 25:4"/>Mpo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma nʼasomfoɔ a wɔyɛ nʼadiyifoɔ aba mo nkyɛn mpɛn bebree, na montiee wɔn, na monyɛɛ aso mmaa wɔn. <verse eid="JER 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 25:5"/>Wɔkaa sɛ, “Mo mu biara mfiri nʼakwan bɔne ne ne nneyɛɛ bɔne ho, na mobɛtumi atena asase a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de maa mo ne mo agyanom no so afebɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 25:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 25:6"/>Monni anyame foforɔ akyi nkɔsom wɔn nsɔre wɔn; mommfa deɛ mode mo nsa ayɛ no nhyɛ me abufuo. Afei merenha mo.”<verse eid="JER 25:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 25:7"/>“Nanso moanntie me,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “na mode deɛ mode mo nsa ayɛ ahyɛ me abufuo, na mode ɔhaw aba mo so.”<verse eid="JER 25:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 25:8"/>Afei deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Esiane sɛ moantie me nsɛm no enti, <verse eid="JER 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 25:9"/>mɛfrɛ atifi fam nnipa nyinaa ne mʼakoa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “na mede wɔn abɛko atia saa asase yi ne sotefoɔ, ne amanaman a wɔatwa ho ahyia nyinaa. Mɛsɛe wɔn pasaa na mayɛ wɔn ahodwiredeɛ ne fɛdideɛ, ne amamfo afebɔɔ. <verse eid="JER 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 25:10"/>Mɛyi ahosane ne anigyeɛ nnyegyeɛ, ayeforɔkunu ne ayeforɔyere nne, oyuyammoɔ nnyegyeeɛ ne kanea hann afiri wɔn mu. <verse eid="JER 25:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 25:11"/>Ɔman mu no nyinaa bɛdane asase wesee, na saa amanaman yi bɛsom Babiloniahene mfirinhyia aduɔson.<verse eid="JER 25:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 25:12"/>“Na mfirinhyia aduɔson awieeɛ no, mɛtwe Babiloniahene ne ne ɔman, Babiloniafoɔ asase aso wɔ wɔn amumuyɛ ho, mɛdane no amanfo afebɔɔ,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. <verse eid="JER 25:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 25:13"/>“Mɛma asotwe a mahyɛ atia asase no nyinaa aba wɔn so, deɛ wɔatwerɛ wɔ nwoma yi mu na Yeremia ahyɛ ho nkɔm atia aman no nyinaa no. <verse eid="JER 25:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 25:14"/>Wɔn ankasa deɛ, amanaman bebree<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amanaman bebree—Saa aman no yɛ Persia, Media ne ne nkurɔfoɔ.</char></note> ne ahempɔn de wɔn bɛyɛ nkoa; na mɛtua wɔn nneyɛeɛ ne wɔn nsa ano adwuma so ka.”<verse eid="JER 25:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Onyankopɔn Abufuhyeɛ Kuruwa No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 25:15"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, ka kyerɛɛ me: “Gye saa kuruwa yi a mʼabufuhyeɛ nsã ahyɛ no ma yi, na ma amanaman a mɛsoma wo wɔn nkyɛn no nyinaa nnom. <verse eid="JER 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 25:16"/>Sɛ wɔnom a, wɔbɛtɔ ntintan na wɔabobɔ dam ɛsiane akofena a mɛsoma akɔ wɔn so no enti.”<verse eid="JER 25:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 25:17"/>Ɛno enti, megyee kuruwa no firii <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsam, na memaa amanaman a ɔsomaa me wɔn nkyɛn no nomeeɛ:<verse eid="JER 25:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 25:18"/>Yerusalem ne Yuda nkuro, nʼahemfo ne ne nnwumayɛfoɔ sɛ wɔnyɛ asɛedeɛ, ahodwiredeɛ, fɛdideɛ ne nnome, sɛdeɛ wɔteɛ ɛnnɛ da yi,<verse eid="JER 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 25:19"/>Misraimhene Farao, nʼasomfoɔ, nʼadwumayɛfoɔ ne ne manfoɔ nyinaa, <verse eid="JER 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 25:20"/>amanfrafoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">Us ahemfo;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:20">Filistifoɔ ahemfo (a ɛyɛ Askelon, Gasa, Ekron ne nnipa a wɔagya wɔn wɔ Asdod);<verse eid="JER 25:20"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 25:21"/>Edom, Moab ne Amon;<verse eid="JER 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 25:22"/>Tiro ne Sidon ahemfo nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:22">ne ahemfo a wɔwɔ mpoano aman a wɔwɔ ɛpo agya no;<verse eid="JER 25:22"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 25:23"/>Dedan, Tema, Bus ne nnipa a wɔtete akyirikyiri no;<verse eid="JER 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 25:24"/>Arabia ahemfo ne amanfrafoɔ ahemfo nyinaa a wɔtete anweatam so no.<verse eid="JER 25:24"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 25:25"/>Simri, Elam ne Media ahemfo nyinaa;<verse eid="JER 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 25:26"/>ne ahemfo a wɔwɔ atifi fam nyinaa, wɔn a wɔbɛn ne wɔn a wɔwɔ akyirikyiri, ne wɔn mu biara, asase so ahennie ahodoɔ.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 25:26">Na wɔn nyinaa akyi no Sesakhene nso bɛnom bi.<verse eid="JER 25:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 25:27"/>“Afei, ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: Monnom, mommobo na momfefe, na mohwehwe ase a monnsɔre bio, ɛsiane akofena a mɛsoma aba mo so enti.’ <verse eid="JER 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 25:28"/>Na sɛ wɔampɛ sɛ wɔgye wo nsam kuruwa no nom a, ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Ɛsɛ sɛ monom! <verse eid="JER 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 25:29"/>Monhwɛ, merebɛfiti aseɛ de amanehunu aba kuropɔn a me Din da so no so, na mobɛfa mo ho adi a wɔrentwe mo aso anaa? Wɔbɛtwe mo aso, ɛfiri sɛ merefrɛ akofena aba wɔn a wɔtete asase no so nyinaa so, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.’<verse eid="JER 25:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 25:30"/>“Afei, hyɛ nsɛm yi nyinaa ho nkɔm tia wɔn, na ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">“ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛfiri soro abobom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">ɔbɛma ne nne so afiri ne tenabea kronkron hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">na wabobɔ mu denden atia nʼasase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:30">Ɔbɛteam te sɛ wɔn a wɔtiatia bobe aba so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:30">ɔbɛteam agu wɔn a wɔtete asase no so.<verse eid="JER 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 25:31"/>Hooyɛ bɛgyegye akɔ nsase ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ kwaadu atia amanaman;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:31">ɔbɛbu adasamma nyinaa atɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">na ɔde amumuyɛfoɔ ama akofena,’ ”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 25:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 25:32"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">“Monhwɛ! Amanehunu retrɛtrɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">firi ɔman so kɔ ɔman foforɔ so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:32">ahum kɛseɛ bi rema ne ho so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:32">afiri nsase ano.”<verse eid="JER 25:32"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 25:33"/>Saa ɛberɛ no, wɔn a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akunkum wɔn no bɛdeda baabiara, firi asase ano kɔsi ano nohoa. Wɔrensu wɔn na wɔremmoaboa wɔn ano na wɔrensie wɔn, na wɔbɛyɛ sɛ sumina a ɛgugu fam.<verse eid="JER 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 25:34"/>Monsu na montwa adwo, mo nnwanhwɛfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">mommunimuni wɔ mfuturo mu mo nnwankuo ntuanofoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:34">Mokum berɛ no aduru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:34">mobɛhwehwe ase, na moabobɔ nketenkete te sɛ nkukuo a ɛnyɛ den.<verse eid="JER 25:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 25:35"/>Nnwanhwɛfoɔ no rennya baabiara nnwane nkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:35">na nnwankuo no ntuanofoɔ no rennya ɛkwan nnwane.<verse eid="JER 25:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 25:36"/>Montie nnwanhwɛfoɔ no su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">ne nnwankuo no ntuanofoɔ agyaadwotwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:36">ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> resɛe wɔn mmoa adidibea.<verse eid="JER 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 25:37"/>Ɛserɛ nsase a asomdwoeɛ wɔ soɔ no bɛda mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:37">ɛsiane <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuhyeɛ no enti.<verse eid="JER 25:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 25:38"/>Na wɔn asase bɛda mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">te sɛ gyata a ɔfiri ne tu mu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 25:38">ɛsiane ɔhyɛsofoɔ no akofena</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 25:38">ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuhyeɛ no enti.<verse eid="JER 25:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JER 26"/>
  <para style="s1">Owuo Hunahuna Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 26:1"/>Yehoiakim a ɔyɛ Yudahene Yosia babarima adedie ahyɛaseɛ mfeɛ no, saa asɛm yi firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baeɛ: <verse eid="JER 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 26:2"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Gyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie mu abannwa hɔ, na ka kyerɛ nnipa a wɔfiri Yuda nkuro mu bɛsom wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie mu nyinaa. Ka deɛ mehyɛ wo no nyinaa kyerɛ wɔn; nnyi asɛm biara mfiri mu. <verse eid="JER 26:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 26:3"/>Ebia wɔbɛtie, na wɔn mu biara asane afiri nʼakwammɔne so. Sɛ ɛba saa a, mɛtwɛn, na meremfa amanehunu a wɔn bɔne enti, mepɛɛ sɛ mede ba wɔn so no mma bio. <verse eid="JER 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 26:4"/>Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Sɛ moantie me, na moanni me mmara a mahyɛ mo no so, <verse eid="JER 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 26:5"/>na sɛ moantie nsɛm a mʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ a mesoma wɔn mo nkyɛn ɛberɛ biara no ka kyerɛ mo no a, (mpo monntiee wɔn), <verse eid="JER 26:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 26:6"/>ɛnneɛ, mɛyɛ efie yi sɛ Silo, na kuropɔn yi ayɛ nnomedeɛ wɔ asase so aman nyinaa mu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 26:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 26:7"/>Asɔfoɔ, adiyifoɔ ne nnipa no nyinaa tee sɛ Yeremia reka saa nsɛm yi, wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie hɔ. <verse eid="JER 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 26:8"/>Na Yeremia wiee nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnka nkyerɛ nnipa no nyinaa no ka no, asɔfoɔ no, adiyifoɔ ne nnipa no nyinaa to hyɛɛ no so kaa sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wo wu! <verse eid="JER 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 26:9"/>Adɛn na wohyɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu sɛ, efie yi bɛyɛ sɛ Silo na kuropɔn yi bɛda mpan a obiara ntena so anaa?” Na nnipa no nyinaa bɛtwaa Yeremia ho hyiaeɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie hɔ.<verse eid="JER 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 26:10"/>Ɛberɛ a Yuda adwumafoɔ tee saa nsɛm yi no, wɔfirii ahemfie hɔ foro kɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie kɔtenaa efie no Ɛpono Foforɔ no ano. <verse eid="JER 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 26:11"/>Ɛna asɔfoɔ no ne adiyifoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ adwumayɛfoɔ no ne nnipa no nyinaa sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔbu saa ɔbarima yi kumfɔ, ɛfiri sɛ wahyɛ nkɔm atia kuropɔn yi. Moate wɔ mo asom!”<verse eid="JER 26:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 26:12"/>Na Yeremia kasa yii ne ho ano wɔ adwumayɛfoɔ ne nnipa no nyinaa anim sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> somaa me sɛ, memmɛnhyɛ nkɔm ntia efie yi ne kuropɔn yi sɛdeɛ moate no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 26:13"/>Na afei montenetene mo akwan ne mo nneyɛɛ, na monyɛ ɔsetie mma <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, mo Onyankopɔn. Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛtwɛn, na ɔremfa amanehunu a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔde ba mo so no mma bio. <verse eid="JER 26:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 26:14"/>Me deɛ, mewɔ mo nsam; mobɛtumi ayɛ me sɛdeɛ ɛyɛ na ɛtene wɔ mo ani so. <verse eid="JER 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 26:15"/>Nanso monkae sɛ, sɛ mokum me a, moahwie mogya a ɛdi bem agu, na ɛso afɔdie bɛba mo so, kuropɔn yi so ne wɔn a wɔtete mu so; na nokorɛm <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na wasoma me sɛ memmɛka nsɛm yi nyinaa nnwu mo asom.”<verse eid="JER 26:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 26:16"/>Na adwumayɛfoɔ no ne nnipa no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ asɔfoɔ no ne adiyifoɔ no sɛ, “Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔbu saa ɔbarima yi kumfɔ! Wakasa akyerɛ yɛn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn din mu.”<verse eid="JER 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 26:17"/>Na asase no so mpanimfoɔ no mu bi sɔreeɛ na wɔka kyerɛɛ badwa no nyinaa sɛ, <verse eid="JER 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 26:18"/>“Mika a ɔfiri Moreset hyɛɛ nkɔm Yudahene Hesekia berɛ so. Ɔka kyerɛɛ Yudafoɔ nyinaa sɛ, ‘Yei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 26:18">“ ‘Wɔbɛfuntum Sion te sɛ afuo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">Na Yerusalem bɛyɛ mmubuiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 26:18">na asɔredan no kokoɔ bɛyɛ sɛ nkɔfie a nkyɛkyerɛ afu wɔ so.’<verse eid="JER 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 26:19"/>Na Yudahene Hesekia anaa Yudani bi kumm no anaa? Hesekia ansuro <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ansrɛ ne hɔ adom? Na ɛno amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> antwɛn sɛ ɔbɛyi amanehunu a ɔpɛɛ sɛ ɔde ba wɔn so no amfiri wɔn so anaa? Yɛreyɛ de amanehunu kɛseɛ aba yɛn ankasa so!”<verse eid="JER 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 26:20"/>(Semaia babarima Uria a ɔfiri Kiriat-Yearim no nso yɛ ɔbarima foforɔ a ɔhyɛɛ nkɔm wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu; ɔhyɛɛ nkɔm korɔ yi ara tiaa saa kuropɔn yi ne saa asase yi, sɛdeɛ Yeremia yɛeɛ no. <verse eid="JER 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 26:21"/>Ɛberɛ a ɔhene Yehoiakim ne ne mpanimfoɔ ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ nyinaa tee ne nsɛm no, ɔhene no pɛɛ sɛ ɔkum no, nanso Uria teeɛ no, ɔde ehu dwane kɔɔ Misraim. <verse eid="JER 26:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 26:22"/>Ɔhene Yehoiakim somaa Akbor babarima Elnatan ne mmarima bi kɔɔ Misraim. <verse eid="JER 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 26:23"/>Wɔde Uria firi Misraim baeɛ, na wɔde no kɔmaa ɔhene Yehoiakim. Ɔma wɔde akofena kumm no na wɔtoo ne funu twenee kwasafo asieeɛ.)<verse eid="JER 26:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 26:24"/>Afei nso, na Safan babarima Ahikam gyina Yeremia akyi, enti wɔammfa no amma ɛdɔm no sɛ wɔnkum no.<verse eid="JER 26:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JER 27"/>
  <para style="s1">Yuda Bɛsom Nebukadnessar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 27:1"/>Yudahene Yosia babarima Sedekia adedie ahyɛaseɛ no, asɛm yi firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 27:2"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ me: “Fa mmeamudua ne nkyehoma yɛ kɔnnua sɛn wo kɔn mu. <verse eid="JER 27:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 27:3"/>Fa nkra ma abɔfoɔ a wɔaba Yudahene Sedekia nkyɛn wɔ Yerusalem na wɔmfa nkɔma ahemfo a wɔwɔ Edom, Moab, Amon, Tiro ne Sidon. <verse eid="JER 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 27:4"/>Fa nkra kɔma wɔn wuranom sɛ: Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ, ‘Ka yei kyerɛ wo wuranom sɛ: <verse eid="JER 27:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 27:5"/>Mede me tumi kɛseɛ ne me basa a matene mu yɛɛ asase ne so nnipa ne mmoa a wɔwɔ so, na mede ma obiara a ɔsɔ mʼani. <verse eid="JER 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 27:6"/>Afei, mede mo aman nyinaa bɛhyɛ mʼakoa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar nsa, na mede wiram mmoa mpo bɛhyɛ nʼase. <verse eid="JER 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 27:7"/>Amanaman nyinaa bɛsom no ne ne babarima ne ne nanabarima kɔsi sɛ ne berɛ bɛtwam; na afei aman bebree ne ahemfo akɛseakɛseɛ bɛdi ne so.<verse eid="JER 27:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 27:8"/>“ ‘Nanso sɛ ɔman bi anaa ahennie bi rensom Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar anaa wɔremfa wɔn kɔn nhyɛ ne kɔnnua ase a, mede akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm bɛtwe saa ɔman no aso, kɔsi sɛ mede ne nsa bɛsɛe no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 27:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 27:9"/>Ɛno enti monntie mo adiyifoɔ, mo nkɔmhyɛfoɔ, mo adaeɛ asekyerɛfoɔ, mo asamanfrɛfoɔ anaa mo ntafowayifoɔ a wɔka kyerɛ mo sɛ, “Morensom Babiloniahene.” <verse eid="JER 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 27:10"/>Wɔhyɛ mo nkɔmtorɔ a ɛbɛma wɔayi mo afiri mo asase so akɔ akyirikyiri nko ara; mɛpam mo ama mo ase ayera. <verse eid="JER 27:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 27:11"/>Nanso, sɛ ɔman biara de ne kɔn bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene kɔnnua no ase na wasom no a, mɛma saa ɔman no aka ɔno ara asase so na wadɔ so atena so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ɔseɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 27:12"/>Mede saa nkra korɔ no ara kɔmaa Yudahene Sedekia sɛ, “Momfa mo kɔn nhyɛ Babiloniahene kɔnnua ase na monsom ɔno ne ne nkurɔfoɔ na mobɛnya nkwa. <verse eid="JER 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 27:13"/>Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ wo ne wo nkurɔfoɔ wuwuo wɔ akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm ano, sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de ahunahuna ɔman biara a ɔmpɛ sɛ ɔsom Babiloniahene no? <verse eid="JER 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 27:14"/>Monntie adiyifoɔ no a wɔka kyerɛ mo sɛ, ‘Morensom Babiloniahene,’ ɛfiri sɛ wɔhyɛ mo nkɔmtorɔ. <verse eid="JER 27:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 27:15"/>‘Mensomaa wɔn’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. ‘Wɔhyɛ nkɔmtorɔ wɔ me din mu. Enti, mɛpam mo na moayera, mo ne adiyifoɔ a wɔhyɛ mo nkɔm no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 27:16"/>Na meka kyerɛɛ asɔfoɔ no ne saa nkurɔfoɔ yi nyinaa sɛ, “Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Monntie adiyifoɔ no a wɔhyɛ mo nkɔm sɛ, ‘Ɛrenkyɛre koraa wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie nneɛma no bɛfiri Babilonia aba.’ Wɔhyɛ nkɔmtorɔ kyerɛ mo. <verse eid="JER 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 27:17"/>Monntie wɔn. Monsom Babiloniahene na mobɛnya nkwa. Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ saa kuropɔn yi sɛeɛ? <verse eid="JER 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 27:18"/>Sɛ wɔyɛ adiyifoɔ na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm wɔ wɔn mu a, ma wɔn nkoto nsrɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na nneɛma a wɔde siesie dan mu a aka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie ne Yudahene ahemfie ne Yerusalem no, wɔamfa ankɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 27:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 27:19"/>Na yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa kɔbere mfrafraeɛ afadum, Ɛpo, nnyinasoɔ a wɔtumi pia ne nneɛma a wɔde siesie dan mu no a aka wɔ kuropɔn yi mu no ho. <verse eid="JER 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 27:20"/>Deɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar amfa ankɔ ɛberɛ a ɔbɛfaa Yudahene Yehoiakim babarima Yehoiakin ne Yuda ne Yerusalem mmapɔmma firii Yerusalem kɔɔ nkoasom mu wɔ Babilonia no. <verse eid="JER 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 27:21"/>Aane, yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, ka fa nneɛma a aka wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie, Yudahene ahemfie ne Yerusalem no ho: <verse eid="JER 27:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 27:22"/>‘Wɔbɛfa akɔ Babilonia, na ɛhɔ na ɛbɛka kɔsi da a mɛba abɛfa,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. ‘Afei mede nneɛma no bɛsane aba bio abɛsisi wɔn siberɛ wɔ ha.’ ”<verse eid="JER 27:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JER 28"/>
  <para style="s1">Odiyifoɔ Torofoɔ Hanania</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 28:1"/>Ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so enum wɔ afe korɔ a ɛyɛ Yudahene Sedekia adedie ahyɛaseɛ, afe a ɛtɔ so ɛnan no mu, odiyifoɔ Hanania a ɔyɛ Asur a ɔfiri Gibeon babarima no ka kyerɛɛ me wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie ɛberɛ a na asɔfoɔ ne nnipa no nyinaa ahyia sɛ, <verse eid="JER 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 28:2"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: ‘Mɛbubu Babiloniahene kɔnnua no. <verse eid="JER 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 28:3"/>Mfeɛ mmienu mu no, mede <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie mu nneɛma a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar bɛfa firii ha kɔɔ Babilonia no nyinaa bɛsane aba bio. <verse eid="JER 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 28:4"/>Na mɛsane de Yehoiakin a ɔyɛ Yudahene Yehoiakim babarima ne Yuda nnommumfoɔ a wɔkɔɔ Babilonia no nyinaa aba bio’ sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, ‘na mɛbubu Babiloniahene kɔnnua no.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 28:5"/>Na odiyifoɔ Yeremia buaa odiyifoɔ Hanania wɔ asɔfoɔ ne nnipa a na wɔgyinagyina <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie no nyinaa anim. <verse eid="JER 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 28:6"/>Ɔkaa sɛ, “Amen! Ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nyɛ no saa! Ma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mma wo nkɔm a woahyɛ sɛ wɔde <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie nneɛma no nyinaa ne nnommumfoɔ bɛfiri Babilonia asane aba ɛha yi no mmra mu. <verse eid="JER 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 28:7"/>Nanso, tie asɛm a ɛsɛ sɛ meka ma wote na nnipa no nyinaa nso teɛ: <verse eid="JER 28:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 28:8"/>Ɛfiri tete no, adiyifoɔ a wɔdii mʼanim ne wʼanim no hyehyɛɛ ɔko, amanehunu ne ɔyaredɔm ho nkɔm tiaa aman bebree ne ahennie akɛseɛ. <verse eid="JER 28:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 28:9"/>Nanso odiyifoɔ a ɔhyɛ asomdwoeɛ ho nkɔm no, sɛ ne nkɔmhyɛ no ba mu a wɔbɛgye no atom sɛ obi a ampa ara <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asoma no.”<verse eid="JER 28:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 28:10"/>Na odiyifoɔ Hanania yii kɔnnua no firii odiyifoɔ Yeremia kɔn mu, bubuu mu, <verse eid="JER 28:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 28:11"/>na ɔkaeɛ wɔ nnipa no nyinaa anim sɛ, “Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Saa ara na mɛbubu Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar kɔnnua no afiri amanaman nyinaa kɔn mu wɔ mfeɛ mmienu mu.’ ” Odiyifoɔ Yeremia tee yei no ɔfirii hɔ kɔeɛ.<verse eid="JER 28:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 28:12"/>Odiyifoɔ Hanania bubuu kɔnnua no firii odiyifoɔ Yeremia kɔn mu akyire no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ: <verse eid="JER 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 28:13"/>“Kɔ na kɔka kyerɛ Hanania sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Woabubu dua kɔnnua mu, nanso mede dadeɛ kɔnnua bɛsi anan mu. <verse eid="JER 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 28:14"/>Na sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ nie: Mede dadeɛ kɔnnua bɛto amanaman nyinaa kɔn mu, ama wɔn asom Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar, na wɔbɛsom no. Na mpo mɛma no adi wiram mmoa so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 28:15"/>Na odiyifoɔ Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ odiyifoɔ Hanania sɛ, “Tie, Hanania! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsomaa wo, nanso, woama ɔman yi agye atorɔ ato mu. <verse eid="JER 28:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 28:16"/>Ɛno enti, sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: ‘Merebɛyi wo afiri asase so. Afeɛ yi mu ara wobɛwu, ɛfiri sɛ woaka atuateɛ nsɛm atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.’ ”<verse eid="JER 28:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 28:17"/>Ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nson wɔ afe no ara mu no, odiyifoɔ Hanania wuiɛ.<verse eid="JER 28:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 28"/>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JER 29"/>
  <para style="s1">Krataa A Wɔde Kɔmaa Nnommumfoɔ No</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 29:1"/>Yei ne krataa mu nsɛm a odiyifoɔ Yeremia twerɛ firii Yerusalem kɔmaa nnommumfoɔ no mu mpanimfoɔ nkaeɛ, asɔfoɔ, adiyifoɔ ne nnipa a wɔaka nyinaa a Nebukadnessar afa wɔn nnommum afiri Yerusalem akɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 29:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 29:2"/>(Yei yɛ ɛberɛ a ɔhene Yehoiakin ne ɔhemmaa no, asɛnniiɛ adwumayɛfoɔ, Yuda ne Yerusalem ntuanofoɔ, adwumfoɔ ahodoɔ nyinaa afiri Yerusalem akɔ nnommumfa mu no akyi.) <verse eid="JER 29:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 29:3"/>Ɔde krataa no hyɛɛ Safan babarima Elasa ne Hilkia babarima Gemaria nsa, wɔn na Yudahene Sedekia somaa wɔn kɔɔ Ɔhene Nebukadnessar nkyɛn wɔ Babilonia. Krataa no mu nsɛm nie:<verse eid="JER 29:3"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 29:4"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, ka kyerɛ wɔn a mema wɔfaa wɔn nnommum firi Yerusalem kɔɔ Babilonia no nyinaa: <verse eid="JER 29:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 29:5"/>“Monsisi afie, na momfa mmɔ atenaseɛ; monyɛ nturo na monni mu aba. <verse eid="JER 29:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 29:6"/>Monwareware, na monwowo mmammarima ne mmammaa. Monhwehwɛ yerenom mma mo mmammarima na momfa mo mmammaa nso mma awadeɛ, na wɔn nso nwowo mmammarima ne mmammaa. Monnɔre wɔ hɔ na mo so ante. <verse eid="JER 29:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 29:7"/>Afei, monhwehwɛ kuropɔn a mema wɔtuu mo kɔtenaa so no asomdwoeɛ ne yiedie. Mommɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mpaeɛ mma no, ɛfiri sɛ ne yiedie mu na mo nso mobɛdi yie.” <verse eid="JER 29:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 29:8"/>Aane, yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: “Mommma adiyifoɔ ne nkɔmhyɛfoɔ a wɔwɔ mo mu no nnaadaa mo. Monntie wɔn adaeɛ a mohyɛ wɔn nkuran ma wɔsoso no. <verse eid="JER 29:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 29:9"/>Wɔhyɛ nkɔntorɔ wɔ me din mu. Mensomaa wɔn,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:9"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 29:10"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Sɛ mosom Babilonia mfeɛ aduɔson a, mɛba abɛhwɛ mo na mɛma mʼadom mu bɔhyɛ sɛ mede mo bɛba ha bio no aba mu. <verse eid="JER 29:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 29:11"/>Menim nhyehyɛeɛ a mewɔ ma mo,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “Nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛde mo bɛsi yie na ɛrenha mo, nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛbɛma mo anidasoɔ ne awieeɛ pa. <verse eid="JER 29:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 29:12"/>Afei mobɛfrɛ me na moaba abɛbɔ me mpaeɛ, na mɛtie mo. <verse eid="JER 29:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 29:13"/>Mobɛhwehwɛ me na mobɛhunu me, sɛ mode mo akoma nyinaa hwehwɛ me dea. <verse eid="JER 29:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 29:14"/>Mobɛhunu me,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “na mɛyi mo afiri nkoasom mu de mo asane aba. Mɛboaboa mo ano afiri amanaman ne beaeɛ a mepamoo mo kɔɔ so no nyinaa,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “na mede mo bɛsane aba baabi a metuu mo firi kɔɔ nnommum mu no bio.”<verse eid="JER 29:14"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 29:15"/>Mobɛka sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama yɛn adiyifoɔ wɔ Babilonia,” <verse eid="JER 29:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 29:16"/>nanso, sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa ɔhene a ɔte Dawid ahennwa so ne nnipa a wɔaka wɔ kuropɔn no mu nyinaa, mo manfoɔ a wɔne mo ankɔ nnommumfa mu no, <verse eid="JER 29:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 29:17"/>aane, yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: “Mɛma akofena, ɛkɔm ne yaredɔm aba wɔn so, na wɔayɛ sɛ borɔdɔma a asɛeɛ enti wɔntumi nni. <verse eid="JER 29:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 29:18"/>Mede akofena, ɛkɔm ne yaredɔm bɛti wɔn, na mɛyɛ wɔn atantanneɛ ama ahennie a ɛwɔ asase no so nyinaa, ne nnome ne ahodwiredeɛ, fɛdideɛ ne animtiabudeɛ wɔ amanaman a mepamoo wɔn kɔɔ so no mu. <verse eid="JER 29:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 29:19"/>Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔantie me nsɛm,” sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, “nsɛm a mede somaa mʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ mpɛn bebree baa mo nkyɛn. Na mo nnommumfoɔ nso antie,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:19"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 29:20"/>Afei montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo nnommumfoɔ a mama mo afiri Yerusalem akɔ Babilonia no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 29:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 29:21"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn ka fa Kolaia babarima Ahab ne Maaseia babarima Sedekia a wɔde me din rehyɛ mo nkɔmtorɔ no ho nie: “Mede wɔn bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar nsa, na wakum wɔn wɔ mo anim. <verse eid="JER 29:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 29:22"/>Esiane wɔn enti, Yuda nnommumfoɔ a wɔwɔ Babilonia nyinaa de saa nnome yi bɛdome sɛ: ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nyɛ wo sɛ, Sedekia ne Ahab a Babiloniahene hyee wɔn wɔ ogya mu no.’ <verse eid="JER 29:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 29:23"/>Na wɔayɛ akyiwadeɛ a ɛboro so wɔ Israel: wɔne wɔn yɔnkonom yerenom adeda de asɛe awadeɛ, na wɔde me din adi atorɔ a mennka nkyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ. Menim na medi ho adanseɛ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Semaia Nkra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 29:24"/>Ka kyerɛ Nehelamni Semaia sɛ, <verse eid="JER 29:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 29:25"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: Watwerɛ krataa wɔ wo din mu akɔma nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem nyinaa, ɔsɔfoɔ Maaseia babarima Sefania, ne asɔfoɔ a aka no nyinaa. Woka kyerɛɛ Sefania sɛ, <verse eid="JER 29:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 29:26"/>‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ wo ɔsɔfoɔ asi Yehoiada anan mu sɛ hwɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie no so; Ɛsɛ sɛ wode nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn ne dadeɛ kɔnnua gu obiara a wabɔ dam na ɔyɛ ne ho sɛ odiyifoɔ. <verse eid="JER 29:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 29:27"/>Afei adɛn enti na wontwi Yeremia a ɔfiri Anatot a ɔyɛ ne ho sɛ odiyifoɔ wɔ mo mu no anim? <verse eid="JER 29:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 29:28"/>Ɔde saa nkra yi abrɛ yɛn wɔ Babilonia: Ɛbɛkyɛ. Ɛno enti monsisi afie mfa mmɔ atenaseɛ; monyɛ nturo na monni emu aba.’ ”<verse eid="JER 29:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 29:29"/>Ɔsɔfoɔ Sefania kenkanee krataa no kyerɛɛ odiyifoɔ Yeremia. <verse eid="JER 29:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 29:30"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 29:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 29:31"/>“Fa saa nkra yi kɔma nnommumfoɔ no nyinaa sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Nehelamni Semaia ho: Esiane sɛ wahyɛ mo nkɔm a mpo mansoma no, na wama moagye atorɔ adi enti, <verse eid="JER 29:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 29:32"/>deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Nokorɛm, mɛtwe Nehelamni Semaia ne nʼasefoɔ aso. Ɔrennya obiara a ɔbɛka wɔ saa nkurɔfoɔ yi mu, na ɔrenhunu nneɛma pa a mɛyɛ ama me nkurɔfoɔ, ɛfiri sɛ waka atuateɛ nsɛm atia me,’ ” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 29:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 29"/>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JER 30"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔgye Israel Si Hɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 30:1"/>Asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ nie: <verse eid="JER 30:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 30:2"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ: ‘Twerɛ nsɛm a maka akyerɛ wo nyinaa gu nwoma mu. <verse eid="JER 30:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 30:3"/>Nna bi reba,’ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, ‘a mede me nkurɔfoɔ Israelfoɔ ne Yudafoɔ bɛfiri nnommum mu asane aba na mede wɔn aba asase a mede me maa wɔn agyanom sɛ wɔmfa ntena so,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.”<verse eid="JER 30:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 30:4"/>Yei ne nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka faa Israel ne Yuda ho: <verse eid="JER 30:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 30:5"/>“Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:5">“ ‘Akomatuo nteateam na mete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:5">mete ehu, na ɛnyɛ asomdwoeɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 30:6"/>Mommisa na monhunu:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">Ɔbarima bɛtumi awo mma anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:6">Afei, adɛn enti na mehunu ɔbarima ɔhoɔdenfoɔ biara</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">sɛ ne nsa gu ne yafunu so te sɛ ɔbaa a ɔwɔ awokoɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:6">na anim biara ayɛ bosaa saa?<verse eid="JER 30:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 30:7"/>Sɛdeɛ da no bɛyɛ hu afa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">Ɛda biara renyɛ sɛ ɛno.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:7">Ɛbɛyɛ amanehunu berɛ ama Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:7">nanso, wɔbɛyi no afiri mu.<verse eid="JER 30:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 30:8"/>“ ‘Saa ɛda no,’ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">‘Mɛbubu kɔnnua no afiri wɔn kɔn mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:8">na matete wɔn nkyehoma no mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:8">ananafoɔ remfa wɔn nyɛ nkoa bio.<verse eid="JER 30:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 30:9"/>Na mmom wɔbɛsom <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">ne Dawid wɔn ɔhene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:9">a mɛpagya no ama wɔn.<verse eid="JER 30:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 30:10"/>“ ‘Enti nsuro, Ao Yakob, me ɔsomfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">mma wʼaba mu mmu, Ao Israel,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">‘Nokorɛm mɛgye wo afiri akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">ne wʼasefoɔ afiri wɔn nnommumfa asase so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:10">Yakob bɛsane anya asomdwoeɛ ne banbɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:10">na obiara renhunahuna no bio.<verse eid="JER 30:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 30:11"/>Me ne wo wɔ hɔ na mɛgye wo nkwa,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">‘Ɛwom sɛ mesɛe amanaman no nyinaa pasaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">wɔn a mebɔ mo hwete wɔ wɔn mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">nanso merensɛe mo korakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:11">Mɛtenetene mo nanso mɛyɛ no tenenee ɛkwan so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:11">meremma mo mfa mo ho nni koraa a merentwe mo aso.’<verse eid="JER 30:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 30:12"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:12">“ ‘Wo apirakuro ayɛ koankorɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:12">na ɛnni asaeɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 30:13"/>Obiara nni hɔ a ɔbɛka bi ama wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">wo kuro no rennya aduro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:13">na worennya ayaresa.<verse eid="JER 30:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 30:14"/>Wʼapamfoɔ nyinaa werɛ afiri wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">wo ho biribiara mfa wɔn ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">Mabɔ wo sɛdeɛ wo ɔtamfoɔ bɛyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">na matwe wʼaso sɛdeɛ otirimuɔdenfoɔ bɛtwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:14">ɛfiri sɛ wʼafɔdie so dodo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:14">na wʼamumuyɛ nso dɔɔso.<verse eid="JER 30:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 30:15"/>Adɛn enti na wosu denden wɔ wʼapirakuro ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">wo yeadie a ano nni aduro ho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:15">Wʼafɔdie kɛseɛ ne wʼamumuyɛ bebrebe enti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:15">na mede saa nneɛma yi ayɛ woɔ.<verse eid="JER 30:15"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 30:16"/>“ ‘Nanso wɔbɛsɛe wɔn a wɔsɛe mo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">mo atamfoɔ nyinaa bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:16">Wɔn a wɔfom mo no, wɔbɛfom wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:16">Wɔn a wɔto hyɛɛ mo so no, mɛto ahyɛ wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 30:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 30:17"/>Nanso mɛma wo ahoɔden bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">na masa wo apirakuro,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:17">‘ɛfiri sɛ wɔfrɛ wo deɛ wɔapam noɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:17">Sion a wo ho nhia obiara.’<verse eid="JER 30:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 30:18"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">“ ‘Mɛsane de Yakob ntomadan mu ahonyadeɛ aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">na manya ayamhyehyeɛ ama nʼatenaeɛ ahodoɔ no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:18">wɔbɛkyekyere kuropɔn no bio wɔ ne mmubuiɛ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:18">na ahemfie no bɛsi deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ ɛsie.<verse eid="JER 30:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 30:19"/>Wɔn mu na aseda nnwom bɛfiri aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">ne ahosɛpɛ nnyegyeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">Mɛma wɔadɔɔso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">na wɔn dodoɔ no so rente;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:19">mɛhyɛ wɔn animuonyam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:19">na wɔremmu wɔn abomfiaa.<verse eid="JER 30:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 30:20"/>Wɔn mma bɛdi yie sɛ kane no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">mɛma wɔn asafo atim wɔ mʼanim;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:20">wɔn a wɔhyɛ wɔn so nyinaa mɛtwe wɔn aso.<verse eid="JER 30:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 30:21"/>Wɔn adikanfoɔ bɛyɛ wɔn mu baako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">na wɔn sodifoɔ bɛfiri wɔn mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">Mɛka no abata me ho na wabɛn me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">na hwan na ɔno ankasa bɛtumi de ne ho ama</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:21">sɛ ɔbɛbɛn me?’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 30:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 30:22"/>‘Enti mobɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:22">na mayɛ mo Onyankopɔn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 30:22"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 30:23"/>Hwɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">bɛtu abufuhyeɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:23">ntwahoframa bɛdi kyinhyia wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:23">amumuyɛfoɔ mpampam.<verse eid="JER 30:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 30:24"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo rennwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛwie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">nʼakoma mu nhyehyɛeɛ nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 30:24">Nna a ɛreba no mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 30:24">mobɛte yei ase.<verse eid="JER 30:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 30"/>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JER 31"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 31:1"/>“Saa ɛberɛ no,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “Mɛyɛ Israel mmusuakuo no nyinaa Onyankopɔn, na wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ.”<verse eid="JER 31:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 31:2"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">“Nnipa a wɔntotɔ wɔ akofena ano no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:2">bɛnya adom wɔ anweatam so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:2">mede ahomegyeɛ bɛbrɛ Israel.”<verse eid="JER 31:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 31:3"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> daa ne ho adi kyerɛɛ yɛn kane no na ɔkaa sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:3">“Mede ɔdɔ a ɛnsa da adɔ mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:3">mede adɔeɛ atwe mo.<verse eid="JER 31:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 31:4"/>Mede wo bɛsi hɔ bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">na wɔbɛsane de wo asi hɔ, Ao Israel babunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:4">Wobɛfa wʼakasaeɛ bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:4">na wafiri adi ne anigyefoɔ akɔsa.<verse eid="JER 31:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 31:5"/>Bio, mobɛyɛ bobe nturo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">wɔ Samaria nkokoɔ so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:5">akuafoɔ no bɛdua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:5">na wɔadi so aba.<verse eid="JER 31:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 31:6"/>Ɛda bi bɛba a, awɛmfoɔ bɛteam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">wɔ Efraim nkokoɔ so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:6">‘Mommra momma yɛnforo nkɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:6">nkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn nkyɛn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 31:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 31:7"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">“Momfa ahosɛpɛ nto nnwom mma Yakob;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">Monteam mma amanaman mu dikanfoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:7">Momma wɔnte mo ayɛyie na monka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">‘Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char> gye wo nkurɔfoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:7">Israel nkaeɛfoɔ no.’<verse eid="JER 31:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 31:8"/>Hwɛ, mede wɔn bɛfiri atifi fam asase so aba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">na maboa wɔn ano afiri nsase ano.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">Wɔn mu bi bɛyɛ anifirafoɔ, mpakye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:8">apemfoɔ ne mmaa a wɔwɔ awokoɔ mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:8">Ɛdɔm kɛseɛ bɛsane aba.<verse eid="JER 31:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 31:9"/>Wɔde esu na ɛbɛba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">wɔbɛbɔ mpaeɛ ɛberɛ a mede wɔn resane aba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">Mede wɔn bɛfa nsuwa ho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">ɛkwan tamaa a wɔrensunti wɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:9">ɛfiri sɛ mɛyɛ Israel agya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:9">na Efraim yɛ me babarima piesie.<verse eid="JER 31:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 31:10"/>“Montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Ao amanaman;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">mommɔ no dawuro wɔ mpoano nsase a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri so sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:10">‘Deɛ ɔbɔɔ Israel peteeɛ no bɛboaboa wɔn ano</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:10">na wahwɛ ne nnwankuo so sɛ odwanhwɛfoɔ.’<verse eid="JER 31:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 31:11"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛgyina mu ama Yakob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">na wagye wɔn afiri wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:11">wɔwɔ ahoɔden sene wɔn no nsam.<verse eid="JER 31:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 31:12"/>Wɔbɛba na wɔde ahurisie ateam wɔ Sion sorɔnsorɔmmea;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">wɔbɛsɛpɛ wɔn ho wɔ akyɛdeɛ bebrebe a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">atokoɔ, nsã foforɔ ne ngo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">nnwammaa ne anantwie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:12">Wɔbɛyɛ sɛ turo a wɔagugu so nsuo yie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:12">na wɔrenni awerɛhoɔ bio.<verse eid="JER 31:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 31:13"/>Afei, mmabaawa bɛsa na wɔn ani agye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">mmeranteɛ ne nkɔkoraa nso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:13">Mɛma wɔn awerɛhoɔ adane anigyeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:13">mɛma wɔn ahotɔ ne ahosɛpɛ asi awerɛhoɔ anan mu.<verse eid="JER 31:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 31:14"/>Mɛma asɔfoɔ no deɛ ɛhia wɔn ama abu so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">na mama mʼakyɛdeɛ bebrebe amee me nkurɔfoɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:14">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 31:15"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">“Wɔte nne bi wɔ Rama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">awerɛhoɔ ne agyaadwotwa bebree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">Rahel resu ne mma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:15">na ɔmpɛ sɛ wɔkyekyere ne werɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:15">ɛfiri sɛ, ne mma nni hɔ bio.”<verse eid="JER 31:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 31:16"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">“Hyɛ wo ho so na woansu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">mia wʼani na woante nisuo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:16">ɛfiri sɛ wɔbɛtua wʼadwumayɛ so ka,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:16">“Wɔbɛsane afiri atamfoɔ no asase so aba.<verse eid="JER 31:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 31:17"/>Enti anidasoɔ wɔ hɔ ma wo daakye.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:17">Wo mma bɛsane aba wɔn ankasa asase so.<verse eid="JER 31:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 31:18"/>“Ampa ara mate sɛ Efraim resu sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">‘Wotenetenee me so sɛ nantwie ba a nʼani yɛ den,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">na woatwe me mʼaso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:18">Gye me bio, na mɛsane aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:18">ɛfiri sɛ wo ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, me Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 31:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 31:19"/>Memaneeɛ akyi no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">menyaa adwensakyera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">na akyire a menyaa nteaseɛ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">mede awerɛhoɔ boroo me koko so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:19">Mʼanim guu ase na mefɛreeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:19">ɛfiri sɛ me mmabunu mu animguaseɛ da so so me.’<verse eid="JER 31:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 31:20"/>Efraim nyɛ me babarima dɔfoɔ anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">Efraim nyɛ ɔba a ɔsɔ mʼani anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Ɛwom sɛ metaa kasa tia no deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">nanso meda so kae no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:20">Enti mʼakoma pere hwehwɛ no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">mewɔ ayamhyehyeɛ ma no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:20">sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 31:21"/>“Momfa ahyɛnsodeɛ nsisi ɛkwan ho;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">monsisi akwankyerɛ afadum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Monhyɛ ɛkwantempɔn no nso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">ɛkwan a monam so ba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:21">Sane wakyi, Ao ɔbabunu Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:21">sane bra wo nkuro so.<verse eid="JER 31:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 31:22"/>Wobɛkyinkyini akɔsi da bɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">Ao, ɔbabaa ɔsesafoɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:22">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛyɛ ade foforɔ wɔ asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:22">ɔbaa bɛbɔ ɔbarima ho ban.”<verse eid="JER 31:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 31:23"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ: “Sɛ mesane de wɔn firi nnommumfa mu ba a, nnipa a wɔwɔ Yuda asase ne nkuro so bɛsane aka saa nsɛm yi bio sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> nhyira wo, Ao, tenenee atenaeɛ, Ao, bepɔ kronkron.’ <verse eid="JER 31:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 31:24"/>Nnipa bɛbom atena ase wɔ Yuda ne ne nkuro nyinaa so, akuafoɔ ne wɔn a wɔde wɔn nnwankuo nenam. <verse eid="JER 31:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 31:25"/>Mɛma deɛ wabrɛ no anya ahoɔden foforɔ, na deɛ watɔ baha no nso mɛma no amee.”<verse eid="JER 31:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 31:26"/>Ɛha na menyaneeɛ, na mehwɛɛ me ho hyiaeɛ. Me nna no kɔɔ me yie.<verse eid="JER 31:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 31:27"/>“Nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “a mede nnipa mma ne mmoa mma bɛdua Israel ne Yuda efie. <verse eid="JER 31:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 31:28"/>Sɛdeɛ mehwɛ ma wɔtutuiɛ, wɔdwiriiɛ, wɔbubuiɛ, wɔsɛeɛ na wɔde amanehunu baeɛ no, saa ara na mɛhwɛ ama wɔasi na wɔadua,” sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie. <verse eid="JER 31:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 31:29"/>Saa nna no mu, nnipa renka bio sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:29">“ ‘Agyanom adi bobe a ɛkeka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:29">na mma se afem.’<verse eid="JER 31:29"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 31:30"/>Ɛno enti, obiara bɛwu wɔ ɔno ara bɔne ho; deɛ ɔbɛdi bobe a ɛkeka no, ɔno na ne se bɛfem.<verse eid="JER 31:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 31:31"/>“Ɛberɛ no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">“a me ne Israel efie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:31">ne Yuda efie bɛyɛ apam foforɔ.<verse eid="JER 31:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 31:32"/>Ɛrenyɛ sɛ apam a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">me ne wɔn agyanom yɛeɛ no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">ɛberɛ a mesɔɔ wɔn nsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">dii wɔn anim firii Misraim no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:32">Saa ɛberɛ no deɛ, wɔbuu mʼapam so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">wɔ ɛberɛ a na meyɛ okunu ma wɔn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:32">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 31:33"/>“Nanso yei ne apam a me ne Israel efie bɛyɛ saa ɛberɛ no akyi,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">“Mede me mmara bɛhyɛ wɔn adwene mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">na matwerɛ wɔ wɔn akoma so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:33">Mɛyɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:33">na wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ.<verse eid="JER 31:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 31:34"/>Na obiara renkyerɛkyerɛ ne yɔnko bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">anaa ne nua sɛ, ‘Hunu <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn nyinaa bɛhunu me,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">ɛfiri wɔn mu akumaa so, kɔsi ɔkɛseɛ so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:34">“Na mede wɔn amumuyɛ bɛkyɛ wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:34">na merenkae wɔn bɔne bio.”<verse eid="JER 31:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 31:35"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">deɛ ɔma owia hyerɛn adekyeeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">na ɔhyɛ ɔsrane ne nsoromma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">sɛ wɔnhyerɛn anadwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">deɛ ɔkanyane ɛpo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:35">ma ɛbɔ asorɔkye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:35">Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din.<verse eid="JER 31:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 31:36"/>“Saa ahyɛdeɛ yi twam mpo a,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:36">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:36">“merennyaa Israel da.”<verse eid="JER 31:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 31:37"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">“Sɛ wɔbɛtumi asusu ewiem ntrɛmu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">na wɔatumi ahwehwɛ asase ase fapem mpo a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 31:37">ɛwom sɛ Israel ayɛ bɔne deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">nanso merempa Israel asefoɔ nyinaa da,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 31:37">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 31:37"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 31:38"/>“Nna no reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, “a wɔbɛkyekyere kuropɔn yi bio ama me, firi Hananel abantenten kɔsi Twɛtwɛwaso Ɛpono. <verse eid="JER 31:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 31:39"/>Wɔbɛtwe susuhoma no mu, afiri hɔ de akɔsi Gareb kokoɔ so, na akontono akɔ Goa. <verse eid="JER 31:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 31:40"/>Bɔnhwa a wɔto afunu ne nsõ gu mu no nyinaa ne asase a ɛkɔ Kidron bɔnhwa wɔ apueeɛ fam, kɔsi apɔnkɔ ɛpono no twɛtwɛwaso bɛyɛ kronkron ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char>. Wɔrentutu na wɔrensɛe kuropɔn no da.”<verse eid="JER 31:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 31"/>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JER 32"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Tɔ Asase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 32:1"/>Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ wɔ Yudahene Sedekia adedie afe a ɛtɔ so edu a na ɛyɛ Nebukadnessar adedie afe a ɛtɔ so dunwɔtwe. <verse eid="JER 32:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 32:2"/>Na Babiloniahene akodɔm aka Yerusalem ahyɛ a na odiyifoɔ Yeremia nso da dua mu wɔ awɛmfoɔ adihɔ a ɛwɔ Yuda ahemfie.<verse eid="JER 32:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 32:3"/>Na Yudahene Sedekia de no ato afiase na ɔrebisa no sɛ adɛn enti na wohyɛ nkɔm sɛ, “Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: ‘Mede saa kuropɔn yi rebɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na wafa no nnommum. <verse eid="JER 32:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 32:4"/>Yudahene Sedekia renya ɛkwan nnwane mfiri Babiloniafoɔ nsam, na ampa ara hyɛ na wɔde no bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na ɔne no akasa anim ne anim na ɔde nʼani ahunu no. <verse eid="JER 32:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 32:5"/>Ɔde Sedekia bɛkɔ Babilonia, na ɛhɔ na ɔbɛtena akɔsi sɛ me ne no bɛdi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. Sɛ woko tia Babiloniafoɔ no a worenni nkonim.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 32:6"/>Yeremia kaa sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa me nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 32:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 32:7"/>Wo wɔfa Salum babarima Hanamel rebɛba wo nkyɛn, abɛka sɛ, ‘Tɔ mʼasase a ɛwɔ Anatot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anatot—Yeremia kurom.</char></note> no, ɛfiri sɛ woyɛ me busuani nimpɔn na wowɔ ho ɛkwan, na ɛyɛ wʼasɛdeɛ nso sɛ wotɔ.’<verse eid="JER 32:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 32:8"/>“Na sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka no me wɔfa ba Hanamel baa me nkyɛn wɔ awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ bɛkaa sɛ, ‘Tɔ mʼasase a ɛwɔ Anatot wɔ Benyamin mantam mu no. Esiane sɛ wowɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ wogyeɛ na wofa no enti, tɔ na fa.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 32:8">“Mehunuu sɛ yei yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm.” <verse eid="JER 32:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 32:9"/>Enti, metɔɔ asase a na ɛwɔ Anatot no firii me wɔfa ba Hanamel nkyɛn na metuaa dwetɛ gram ɔha ne aduɔkron ɛnan (194) maa no. <verse eid="JER 32:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 32:10"/>Mede me nsa hyɛɛ adetɔ nwoma no ase, sɔɔ ano<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">sɔɔ ano—Ɛnyɛ sɛ ɔde nsa bɛhyɛ aseɛ sɛ ɛyɛ nokorɛ nko, na mmom, sɛdeɛ wɔbɛhyɛ nhyehyɛeɛ no mu nsɛm no mu den na amma obiara antumi ansakra mu.</char></note> wɔ adansefoɔ anim, na mede nsania karii dwetɛ mpɔ no. <verse eid="JER 32:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 32:11"/>Na mefaa adetɔ nwoma no, deɛ wɔasɔ ano a ɛho nhyehyɛeɛ wɔ mu no, ne deɛ wɔnsɔɔ ano no nso, <verse eid="JER 32:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 32:12"/>na mede saa adetɔ nwoma no maa Neria babarima Baruk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baruk—Aseɛ ne “Awurade ahyira no.” Na ɔyɛ Yeremia twerɛfoɔ nokwafoɔ.</char></note> a, ɔyɛ Maaseia nana no wɔ me wɔfa ba Hanamel, adansefoɔ a wɔde wɔn nsa hyɛɛ adetɔ nwoma no ase ne Yudafoɔ a na wɔwɔ awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ no nyinaa anim.<verse eid="JER 32:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 32:13"/>“Meka kyerɛɛ Baruk wɔ wɔn nyinaa anim sɛ, <verse eid="JER 32:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 32:14"/>‘Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ nie, Fa saa adetɔ so nwoma yi, deɛ wɔasɔ ano ne deɛ wɔnnsɔɔ ano, na fa gu dɔteɛ asuhina mu, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛkyɛre yie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fa to asuhina mu sɛdeɛ ɛbɛkyɛre yie—Krataa a wɔhunuu no asuhina mu wɔ Ɛlefantin ne Kumram (nkuro a ɛdeda Nkyene Po atɔeɛ fam) no dii mfeɛ 2,000 ne akyire a ɛho anka.</char></note> <verse eid="JER 32:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 32:15"/>Deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, no seɛ nie: Wɔbɛtotɔ afie, mfuo ne bobe nturo wɔ asase yi so bio.’<verse eid="JER 32:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 32:16"/>“Mede adetɔ nwoma no maa Neria babarima Baruk. Akyire no, mebɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mpaeɛ sɛ,<verse eid="JER 32:16"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 32:17"/>“Ao, Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo na wonam wo tumi ne wo basa a woatene muo so abɔ ɔsoro ne asase. Biribiara nyɛ den mma wo. <verse eid="JER 32:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 32:18"/>Woyi ɔdɔ adi kyerɛ mpempem, nanso wotua agyanom amumuyɛ so ka gu wɔn mma a wɔdi wɔn akyi srɛ so. Ao, Onyankopɔn a woso na wowɔ tumi, wo din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, <verse eid="JER 32:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 32:19"/>wo botaeɛ so, na wo nneyɛeɛ yɛ kɛseɛ. Wʼaniwa hunu nnipa akwan nyinaa; na wotua obiara ka sɛdeɛ nʼabrabɔ ne ne nneyɛeɛ teɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 32:20"/>Woyɛɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ wɔ Misraim na atoa so de abɛsi ɛnnɛ wɔ Israel ne adasamma nyinaa mu, na wode agye din a ɛwɔ wo de bɛsi ɛnnɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 32:21"/>Wode nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ne anwanwadeɛ, nsa a ɛyɛ den ne abasa a watene mu ne nneɛma ɛyɛ hu yii wo ɔman Israel firii Misraim. <verse eid="JER 32:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 32:22"/>Wode asase a wokaa ho ntam sɛ wode bɛma wɔn agyanom no maa wɔn, asase a nufosuo ne ɛwoɔ resene so. <verse eid="JER 32:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 32:23"/>Wɔba bɛfaeɛ, na wɔtenaa so, nanso wɔantie wo, na wɔanni wo mmara so; wɔanyɛ deɛ wohyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnyɛ no. Enti wode saa amanehunu yi nyinaa baa wɔn so.<verse eid="JER 32:23"/></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 32:24"/>“Hwɛ sɛdeɛ wɔasisi ntuano mpampim de rebɛgye kuropɔn no. Esiane akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm enti, wɔde kuropɔn no bɛhyɛ Babiloniafoɔ a wɔreto ahyɛ ne so no nsa. Deɛ wokaeɛ no aba mu sɛdeɛ wohunu no seesei no. <verse eid="JER 32:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 32:25"/>Na ɛwom sɛ wɔde kuropɔn no bɛhyɛ Babiloniafoɔ nsa deɛ, nanso wo, Ao, Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, ka kyerɛ me sɛ, ‘Fa dwetɛ tɔ asase na ma adansefoɔ mmra ɛho nhyehyɛeɛ no mu.’ ”<verse eid="JER 32:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 32:26"/>Ɛna <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 32:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 32:27"/>“Mene <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adasamma nyinaa Onyankopɔn. Na biribi yɛ den dodo ma me anaa? <verse eid="JER 32:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 32:28"/>Enti, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Mede kuropɔn yi rebɛhyɛ Babiloniafoɔ ne Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar nsa, na wɔafa. <verse eid="JER 32:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 32:29"/>Babiloniafoɔ a wɔreto ahyɛ saa kuropɔn yi so no bɛba mu, na wɔato mu ogya; wɔbɛhye no dworobɛɛ, ɛno ne afie a nnipa hyee nnuhwam wɔ atifi maa Baal na wɔhwiee afɔrebɔ nsã maa anyame foforɔ de hyɛɛ me abufuo.<verse eid="JER 32:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 32:30"/>“Israelfoɔ ne Yudafoɔ nyɛɛ biribiara sɛ bɔne wɔ mʼani so, ɛfiri wɔn mmabunu berɛ mu; ampa ara Israelfoɔ nnyɛɛ biribiara sɛ wɔde nneɛma a wɔde wɔn nsa ayɛ bɛhyɛ me abufuo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 32:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 32:31"/>Ɛfiri da a wɔkyekyeree saa kuropɔn yi de bɛsi ɛnnɛ, wahyɛ me abufuo ne abufutrasoɔ a ɛsɛ sɛ anka meyi no firi mʼani so. <verse eid="JER 32:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 32:32"/>Israelfoɔ ne Yudafoɔ de bɔne a wɔayɛ nyinaa ahyɛ me abufuo, wɔn, wɔn ahemfo ne adwumayɛfoɔ, wɔn asɔfoɔ ne adiyifoɔ, mmarima a wɔwɔ Yuda ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 32:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 32:33"/>Wɔdanee wɔn akyi kyerɛɛ me; ɛwom, mekyerɛkyerɛ wɔn ɛberɛ biara deɛ, nanso wɔantie na wɔammfa ntenesoɔ. <verse eid="JER 32:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 32:34"/>Wɔasisi ahoni a ɛyɛ akyiwadeɛ wɔ efie a me Din da so no mu, de guu ho fi. <verse eid="JER 32:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 32:35"/>Wɔsisii sorɔnsorɔmmea maa Baal wɔ Ben Hinom bɔnhwa mu, de wɔn mmammarima ne mmammaa bɔɔ afɔdeɛ maa Molek, wɔ ɛberɛ a menhyɛɛ wɔn na ɛmmaa mʼadwene mu da sɛ wɔnyɛ saa akyiwadeɛ yi mma Yuda nyɛ bɔne.<verse eid="JER 32:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 32:36"/>“Woreka wɔ kuropɔn yi ho sɛ, ‘Wɔnam akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm so de bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa’; nanso yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: <verse eid="JER 32:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 32:37"/>Ampa ara mɛboaboa wɔn ano afiri nsase a mefiri mʼabufuhyeɛ mu pamoo wɔn kɔguiɛ hɔ; mɛsane de wɔn aba ha na mama wɔatena ase ahotɔ mu. <verse eid="JER 32:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 32:38"/>Wɔbɛyɛ me nkurɔfoɔ, na mayɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn. <verse eid="JER 32:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 32:39"/>Na mɛma wɔn akoma korɔ na wɔayɛ wɔn adeɛ abɔ mu, sɛdeɛ, ɛberɛ biara wɔbɛsuro me wɔn ankasa ne wɔn nkyirimma yiedie enti. <verse eid="JER 32:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 32:40"/>Na me ne wɔn bɛyɛ daapem apam: Merennyae wɔn yieyɛ da, na mede ɔpɛ bɛhyɛ wɔn akoma mu, ama wɔn asuro me, sɛdeɛ wɔrentwe wɔn ho mfiri me ho da. <verse eid="JER 32:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 32:41"/>Mʼani bɛgye sɛ mɛyɛ wɔn yie, na ampa ara mede mʼakoma ne me kra nyinaa bɛdua wɔn wɔ asase yi so.<verse eid="JER 32:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 32:42"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Sɛdeɛ mede amanehunu kɛseɛ yi nyinaa aba nkurɔfoɔ yi so no, saa ara na mede yiedie a mahyɛ wɔn ho bɔ no bɛma wɔn. <verse eid="JER 32:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 32:43"/>Wɔbɛtotɔ nsase bio wɔ ha, deɛ moka wɔ ho sɛ, ‘Wɔde ahyɛ Babiloniafoɔ nsa, ɛno enti ada mpan, na nnipa anaa mmoa nni so.’ <verse eid="JER 32:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 32:44"/>Wɔde dwetɛ bɛtotɔ nsase, na wɔbɛyɛ adetɔ nwoma wɔ so. Wɔbɛsɔ ano wɔ adansefoɔ anim wɔ Benyamin mantam, nkuraase a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia, nkuro a ɛwɔ Yuda, bepɔ so ɔman, atɔeɛ fam mmepɔ ase ne Negeb, ɛfiri sɛ, mɛsane de wɔn ahonyadeɛ ama wɔn, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.”<verse eid="JER 32:44"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 32"/>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JER 33"/>
  <para style="s1">Ɔgyeɛ Ho Bɔhyɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 33:1"/>Ɛberɛ a, Yeremia da so da dua mu wɔ awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa ne nkyɛn ne mprenu so sɛ: <verse eid="JER 33:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 33:2"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, deɛ ɔbɔɔ asase, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔyɛeɛ ma ɛtimiiɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din: <verse eid="JER 33:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 33:3"/>‘Frɛ me na mɛgye wo so, na maka wo nsɛm akɛseɛ ne nneɛma a ahinta a wonnim. <verse eid="JER 33:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 33:4"/>Na sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn ka: Moabubu afie a ɛwɔ saa kuropɔn yi mu ne Yuda ahemfie ahodoɔ sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a mobɛnya mmubuiɛ de agyina afasuo no atia mo atamfoɔ ntuano epie ne akofena. <verse eid="JER 33:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 33:5"/>Moayɛ mo adwen sɛ mo ne Babiloniafoɔ bɛko, nanso mede mʼabufuo ne mʼabufuhyeɛ bɛkunkum mo, na mo afunu bɛyɛ hɔ ma. Mɛyi mʼani afiri saa kuropɔn yi so ɛsiane nʼamumuyɛ nyinaa enti.<verse eid="JER 33:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 33:6"/>“ ‘Nanso, mede ahoɔden ne ayaresa bɛbrɛ no; mɛsa me nkurɔfoɔ yadeɛ na mama wɔn anya asomdwoeɛ ne banbɔ a ɛdɔɔso. <verse eid="JER 33:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 33:7"/>Mɛsane de Yuda ne Israel afiri nnommumfa mu aba na masane agye wɔn asi hɔ sɛ dea na wɔte dada no. <verse eid="JER 33:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 33:8"/>Mɛhohoro wɔn bɔne a wɔayɛ atia me no nyinaa, na mede wɔn atuateɛ ho bɔne nso akyɛ wɔn. <verse eid="JER 33:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 33:9"/>Na saa kuropɔn yi bɛma me din ahyeta. Ɛbɛma me anigyeɛ, ayɛyie ne animuonyam wɔ asase so aman nyinaa a wɔte nnepa a meyɛ ma no nyinaa mu; wɔbɛsuro na wɔn ho apopo wɔ yiedie ne asomdwoeɛ bebrebe a mede ma no enti.’<verse eid="JER 33:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 33:10"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Woka fa saa beaeɛ yi ho sɛ, “Ada mpan, a nnipa anaasɛ mmoa nni so.” Nanso, Yuda nkuro ne Yerusalem mmɔntene a ada mpan na nnipa anaa mmoa nni no, ɛhɔ na wɔbɛsane ate bio <verse eid="JER 33:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 33:11"/>ahurisie ne anigyeɛ nnyegyeɛ, ayeforɔ ne ayeforɔkunu nne ne wɔn a wɔde aseda afɔrebɔdeɛ reba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie nne sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:11">“ ‘Momfa aseda mma Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:11">na ne dɔ wɔ hɔ daa.’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="JER 33:11">Na mɛsane de asase no so nnepa a ɛwɔ hɔ dada no aba bio, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 33:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 33:12"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Ɛha yi a ada mpan a nnipa ne mmoa nni mu no; ne nkuro nyinaa so no wɔbɛnya adidibea ama nnwanhwɛfoɔ deɛ wɔn nnwankuo bɛhome. <verse eid="JER 33:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 33:13"/>Nkuro a ɛwɔ bepɔ so ɔman mu, atɔeɛ fam mmepɔ ase mu, Negeb, Benyamin mantam mu, nkuraase a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia ne Yuda nkuro mu, nnwankuo bɛtwam bio wɔ deɛ ɔkane wɔn nsa ase.’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na aka.<verse eid="JER 33:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 33:14"/>“ ‘Nna no reba,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, a mɛma adom bɔhyɛ a mehyɛɛ Israel efie ne Yudafie aba mu.<verse eid="JER 33:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 33:15"/>“ ‘Nna no mu ne saa ɛberɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">mɛma tenenee Duban afefɛ afiri Dawid ase;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:15">ɔbɛyɛ deɛ ɛtene ne deɛ ɛyɛ wɔ asase no so.<verse eid="JER 33:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 33:16"/>Saa nna no mu, wɔbɛgye Yuda nkwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">na Yerusalem bɛtena asomdwoeɛ mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 33:16">Yei ne din a wɔde bɛfrɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 33:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Yɛn Tenenee.’<verse eid="JER 33:16"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 33:17"/>Na yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Ɔbarima a ɔbɛtena Israel efie ahennwa so no remmɔ Dawid da, <verse eid="JER 33:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 33:18"/>saa ara nso na asɔfoɔ a wɔyɛ Lewifoɔ no, ɔbarima a ɔbɛgyina mʼanim daa abɔ ɔhyeɛ afɔdeɛ ne aduane afɔdeɛ na ɔde afɔdeɛ ahodoɔ abrɛ me, remmɔ wɔn da.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 33:19"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ: <verse eid="JER 33:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 33:20"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: ‘Sɛ wobɛtumi abu me ne adekyeɛ ne adesaeɛ apam so, na adekyeɛ ne adesaeɛ amma wɔn ɛberɛ a wɔahyehyɛ no a, <verse eid="JER 33:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 33:21"/>ɛnneɛ na me ne mʼakoa Dawid apam ne Lewifoɔ a wɔyɛ asɔfoɔ a wɔsom wɔ mʼanim no apam no nso, wobɛtumi abu so, na Dawid rennya nʼaseni a ɔbɛtena ahennwa so adi ɔhene bio. <verse eid="JER 33:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 33:22"/>Mɛma mʼakoa Dawid asefoɔ ne Lewifoɔ a wɔsom wɔ mʼanim no ase adɔre te sɛ ɔsoro nsoromma a wɔntumi nkane ne mpoano anwea a wɔntumi nsusuo.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 33:23"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 33:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 33:24"/>“Wontee sɛ nnipa yi reka sɛ, ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> apo ahennie mmienu a ɔyiiɛ no’ anaa? Enti wɔbu me ɔman animtia na wɔmmfa wɔn sɛ wɔyɛ ɔman bio. <verse eid="JER 33:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 33:25"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: ‘Sɛ mantintim me ne adekyeɛ ne adesaeɛ apam ne ɔsoro ne asase mmara no a, <verse eid="JER 33:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 33:26"/>ɛnneɛ anka mɛpo Yakob ne mʼakoa Dawid asefoɔ, na merennyi ne mmammarima mu baako sɛ ɔnni Abraham, Isak ne Yakob asefoɔ so. Na mede wɔn ahonyadeɛ bɛsane ama wɔn, na manya ayamhyehyeɛ ama wɔn.’ ”<verse eid="JER 33:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 33"/>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JER 34"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔbɔ Sedekia Kɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 34:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼakodɔm ne nʼahennie nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔwɔ ahemman a ɔdi soɔ no mu reko tia Yerusalem ne nkuro a atwa ne ho ahyia no, saa asɛm yi firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ sɛ, <verse eid="JER 34:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 34:2"/>“Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ nie: Kɔ Yudahene Sedekia nkyɛn na kɔka kyerɛ no sɛ, ‘Sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Mede kuropɔn yi rebɛhyɛ Babiloniahene nsa, na ɔbɛhye no dworobɛɛ. <verse eid="JER 34:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 34:3"/>Worennwane mfiri ne nsam na nokorɛm wɔbɛkyere wo de wo akɔma no. Wo de wʼani bɛhunu Babiloniahene na ɔne wo bɛkasa anim ne anim. Na wobɛkɔ Babilonia.<verse eid="JER 34:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 34:4"/>“ ‘Nanso tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɔhyɛ, Ao, Yudahene Sedekia. Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa wo ho: Worenwu wɔ akofena ano; <verse eid="JER 34:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 34:5"/>na wobɛwu asomdwoeɛ mu. Sɛdeɛ nnipa bɔɔ ayiyɛ gyatanaa de hyɛɛ wʼagyanom animuonyam, ahemfo dada a wɔdii wʼanim no, saa ara na wɔbɛbɔ gyatanaa ahyɛ wo animuonyam na wɔabɔ bena sɛ, “Ao owura!” Me ankasa na mehyɛ saa bɔ yi, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 34:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 34:6"/>Na odiyifoɔ Yeremia kaa yeinom nyinaa kyerɛɛ Yudahene Sedekia wɔ Yerusalem, <verse eid="JER 34:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 34:7"/>ɛberɛ a Babiloniahene akodɔm reko tia Yerusalem ne Yuda nkuropɔn, Lakis ne Aseka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">34.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lakis ne Aseka—Salomo babarima Rehoboam bɔɔ saa nkuro yi ho ban nanso akyire yi, Asiria ɔhempɔn Senaherib tuaa ano wɔ Lakis ɔhene Hesekia berɛ so. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CH 32:9">2 Be 32.9</ref></char>)</char></note> a na wɔgu so reko wɔ hɔ. Yei ne nkuropɔn a na aka wɔ Yuda a wɔwɔ banbɔ.<verse eid="JER 34:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkoa Ahofadie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 34:8"/>Asɛm no firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn ɛberɛ a ɔhene Sedekia ne Yerusalemfoɔ ayɛ apam sɛ wɔbɛma nkoa ahofadie no akyi. <verse eid="JER 34:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 34:9"/>Ɛsɛ sɛ obiara gyaa ne nkoa ne mfenaa Hebrifoɔ; na obiara nni ho ɛkwan sɛ ɔde ne yɔnko Yudani yɛ akoa. <verse eid="JER 34:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 34:10"/>Enti adwumayɛfoɔ no nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔyɛɛ saa apam yi penee so sɛ wɔbɛgyaa wɔn nkoa ne mfenaa, na wɔremfa wɔn nyɛ nkoa bio. Wɔpenee so, na wɔgyaa wɔn. <verse eid="JER 34:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 34:11"/>Nanso, akyire yi, wɔsesaa wɔn adwene na wɔsane faa nnipa a wɔgyaa wɔn no de wɔn yɛɛ nkoa bio.<verse eid="JER 34:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 34:12"/>Na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 34:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 34:13"/>“Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ nie: Me ne mo agyanom yɛɛ apam ɛberɛ a meyii wɔn firii Misraim, nkoasom asase so no. Mekaa sɛ, <verse eid="JER 34:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 34:14"/>‘Mfeɛ nson biara no, ɛsɛ sɛ mo mu biara gyaa ne yɔnko Hebrini a watɔn ne ho ama no. Sɛ wasom mfeɛ nsia a gyaa no na ɔmfa ne ho nni.’ Nanso, mo agyanom antie na wɔamfa mʼasɛm. <verse eid="JER 34:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 34:15"/>Ɛnkyɛree koraa monuu mo ho na moyɛɛ deɛ ɛyɛ wɔ mʼani so: Mo mu biara paee ahofadie maa ne ɔman mma. Mpo moyɛɛ apam wɔ mʼanim, wɔ efie a me Din da soɔ no mu. <verse eid="JER 34:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 34:16"/>Nanso seesei, moadane mo ho na moahura me din ho; mo mu biara asane akɔfa nkoa ne mfenaa a mogyaa wɔn sɛ wɔnkɔ baabiara a wɔpɛ no. Moahyɛ wɔn ama wɔayɛ mo nkoa bio.<verse eid="JER 34:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 34:17"/>“Afei, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Montiee me na mompaee ahofadie mmaa mo ankasa nkurɔfoɔ. Enti afei mepae mu ka ahofadie ma mo, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. Mɛgyaa mo ama akofena, ɔyaredɔm ne ɔkɔm. Mɛma mo ayɛ akyiwadeɛ ama asase so ahennie ahodoɔ nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 34:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 34:18"/>Nnipa a wɔabu mʼapam so, na wɔanni nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛwɔ apam a wɔayɛ wɔ mʼanim no so no, mɛyɛ wɔn sɛ nantwie ba a wɔpaee ne mu mmienu na wɔnantee nʼafaafa no ntam no. <verse eid="JER 34:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 34:19"/>Yuda ne Yerusalem ntuanofoɔ, asɛnniiɛ adwumayɛfoɔ, asɔfoɔ ne asase no so nnipa no nyinaa a monante faa nantwie ba no afaafa no ntam no, <verse eid="JER 34:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 34:20"/>mede wɔn bɛma wɔn atamfoɔ a wɔrepɛ wɔn nkwa no. Wɔn afunu bɛyɛ aduane ama ewiem nnomaa ne asase so mmoa.<verse eid="JER 34:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 34:21"/>“Mede Yudahene Sedekia ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ bɛhyɛ wɔn atamfoɔ a wɔrepɛ wɔn nkwa, Babiloniahene akodɔm a wɔatwe wɔn ho no nsa. <verse eid="JER 34:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 34:22"/>Merebɛhyɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm nie, na mɛsane de wɔn aba kuropɔn yi mu. Wɔbɛko atia no, wɔbɛfa, na wɔahye no dwerɛbee. Na mɛma Yuda nkuro ada mpan a ɔbiara rentumi ntena hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 34:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 34"/>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JER 35"/>
  <para style="s1">Rekabfoɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 35:1"/>Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ ɛberɛ a na Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim di adeɛ no: <verse eid="JER 35:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 35:2"/>“Kɔ Rekabfoɔ abusua no nkyɛn, na to nsa frɛ wɔn na wɔmmra <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie no mpia baako mu, na ma wɔn nsã nnom.”<verse eid="JER 35:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 35:3"/>Enti, mekɔpɛɛ Habasinia babarima Yeremia babarima Yaasania ne ne nuammarima ne ne mmammarima nyinaa, Rekabfoɔ abusuadɔm no. <verse eid="JER 35:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 35:4"/>Mede wɔn baa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie, na mede wɔn kɔɔ Onyame onipa Yigdalia babarima Hanan mmammarima dan mu. Ɛno na ɛdi adwumayɛfoɔ dan a ɛsi ɔpono ano hwɛfoɔ Salum babarima Maaseia dan atifi no so. <verse eid="JER 35:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 35:5"/>Afei mede nkuruwa ne nkora a nsã wɔ mu bɛsisii Rekabfoɔ abusua mma no anim na meka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Monnom nsã kakra.”<verse eid="JER 35:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 35:6"/>Nanso wɔbuaa sɛ, “Yɛnnom nsã,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">35.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yɛnnom nsã—Rekabfoɔ daa daa ntam a wɔaka. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="NUM 6:2-3">4 Mose 6.2-3</ref>,<ref loc="NUM 6:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:4-7">Ate 13.4-7</ref></char>)</char></note> ɛfiri sɛ yɛn nana Rekab babarima Yehonadab maa yɛn ɔhyɛ nsɛm yi sɛ, ‘Ɛnsɛ sɛ mo anaa mo asefoɔ nom nsã. <verse eid="JER 35:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 35:7"/>Na afei ɛnsɛ sɛ mosisi afie, modua anaa moyɛ bobe nturo, ɛnsɛ sɛ moyɛ yeinom mu biara, na mmom montena ntomadan mu ɛberɛ biara. Ɛno na mo nkwa nna bɛware, wɔ asase a moyɛ atutenafoɔ wɔ so no so.’ <verse eid="JER 35:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 35:8"/>Yɛatie biribiara a yɛn nana Rekab babarima Yonadab hyɛɛ yɛn no. Na yɛn, yɛn yerenom, mmammarima ne mmammaa nnom nsã da <verse eid="JER 35:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 35:9"/>na yɛnsisii afie ntenaa mu anaa yɛnnyaa bobe nturo anaa mfuo anaa nnɔbaeɛ. <verse eid="JER 35:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 35:10"/>Yɛatenatena ntomadan mu, na yɛadi biribiara a yɛn nana Yehonadab hyɛɛ yɛn no so pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="JER 35:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 35:11"/>Nanso, ɛberɛ a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar tuu asase yi so sa no, yɛkaa sɛ, ‘Mommra, ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ Yerusalem na yɛdwane firi Babiloniafoɔ ne Aramfoɔ akodɔm anim.’ Ɛno enti yɛaka Yerusalem.”<verse eid="JER 35:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 35:12"/>Afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 35:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 35:13"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ: Kɔ na kɔka kyerɛ mmarima a wɔwɔ Yuda ne Yerusalemfoɔ sɛ, ‘Morensua biribi na morentie mʼasɛm anaa?’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 35:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 35:14"/>‘Rekab ba Yehonadab hyɛɛ ne mmammarima sɛ wɔnnom nsã, na wɔadi saa ɔhyɛ yi so. Ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ wɔnnom nsã, ɛfiri sɛ wɔdi wɔn agyanom ahyɛdeɛ so. Na makasa akyerɛ mo mpɛn bebree, nanso montiee me. <verse eid="JER 35:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 35:15"/>Mesomaa mʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ nyinaa baa mo nkyɛn mpɛn bebree. Wɔkaa sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ mo mu biara sesa firi nʼamumuyɛ akwan ho, na moma mo akwan tene; monni anyame foforɔ akyi na monnsom wɔn. Ɛno na mobɛtena asase a mede ama mo ne mo agyanom yi so.” Nanso mommuaa me na monntiee me. <verse eid="JER 35:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 35:16"/>Rekab babarima Yehonadab asefoɔ adi ahyɛdeɛ a wɔn agyanom de maa wɔn no so, nanso saa nnipa yi ntie mʼasɛm.’<verse eid="JER 35:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 35:17"/>“Ɛno enti, yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ: ‘Montie! Mede amanehunu biara a mahyɛ ama Yuda ne obiara a ɔte Yerusalem no bɛba wɔn so. Mekasa kyerɛɛ wɔn, nanso wɔantie, mefrɛɛ wɔn nanso wɔannye so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 35:18"/>Afei, Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Rekab abusua no sɛ, “Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ: ‘Moayɛ ɔsetie ama mo nana Yehonadab ahyɛdeɛ no, na moadi ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so, na moayɛ biribiara a ɔhyɛɛ mo no.’ <verse eid="JER 35:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 35:19"/>Ɛno enti, deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn no seɛ nie: ‘Rekab babarima Yehonadab bɛnya ɔbarima a ɔbɛsom me ɛberɛ biara.’ ”<verse eid="JER 35:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 35"/>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JER 36"/>
  <para style="s1">Yehoiakim Hye Yeremia Nwoma Mmobɔeɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 36:1"/>Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim afe a ɛtɔ so ɛnan mu, saa asɛm yi firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ, <verse eid="JER 36:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 36:2"/>“Fa nwoma mmobɔeɛ, na twerɛ nsɛm a maka akyerɛ wo fa Israel, Yuda ne aman a aka no ho nyinaa, ɛfiri ɛberɛ a mefirii aseɛ kasa kyerɛɛ wo wɔ Yosia adedie berɛ so bɛsi ɛnnɛ gu so. <verse eid="JER 36:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 36:3"/>Ebia, sɛ Yudafoɔ te amanehunu biara a mayɛ mʼadwene sɛ mede bɛba wɔn so a, wɔn mu biara bɛdane afiri nʼamumuyɛ ho na afei mede wɔn amumuyɛ ne wɔn bɔne bɛkyɛ wɔn.”<verse eid="JER 36:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 36:4"/>Enti, Yeremia frɛɛ Neria babarima Baruk, na ɛberɛ a ɔreka nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ no nyinaa no, Baruk twerɛ guu nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu. <verse eid="JER 36:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 36:5"/>Afei, Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Baruk sɛ, “Meda dua mu; merentumi nkɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu. <verse eid="JER 36:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 36:6"/>Enti, kɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie mmuadadie da bi na kenkan nsɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn a meka ma wotwerɛ guu nwoma mmobɔeɛ no so no kyerɛ nnipa no. Kenkan kyerɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔfiri wɔn nkuro so aba no. <verse eid="JER 36:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 36:7"/>Ebia wɔde wɔn nkotosrɛ bɛba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim na wɔn mu biara adane afiri nʼamumuyɛ akwan ho, ɛfiri sɛ abufuo ne abufuhyeɛ nsɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka atia saa nnipa yi so.” <verse eid="JER 36:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 36:8"/>Neria babarima Baruk yɛɛ biribiara a odiyifoɔ Yeremia kyerɛɛ no sɛ ɔnyɛ no, ɔkenkanee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsɛm a ɛwɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no mu. <verse eid="JER 36:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 36:9"/>Ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nkron wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim adedie afe a ɛtɔ so enum so no, wɔpaee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> anim mmuadadie maa nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem nyinaa ne wɔn a wɔfiri Yuda nkuro so aba no. <verse eid="JER 36:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 36:10"/>Baruk kenkanee Yeremia nsɛm a ɛwɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu kyerɛɛ nnipa a wɔwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan no mu nyinaa; firii Safan babarima Gemaria a ɔyɛ ɔtwerɛfoɔ no pia a ɛwɔ asɔredan no atifi adihɔ na ɛbɛn Ɔpono Foforɔ no mu.<verse eid="JER 36:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 36:11"/>Ɛberɛ a Safan babarima Gemaria babarima Mikaia tee <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsɛm a ɛwɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu no, <verse eid="JER 36:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 36:12"/>ɔkɔɔ ɔtwerɛfoɔ no dan a ɛwɔ ahemfie hɔ no mu, baabi a na ɔtwerɛfoɔ Elisama, Semaia babarima Delaia, Akbor babarima Elnatan, Safan babarima Gemaria, Hanania babarima Sedekia ne adwumayɛfoɔ a wɔaka no nyinaa teteɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 36:13"/>Mikaia kaa nsɛm a Baruk kenkanee firii nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu nyinaa kyerɛɛ wɔn no akyi, <verse eid="JER 36:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 36:14"/>adwumayɛfoɔ no nyinaa somaa Kusi babarima Selemia babarima Netania babarima Yehudi sɛ ɔnkɔka nkyerɛ Baruk sɛ, “Fa nwoma mmobɔeɛ a wokenkane firii mu kyerɛɛ nnipa no bra, na bra.” Enti Neria babarima Baruk kɔɔ wɔn hɔ a nwoma mmobɔeɛ no kura no. <verse eid="JER 36:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 36:15"/>Wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wo tena ase, na kenkan kyerɛ yɛn.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 36:15">Enti Baruk kenkan kyerɛɛ wɔn. <verse eid="JER 36:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 36:16"/>Wɔtee saa nsɛm yi nyinaa no, wɔde ehu hwehwɛɛ wɔn ho wɔn ho anim na wɔka kyerɛɛ Baruk sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ yɛka saa nsɛm yi nyinaa kyerɛ ɔhene.” <verse eid="JER 36:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 36:17"/>Afei, wɔbisaa Baruk sɛ, “Ka kyerɛ yɛn, ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wotwerɛɛ yeinom nyinaa? Yeremia na ɔka ma wotwerɛeɛ anaa?”<verse eid="JER 36:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 36:18"/>Baruk buaa sɛ, “Aane, ɔno na ɔkaa saa nsɛm yi nyinaa ma mede adubiri twerɛ guu nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mu.”<verse eid="JER 36:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 36:19"/>Na adwumayɛfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ Baruk sɛ, “Wo ne Yeremia, monkɔhinta. Monnkyerɛ obiara mo akyiri ɛkwan.”<verse eid="JER 36:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 36:20"/>Wɔde nwoma mmobɔeɛ no kɔsiee ɔtwerɛfoɔ Elisama dan mu akyi no, wɔkɔɔ ɔhene no nkyɛn wɔ nʼabannwa no mu kɔkaa biribiara kyerɛɛ no. <verse eid="JER 36:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 36:21"/>Ɔhene no somaa Yehudi sɛ, ɔnkɔfa nwoma mmobɔeɛ no mmra. Yehudi kɔfa firii ɔtwerɛfoɔ Elisama dan mu, bɛkenkan kyerɛɛ ɔhene ne adwumayɛfoɔ a wɔgyinagyina ne ho no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 36:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 36:22"/>Na ɛyɛ ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nkron a na ɔhene no te awɔberɛ dan mu reto ogya a ɛsi nʼanim. <verse eid="JER 36:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 36:23"/>Ɛberɛ biara a Yehudi bɛkenkan nwoma mmobɔeɛ no afaafa bɛyɛ mmiɛnsa anaa ɛnan no, ɔhene no de ɔtwerɛfoɔ sekan, twitwa de gu ogya no mu, kɔsii sɛ nwoma mmobɔeɛ no nyinaa hyeeɛ. <verse eid="JER 36:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 36:24"/>Ɔhene no ne nʼasomfoɔ a wɔtee saa nsɛm yi nyinaa no ammɔ hu, na wɔansunsuane wɔn ntadeɛ mu nso. <verse eid="JER 36:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 36:25"/>Ɛwom sɛ Elnatan, Delaia ne Gemaria srɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ ɔnnhye nwoma mmobɔeɛ no, nanso wantie wɔn. <verse eid="JER 36:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 36:26"/>Mmom ɔhene no hyɛɛ ne babarima Yerahmeel, Asriel babarima Seraia ne Abdeel babarima Selemia sɛ, wɔnkɔkye ɔtwerɛfoɔ Baruk ne odiyifoɔ Yeremia mmra. Nanso, na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de wɔn asie.<verse eid="JER 36:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 36:27"/>Ɔhene no hyee nwoma mmobɔeɛ a na nsɛm a Baruk twerɛ firii Yeremia anom wɔ mu no akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 36:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 36:28"/>“Fa nwoma mmobɔeɛ foforɔ, na twerɛ nsɛm a ɛwɔ kane mmobɔeɛ a Yudahene Yehoiakim hyeeɛ no gu mu. <verse eid="JER 36:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 36:29"/>Afei, ka kyerɛ Yudahene Yehoiakim sɛ, ‘Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Wohyee nwoma mmobɔeɛ no kaa sɛ: “Adɛn enti na wotwerɛɛ wɔ mu sɛ ɛkwan biara so, Babiloniahene bɛba abɛsɛe asase yi na watɔre ɛso nnipa ne mmoa nyinaa ase?” <verse eid="JER 36:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 36:30"/>Ɛno enti, yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka fa Yudahene Yehoiakim ho: Ɔrennya obi ntena Dawid ahennwa so. Wɔbɛto ne funu atwene a, wɔrensie no, na wada owia hyeɛ ne anadwo awɔ mu. <verse eid="JER 36:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 36:31"/>Mɛtwe ɔno ne ne mma ne nʼasomfoɔ aso wɔ wɔn amumuyɛ nti; mede amanehunu biara a mahyɛ atia wɔn bɛba wɔn ne wɔn a wɔte Yerusalem ne Yudafoɔ so, ɛfiri sɛ wɔnntieɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 36:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 36:32"/>Na Yeremia faa nwoma mmobɔeɛ foforɔ, na ɔka maa ne twerɛfoɔ Baruk twerɛeɛ. Ɔkaa biribiara a na ɛwɔ nwoma mmobɔeɛ no a Yudahene Yehoiakim hyee no no so. Na ɔde nsɛm pii kaa ho.<verse eid="JER 36:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 36"/>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JER 37"/>
  <para style="s1">Yeremia Da Afiase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 37:1"/>Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar de Yosia babarima Sedekia dii Yudahene; ɔsii Yehoiakim babarima Yehoiakin anan mu. <verse eid="JER 37:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 37:2"/>Ɔno, nʼasomfoɔ ne nnipa a wɔwɔ asase no so antie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɔnam odiyifoɔ Yeremia so kaeɛ no.<verse eid="JER 37:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 37:3"/>Ɔhene Sedekia somaa Selemia babarima Yehukal ne Maaseia babarima ɔsɔfoɔ Sefania sɛ, wɔnkɔka nkyerɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wo, bɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ ma yɛn.”<verse eid="JER 37:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 37:4"/>Na Yeremia de ne ho, di nnipa no mu akɔneaba, ɛfiri sɛ na wɔmfaa no ntoo afiase. <verse eid="JER 37:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 37:5"/>Na Farao akodɔm afiri Misraim reba, na Babiloniafoɔ a wɔatua Yerusalem no tee wɔn nka no, wɔfirii Yerusalem.<verse eid="JER 37:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 37:6"/>Ɛna <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa odiyifoɔ Yeremia nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 37:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 37:7"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ: Monka nkyerɛ Yudahene a, ɔsomaa mo sɛ mommɛbisa me hɔ biribi no sɛ, ‘Farao akodɔm a wɔfirii adi sɛ wɔrebɛboa mo no bɛsane akɔ wɔn ankasa asase so, Misraim so. <verse eid="JER 37:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 37:8"/>Na Babiloniafoɔ no bɛsane abɛto ahyɛ saa kuropɔn yi so; wɔbɛgye na wɔahye no dworobɛɛ.’<verse eid="JER 37:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 37:9"/>“Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: Monnnaadaa mo ho nnwene sɛ, ‘Ampa ara Babiloniafoɔ no bɛfiri yɛn so akɔ.’ Wɔrenkɔ! <verse eid="JER 37:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 37:10"/>Sɛ modi Babiloniafoɔ akodɔm a wɔato ahyɛ mo so no so ma ɛka apirafoɔ wɔ wɔn ntomadan mu mpo a, wɔbɛfiri adi abɛhye kuropɔn yi dworobɛɛ.”<verse eid="JER 37:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 37:11"/>Babilonia akodɔm firii Yerusalem, ɛsiane Farao akodɔm no enti akyi no, <verse eid="JER 37:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 37:12"/>Yeremia yɛɛ ahoboa sɛ ɔrefiri kuropɔn no mu, akɔ Benyamin mantam akɔgye nʼagyapadeɛ mu kyɛfa wɔ nkurɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ hɔ no mu. <verse eid="JER 37:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 37:13"/>Nanso, ɔkɔduruu Benyamin Ɛpono ano no, awɛmfoɔ no so panin a wɔfrɛ no Yiria a ɔyɛ Selemia babarima ne Hanania nana kyeree no kaa sɛ, “Woredwane agya yɛn akɔ Babiloniafoɔ afa!”<verse eid="JER 37:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 37:14"/>Yeremia buaa sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ nokorɛ. Merennwane nkɔ Babiloniafoɔ afa.” Nanso, Yiria antie, na mmom ɔkyeree Yeremia de no kɔmaa ne mpanimfoɔ. <verse eid="JER 37:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 37:15"/>Wɔn bo fuu Yeremia, na wɔmaa wɔboroo no de no too afiase wɔ ɔtwerɛfoɔ Yonatan efie a na wɔde ayɛ nneduadan no.<verse eid="JER 37:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 37:16"/>Wɔde Yeremia too asase ase afiase, ma ɔdii nna bebree wɔ hɔ. <verse eid="JER 37:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 37:17"/>Akyire yi, ɔhene Sedekia soma ma wɔkɔfaa no baa ahemfie, ɛhɔ na ɔbisaa no wɔ kɔkoam sɛ, “Woanya asɛm bi afiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn anaa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 37:17">Yeremia buaa sɛ, “Aane, wɔde wo bɛma Babiloniahene.”<verse eid="JER 37:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 37:18"/>Afei, Yeremia bisaa ɔhene no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn bɔne na mayɛ atia wo, anaa wʼadwumayɛfoɔ anaa nnipa yi a enti wɔde me ato afiase yi? <verse eid="JER 37:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 37:19"/>Ɛhe na wʼadiyifoɔ a wɔhyɛɛ nkɔm kyerɛɛ wo sɛ, ‘Babiloniahene rento nhyɛ wo so anaa asase yi so’ no wɔ? <verse eid="JER 37:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 37:20"/>Na afei, ɔdɛɛfoɔ, mesrɛ wo, tie. Ma memfa me nkotosrɛ nto wʼanim: Mfa me nkɔto ɔtwerɛfoɔ Yonatan efie hɔ bio, anyɛ saa a mɛwu wɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 37:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 37:21"/>Ɔhene Sedekia hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa Yeremia nkɔto awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ, na wɔmma no burodo a ɛfiri burodotofoɔ borɔno so da biara nkɔsi sɛ kuropɔn no mu burodo nyinaa bɛsa. Enti Yeremia kaa awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JER 37:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 37"/>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JER 38"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔde Yeremia Hyɛ Abura Mu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 38:1"/>Matan babarima Sefatia, Pashur babarima Gedalia, Selemia babarima Yukal ne Malkia babarima Pashur tee nsɛm a na Yeremia reka kyerɛ nnipa no nyinaa sɛ, <verse eid="JER 38:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 38:2"/>“Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ: Obiara a ɔbɛtena kuropɔn yi mu bɛwu wɔ akofena, ɛkɔm anaa ɔyaredɔm ano, nanso obiara a ɔbɛkɔ Babiloniafoɔ afa no bɛtena nkwa mu. Ɔbɛnya ne tiri adidi mu, ɔbɛtena nkwa mu. <verse eid="JER 38:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 38:3"/>Na yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ, ‘Ampa ara, wɔde saa kuropɔn yi bɛhyɛ Babiloniahene akodɔm nsa, na wɔn na wɔbɛdi so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 38:4"/>Ɛno enti adwumayɛfoɔ no ka kyerɛɛ ɔhene no sɛ, “Ɛsɛ sɛ wɔkum saa ɔbarima yi. Ɔde nsɛm a ɔreka no bu asraafoɔ a wɔaka wɔ kuropɔn yi mu ne nnipa no nyinaa aba mu. Saa ɔbarima yi nhwehwɛ saa nnipa yi yiedie na mmom wɔn sɛeɛ.”<verse eid="JER 38:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 38:5"/>Ɔhene Sedekia buaa sɛ, “Ɔwɔ mo nsam, ɔhene rentumi nyɛ biribiara ntia mo.”<verse eid="JER 38:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 38:6"/>Enti wɔfaa Yeremia de no kɔhyɛɛ ɔhene babarima Malkia abura a ɛwɔ awɛmfoɔ adihɔ no mu. Wɔde ntampehoma gyaagyaa no too abura no mu; na nsuo nni mu, mmom atɛkyɛ na na ɛwom, enti Yeremia kɔhyɛɛ atɛkyɛ no mu.<verse eid="JER 38:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 38:7"/>Na Ebed-Melek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">38.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebed-Melek—Ɛkyerɛ “ahenkwaa”.</char></note> Kusni odwumayɛni a ɔwɔ ahemfie hɔ tee sɛ wɔde Yeremia akɔto abura no mu. Ɛberɛ a ɔhene no te Benyamin Ɛpono hɔ no, <verse eid="JER 38:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 38:8"/>Ebed-Melek firii ahemfie hɔ kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, <verse eid="JER 38:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 38:9"/>“Ɔdɛɛfoɔ, deɛ saa nnipa yi ayɛ nyinaa yɛ amumuyɛsɛm a ɛtia odiyifoɔ Yeremia. Wɔato no atwene abura mu, baabi a ɛkɔm bɛkum no wɔ ɛberɛ a burodo asa wɔ kuropɔn yi mu.”<verse eid="JER 38:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 38:10"/>Ɛna ɔhene hyɛɛ Kusni, Ebed-Melek sɛ, “Fa mmarima aduasa firi ha ka wo ho, na monkɔyi odiyifoɔ Yeremia mfiri abura no mu, ansa na wawu.”<verse eid="JER 38:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 38:11"/>Ɛno enti, Ebed-Melek faa mmarima no kaa ne ho, na wɔkɔɔ ɛdan bi a ɛwɔ adekorabea ase, wɔ ahemfie hɔ. Ɔkɔsesaa ntomago ne ntadeɛ dada de kyekyeree ntampehoma ho, gyaa mu maa Yeremia wɔ abura no mu. <verse eid="JER 38:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 38:12"/>Na Kusni, Ebed-Melek ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Fa ntomago ne ntadeɛ dada no hyehyɛ wo mmɔtoam, na ntampehoma no ammia wo.” Na Yeremia yɛɛ saa, <verse eid="JER 38:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 38:13"/>Wɔde ntampehoma no twetwee no de yii no firii abura no mu. Na Yeremia tenaa awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ.<verse eid="JER 38:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Sedekia Bisa Yeremia Nsɛm Bio</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 38:14"/>Na Ɔhene Sedekia soma ma wɔkɔfaa odiyifoɔ Yeremia baa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan ano ɛkwan a ɛtɔ so mmiɛnsa hɔ. Ɔhene ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Merebɛbisa wo asɛm bi, mfa biribiara nsie me.”<verse eid="JER 38:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 38:15"/>Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Sedekia sɛ, “Sɛ mema wo mmuaeɛ a, worenkum me anaa? Mpo sɛ metu wo fo a, worentie me.”<verse eid="JER 38:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 38:16"/>Nanso ɔhene Sedekia kaa saa ntam yi kɔkoam kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> a ɔma yɛn nkwa no te ase yi, merenkum wo, na meremfa wonhyɛ wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkum wo no nsa.”<verse eid="JER 38:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 38:17"/>Afei Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Sedekia sɛ, “Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn, Israel Onyankopɔn, no seɛ: ‘Sɛ wode wo ho ma Babiloniahene adwumayɛfoɔ a, wɔrenkum wo na wɔrenhye kuropɔn yi, wo ne wʼabusuafoɔ bɛtena nkwa mu. <verse eid="JER 38:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 38:18"/>Na sɛ woremfa wo ho mma Babiloniahene adwumayɛfoɔ a, wɔde saa kuropɔn yi bɛma Babiloniafoɔ, na wɔbɛhye no dwerɛbee; na wʼankasa rentumi nnwane mfiri wɔn nsam.’ ”<verse eid="JER 38:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 38:19"/>Ɔhene Sedekia ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Mesuro Yudafoɔ a wɔkɔ Babiloniafoɔ afa no, ɛfiri sɛ, ebia Babiloniafoɔ no de me bɛma wɔn na wɔayɛ me ayakayakadeɛ.”<verse eid="JER 38:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 38:20"/>Yeremia buaa sɛ, “Wɔremfa wo mma wɔn. Tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm na yɛ deɛ meka kyerɛ woɔ. Ɛno na ɛbɛma asi wo yie na woanya nkwa. <verse eid="JER 38:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 38:21"/>Nanso sɛ woamfa wo ho amma Babiloniafoɔ no de a, deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ayi akyerɛ me nie: <verse eid="JER 38:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 38:22"/>Mmaa a wɔaka wɔ Yudahene ahemfie hɔ nyinaa no, wɔde wɔn bɛfiri adi abrɛ Babiloniahene adwumayɛfoɔ no. Saa mmaa no bɛka akyerɛ wo sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">“ ‘Wɔdaadaa wo na wɔdii wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">wo nnamfonom a wogye wɔn die no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 38:22">Wo nan amem wɔ atɛkyɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 38:22">wo nnamfonom agya wo hɔ kɔ.’<verse eid="JER 38:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 38:23"/>“Wɔde wo yerenom nyinaa ne wo mma bɛbrɛ Babiloniafoɔ no. Wo deɛ worentumi nnwane mfiri wɔn nsam, na mmom Babiloniahene bɛkye wo, na wɔbɛhye saa kuropɔn yi.”<verse eid="JER 38:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 38:24"/>Na Sedekia ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Mma obiara nte saa nkɔmmɔdie yi, anyɛ saa a, wobɛwu. <verse eid="JER 38:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 38:25"/>Sɛ adwumayɛfoɔ no te sɛ me ne wo kasaeɛ, na wɔbɛbisa wo sɛ, ‘Ma yɛnte deɛ woka kyerɛɛ ɔhene ne deɛ ɔhene nso ka kyerɛɛ woɔ; mfa nsie yɛn anyɛ saa a yɛbɛkum wo a,’ <verse eid="JER 38:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 38:26"/>ɛnneɛ ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Na meresrɛ ɔhene sɛ ɔmmfa me nsane nkɔ Yonatan efie mma me nkɔwu wɔ hɔ.’ ” <verse eid="JER 38:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 38:27"/>Adwumayɛfoɔ no nyinaa baa Yeremia hɔ bɛbisaa no, na ɔkaa deɛ ɔhene hyɛɛ no sɛ ɔnka no nyinaa. Enti, wɔanka hwee ankyɛre no bio, ɛfiri sɛ obiara ante ɔne ɔhene nkɔmmɔdie no.<verse eid="JER 38:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 38:28"/>Na Yeremia tenaa ɔwɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ kɔsii da a wɔfaa Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="JER 38:28">Wɔfa Yerusalem</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 38:28">Sɛdeɛ wɔfaa Yerusalem nie:<verse eid="JER 38:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 38"/>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JER 39"/>
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 39:1"/>Yudahene Sedekia dii adeɛ no, ne mfeɛ nkron mu bosome edu so no, Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼakodɔm nyinaa tuu Yerusalem so sa, wɔtua kuropɔn no na wɔyɛɛ mpie twaa ho hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="JER 39:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 39:2"/>Sedekia adedie afe a ɛtɔ so dubaako, bosome a ɛtɔ so ɛnan no da a ɛtɔ so nkron no, wɔbubuu kuropɔn no afasuo. <verse eid="JER 39:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 39:3"/>Na Babiloniahene adwumayɛfoɔ no nyinaa bɛtenaa Mfimfini Ɛpono hɔ: Nergal-Sareser a ɔfiri Samgar ne Nebo-Sarsekim a ɔyɛ ɔsraani panin ne Nergal-Sareser a ɔyɛ otitire, ne Babiloniahene adwumayɛfoɔ a aka no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 39:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 39:4"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudahene Sedekia ne nʼasraafoɔ nyinaa hunuu wɔn no, wɔdwaneeɛ, wɔfaa ɔhene turo mu firii kuropɔn no mu anadwo, kɔfaa ɛpono a ɛwɔ afasuo mmienu no ntam, de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ Araba.<verse eid="JER 39:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 39:5"/>Nanso, Babilonia akodɔm no taa wɔn kɔtoo Sedekia wɔ Yeriko tata so. Wɔfaa no dommum de no kɔmaa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar wɔ Ribla a ɛwɔ Hamat asase so, na ɛhɔ na ɔbuu no atɛn. <verse eid="JER 39:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 39:6"/>Ribla hɔ na Babiloniahene kunkumm Sedekia mmammarima wɔ nʼanim na ɔkumm Yudafoɔ mmapɔmma nyinaa nso. <verse eid="JER 39:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 39:7"/>Afei ɔtutuu Sedekia ani, de kɔbere mfrafraeɛ mpokyerɛ guu no sɛ ɔde no rekɔ Babilonia.<verse eid="JER 39:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 39:8"/>Babiloniafoɔ no de ogya too ahemfie no ne nnipa no afie mu, na wɔdwirii Yerusalem afasuo no. <verse eid="JER 39:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 39:9"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua ɔhene awɛmfoɔ ano no de kuropɔn no mu nkaeɛfoɔ, wɔn a wɔde wɔn ho kɔmaa no ne nnipa a aka no kɔɔ nkoasom mu wɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 39:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 39:10"/>Nanso, ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua awɛmfoɔ no ano no gyaa ahiafoɔ wɔnni hwee no mu bi wɔ Yuda asase so, na saa ɛberɛ no ɔmaa wɔn bobe nturo ne nsase.<verse eid="JER 39:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 39:11"/>Na Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar afa ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua ɔhene awɛmfoɔ ano no so ama saa ɔhyɛ nsɛm yi a ɛfa Yeremia ho sɛ, <verse eid="JER 39:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 39:12"/>“Fa no na hwɛ ne so; nha no na deɛ ɔbisa biara no, yɛ ma no.” <verse eid="JER 39:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 39:13"/>Enti, ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua awɛmfoɔ no ano, Nebusaradan, adwumayɛfoɔ panin, Nergal-Sareser a ɔyɛ otitire ne Babiloniahene adwumayɛfoɔ a wɔaka no nyinaa <verse eid="JER 39:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 39:14"/>soma ma wɔkɔfaa Yeremia firi awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ baeɛ. Wɔde no hyɛɛ Safan babarima Gedalia babarima Ahikam nsa sɛ ɔmfa no nkɔ ne efie. Enti, Yeremia tenaa nʼankasa nkurɔfoɔ mu.<verse eid="JER 39:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 39:15"/>Ɛberɛ a Yeremia da so da afiase wɔ awɛmfoɔ adihɔ hɔ no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa ne nkyɛn sɛ, <verse eid="JER 39:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 39:16"/>“Kɔka kyerɛ Kusni Ebed-Melek sɛ, ‘Sɛdeɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ nie: Me nsɛm a ɛtia kuropɔn yi no mede refa amanehunu so na ɛnyɛ yiedie so ama aba mu. Saa ɛberɛ no ɛbɛba mu wɔ wʼanim. <verse eid="JER 39:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 39:17"/>Nanso mɛgye wo saa ɛda no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ; wɔremfa wo nhyɛ wɔn a wosuro wɔn no nsa. <verse eid="JER 39:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 39:18"/>Mɛgye wo nkwa, na worentɔ wɔ akofena ano na mmom wobɛnya wo tiri adidi mu, ɛfiri sɛ wogye me di, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na ɔseɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 39:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 39"/>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JER 40"/>
  <para style="s1">Wɔgyaee Yeremia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 40:1"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua ɔhene awɛmfoɔ ano no gyaee Yeremia wɔ Rama akyi no, asɛm no firi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa Yeremia hɔ. Ɔhunuu sɛ, wɔagu Yeremia nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn wɔ nnommumfoɔ a wɔfiri Yerusalem ne Yuda a na wɔde wɔn rekɔ Babilonia no mu. <verse eid="JER 40:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 40:2"/>Brɛ a ɔsahene a ɔtua awɛmfoɔ no ano no hunuu Yeremia no, ɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “<char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wo Onyankopɔn, na ɔhyɛɛ saa amanehunu yi maa beaeɛ yi. <verse eid="JER 40:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 40:3"/>Na afei, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ama aba mu. Wayɛ sɛdeɛ ɔkaa sɛ ɔbɛyɛ no. Yeinom nyinaa baa mu, ɛfiri sɛ, mo saa nnipa yi yɛɛ bɔne tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na moanyɛ ɔsetie amma no. <verse eid="JER 40:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 40:4"/>Nanso, ɛnnɛ mereyi wo afiri nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn a ɛgu wo nsa no mu. Sɛ wopɛ a, ma yɛnkɔ Babilonia na mɛhwɛ wo so, nanso sɛ wompɛ deɛ a ɛmma. Hwɛ ɔman no nyinaa na ɛda wʼanim no, kɔ baabiara a wopɛ.” <verse eid="JER 40:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 40:5"/>Na ansa na Yeremia bɛdane ne ho akɔ no, Nebusaradan ka kaa ho sɛ, “Sane kɔ Ahikam babarima Gedalia a, ɔyɛ Safan nana, a Babiloniahene apa no sɛ ɔnhwɛ Yuda nkuro so no nkyɛn na wo ne no nkɔtena wɔ nnipa no mu, anaasɛ kɔ baabi foforɔ biara a wopɛ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 40:5">Na ɔsahene no maa Yeremia aduane ne akyɛdeɛ, na ɔmaa no kɔeɛ. <verse eid="JER 40:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 40:6"/>Enti, Yeremia kɔɔ Ahikam babarima Gedalia nkyɛn wɔ Mispa, na ɔne no tenaa nnipa a wɔkaa wɔ asase no so no mu.<verse eid="JER 40:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔkum Gedalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 40:7"/>Ɛberɛ a asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no nyinaa ne wɔn mmarima a wɔda so wɔ wiram no tee sɛ, Babiloniahene ayɛ Ahikam babarima Gedalia amrado wɔ asase no so, na ɔde mmarima, mmaa ne mmɔfra a wɔyɛ ahiafoɔ wɔ asase no so, na wɔamfa wɔn ankɔ nnommumfa mu wɔ Babilonia ahyɛ ne nsa no, <verse eid="JER 40:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 40:8"/>wɔbaa Gedalia hɔ wɔ Mispa: Netania babarima Ismael, Karea mmammarima Yohanan ne Yonatan, Tanhumet babarima Seraia, Efai a ɔfiri Netofa mmammarima, Yesania a, ɔyɛ Maakani babarima ne wɔn mmarima. <verse eid="JER 40:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 40:9"/>Na Ahikam babarima Gedalia a ɔyɛ Safan nana no kaa ntam de hyɛɛ wɔn ne wɔn mmarima den sɛ, “Monnsuro sɛ mobɛsom Babiloniafoɔ. Montena asase no so na monsom Babiloniahene, na ɛbɛsi mo yie. <verse eid="JER 40:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 40:10"/>Me deɛ, mɛtena Mispa, na masi mo anan mu wɔ Babiloniafoɔ a wɔbɛba abɛhyia yɛn no mu, na mo deɛ, monkɔ boaboa nsã, ahuhuro berɛ mu nnuaba ne ngo ano ngu adekora nkuruwa mu wɔ twaberɛ mu, na montenatena nkuro a moafa no so.” <verse eid="JER 40:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 40:11"/>Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ Moab, Amon, Edom ne aman ahodoɔ a aka no, tee sɛ Babiloniahene agya nkaeɛfoɔ bi wɔ Yuda na wayi Ahikam babarima Gedalia a ɔyɛ Safan nana sɛ amrado wɔ wɔn so no, <verse eid="JER 40:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 40:12"/>wɔn nyinaa sane baa Yuda asase so firi aman a wɔbɔɔ wɔn peteeɛ no so, kɔɔ Gedalia hɔ wɔ Mispa. Na wɔboaboaa nsã ne ahuhuro nnuaba bebree ano wɔ twaberɛ mu.<verse eid="JER 40:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 40:13"/>Na Karea babarima Yohanan ne akodɔm ntuanofoɔ a wɔda so wɔ wiram no baa Gedalia nkyɛn wɔ Mispa <verse eid="JER 40:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 40:14"/>na wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wonnim sɛ, Amonhene Baalis asoma Netania babarima Ismael sɛ, ɔmmɛkum wo anaa?” Nanso, Ahikam babarima Gedalia annye wɔn anni.<verse eid="JER 40:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 40:15"/>Na Karea babarima Yohanan ka kyerɛɛ Gedalia wɔ kɔkoam wɔ Mispa sɛ, “Ma menkɔkum Netania babarima Ismael, na obiara rente. Adɛn enti na ɛsɛ sɛ ɔkum wo na ɔma Yudafoɔ a wɔatwa wo ho ahyia no bɔ hwete, na Yudafoɔ nkaeɛfoɔ no yera?”<verse eid="JER 40:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 40:16"/>Nanso, Ahikam babarima Gedalia ka kyerɛɛ Karea babarima Yohanan sɛ, “Ɛnyɛ saa adeɛ yi! Deɛ woka fa Ismael ho no nyɛ nokorɛ.”<verse eid="JER 40:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 40"/>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JER 41"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 41:1"/>Ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nson mu no, Elisama babarima Netania babarima Ismael a ɔyɛ ɔdehyeɛ a na anka ɔyɛ ɔhene adwumayɛfoɔ no mu baako no ne mmarima edu baa Ahikam babarima Gedalia nkyɛn wɔ Mispa. Ɛberɛ a wɔn nyinaa gu so redidi no, <verse eid="JER 41:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 41:2"/>Netania babarima Ismael ne ne mmarima edu no a wɔka ne ho no sɔreeɛ na wɔde akofena wɔɔ Ahikam babarima Gedalia, a ɔyɛ Safan nana nso no kumm no. Na ɔyɛ obi a Babiloniahene ayi no sɛ amrado wɔ asase no so. <verse eid="JER 41:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 41:3"/>Ismael kumm Yudafoɔ a na wɔka Gedalia ho wɔ Mispa ne Babilonia asraafoɔ a na wɔwɔ hɔ no nso.<verse eid="JER 41:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 41:4"/>Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ansa na obiara bɛte Gedalia wuo no, <verse eid="JER 41:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 41:5"/>mmarima aduɔwɔtwe a wɔawerɛ wɔn bɔgyesɛ, asunsuane wɔn ntadeɛ mu na wɔasesa wɔn honam ani firi Sekem, Silo ne Samaria baeɛ a wɔde aduane afɔrebɔdeɛ ne nnuhwam reba <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie. <verse eid="JER 41:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 41:6"/>Netania babarima Ismael de agyaadwoɔ firii Mispa kɔhyiaa wɔn. Ɛberɛ a ɔhyiaa wɔn no ɔkaa sɛ, “Mommra Ahikam babarima Gedalia nkyɛn.” <verse eid="JER 41:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 41:7"/>Wɔduruu kuropɔn no mu no, Netania babarima Ismael ne mmarima a wɔka ne ho no kumm wɔn na wɔtoo wɔn afunu guu abura bi mu. <verse eid="JER 41:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 41:8"/>Nanso nnipa no mu edu ka kyerɛɛ Ismael sɛ, “Nkum yɛn! Yɛwɔ ayuo ne atokoɔ, ngo ne ɛwoɔ a yɛde asie wɔ afuo bi mu.” Enti ɔgyaa wɔn na wankum wɔn nso. <verse eid="JER 41:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 41:9"/>Abura a Ismael too nnipa a ɔkunkumm wɔn no afunu ne Gedalia guu mu no, na ɛyɛ deɛ ɔhene Asa atu sɛ ɔde bɛbɔ ne ho ban atia Israelhene Baasa. Netania babarima Ismael de afunu hyɛɛ no ma.<verse eid="JER 41:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 41:10"/>Ismael faa nnipa a na wɔaka wɔ Mispa no nyinaa nnommum; ɔhene mmammaa ne wɔn a wɔkaa hɔ no nyinaa a Nebusaradan a ɔtua ɔhene awɛmfoɔ ano no ayi Ahikam babarima Gedalia sɛ ɔnhwɛ wɔn so no. Netania babarima Ismael faa wɔn nnommum na ɔsii mu kɔɔ Amonfoɔ nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 41:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 41:11"/>Ɛberɛ a Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ a wɔka ne ho no nyinaa tee awudisɛm a Netania babarima Ismael adie no, <verse eid="JER 41:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 41:12"/>wɔfaa wɔn asraafoɔ nyinaa sɛ wɔ ne Netania babarima Ismael rekɔko. Wɔkɔtoo no wɔ ɔtadeɛ kɛseɛ bi a ɛwɔ Gibeon no ho. <verse eid="JER 41:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 41:13"/>Ɛberɛ a nnipa a wɔka Ismael ho no nyinaa hunuu Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ a wɔka ne ho no, wɔn ani gyeeɛ. <verse eid="JER 41:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 41:14"/>Nnipa a na Ismael afa wɔn nnommum wɔ Mispa no nyinaa dane kɔɔ Karea babarima Yohanan afa. <verse eid="JER 41:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 41:15"/>Nanso Netania babarima Ismael ne ne mmarima baawɔtwe dwane firii Yohanan anim kɔɔ Amonfoɔ nkyɛn.<verse eid="JER 41:15"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔdwane Kɔ Misraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 41:16"/>Afei, Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ a wɔka ne ho no dii Mispa nkaeɛfoɔ a ɔgyee wɔn firii Netania babarima Ismael nsam ɛberɛ a ɔkumm Ahikam babarima Gedalia no akyi no anim: Ɔde asraafoɔ, mmaa, mmɔfra ne asɛnniiɛ adwumayɛfoɔ firi Gibeon baeɛ. <verse eid="JER 41:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 41:17"/>Wɔsii mu sɛ wɔrekɔ Misraim no, wɔsoɛe wɔ Gerut Kimham a ɛbɛn Betlehem. <verse eid="JER 41:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 41:18"/>Na wɔredwane Babiloniafoɔ no. Na wɔsuro Babiloniafoɔ no ɛfiri sɛ na Netania babarima Ismael akum Ahikam babarima Gedalia a Babiloniahene yii no sɛ amrado a ɔhwɛ asase no so no.<verse eid="JER 41:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 41"/>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JER 42"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 42:1"/>Afei, asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no nyinaa a Karea babarima Yohanan ne Hosaia babarima Yesania ka ho ne nnipa no nyinaa, ɛfiri akumaa so kɔsi ɔkɛseɛ so kɔɔ <verse eid="JER 42:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 42:2"/>odiyifoɔ Yeremia nkyɛn kɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Yɛsrɛ wo, tie yɛn adesrɛ yi na bɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ ma saa nkaeɛfoɔ yi nyinaa. Sɛdeɛ wohunu no, kane no na yɛdɔɔso nanso afei yɛaka kakraa bi. <verse eid="JER 42:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 42:3"/>Bɔ mpaeɛ sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn bɛkyerɛ yɛn baabi a ɛsɛ sɛ yɛkɔ ne deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ yɛyɛ.”<verse eid="JER 42:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 42:4"/>Yeremia buaa wɔn sɛ, “Mate mo asɛm no, na ɛkwan biara so mɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ sɛdeɛ mo asrɛ no; mɛka deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛka biara akyerɛ mo na meremfa hwee nsie mo.”<verse eid="JER 42:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 42:5"/>Na afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Sɛ yɛanyɛ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wo Onyankopɔn soma wo sɛ ka kyerɛ yɛn no a, ma ɔnyɛ ɔdanseni nokwafoɔ ntia yɛn. <verse eid="JER 42:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 42:6"/>Sɛ yɛpɛ o, sɛ yɛmpɛ o, yɛbɛyɛ ɔsetie ama <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn a yɛresoma wo wɔ ne nkyɛn no, sɛdeɛ ɛbɛsi yɛn yie, na yɛbɛdi <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn asɛm so.”<verse eid="JER 42:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 42:7"/>Dadu akyi no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia hɔ. <verse eid="JER 42:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 42:8"/>Enti, ɔfrɛɛ Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ a wɔka ne ho ne nnipa no nyinaa; ɛfiri akumaa so kɔsi ɔkɛseɛ so. <verse eid="JER 42:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 42:9"/>Na ɔka kyerɛɛ wɔn sɛ, “Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn a mosomaa me sɛ memfa mo adesrɛ nkɔto nʼanim no seɛ: <verse eid="JER 42:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 42:10"/>‘Sɛ motena asase yi so a, mɛsiesie mo na merensɛe mo, mɛdua mo na merentu mo ase, ɛfiri sɛ me werɛ aho wɔ amanehunu a mama aba mo so no ho. <verse eid="JER 42:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 42:11"/>Monnsuro Babiloniahene a seesei mosuro noɔ no. Monnsuro no, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, me ne mo wɔ hɔ, mɛgye mo, na mayi mo afiri ne tumi ase. <verse eid="JER 42:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 42:12"/>Mɛhu mo mmɔbɔ na ɔno nso ahu mo mmɔbɔ na ɔde mo asane aba mo asase so.’<verse eid="JER 42:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 42:13"/>“Nanso sɛ moka sɛ, ‘Yɛrentena saa asase yi so,’ na ne saa enti moanyɛ ɔsetie amma <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn, <verse eid="JER 42:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 42:14"/>na moka sɛ, ‘Dabi, yɛbɛkɔ akɔtena Misraim, baabi a yɛrenhunu ɔko, na yɛrente totorobɛnto nnyegyeeɛ na aduanekɔm nne yɛn a,’ <verse eid="JER 42:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 42:15"/>ɛnneɛ tie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, Ao Yuda nkaeɛfoɔ. Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ, ‘Sɛ moayɛ mo adwene sɛ mobɛkɔ akɔtena Misraim, na sɛ monya kɔtena hɔ a, <verse eid="JER 42:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 42:16"/>ɛnneɛ akofena a mosuro no bɛto mo wɔ hɔ na ɛkɔm a mo akoma tu wɔ ho no bɛdi mo akyi akɔ Misraim, na ɛhɔ na mobɛwuwu. <verse eid="JER 42:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 42:17"/>Nokorɛm, wɔn a wɔasi wɔn adwene pi sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Misraim akɔtena hɔ no bɛwuwu wɔ akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm ano, na wɔn mu baako mpo renka anaa ɔrennwane mfiri amanehunu a mede bɛba wɔn so no mu.’ <verse eid="JER 42:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 42:18"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ, ‘Sɛdeɛ mʼabufuo ne mʼabufuhyeɛ hwie guu nnipa a wɔwɔ Yerusalem soɔ no, saa ara na sɛ mokɔ Misraim a, mʼabufuhyeɛ bɛhwie agu mo so. Mobɛyɛ nnomedeɛ, ahodwiredeɛ, afɔbuo ne ahohora; morenhunu saa beaeɛ yi bio.’<verse eid="JER 42:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 42:19"/>“Ao Yuda nkaeɛfoɔ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka akyerɛ mo sɛ, ‘Monnkɔ Misraim.’ Mommma mo werɛ mfiri. Ɛnnɛ merebɔ mo kɔkɔ <verse eid="JER 42:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 42:20"/>sɛ moyɛɛ mfomsoɔ a ɛyɛ hu yie ɛberɛ a mosomaa me kɔɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn hɔ, na mokaa sɛ, ‘Bɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn mpaeɛ ma yɛn, na ka deɛ ɔka biara kyerɛ yɛn, na yɛbɛyɛ,’ no. <verse eid="JER 42:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 42:21"/>Ɛnnɛ, maka akyerɛ mo, nanso monyɛɛ ɔsetie mmaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> mo Onyankopɔn ara wɔ biribiara a ɔhyɛɛ me sɛ menka nkyerɛ mo no ho. <verse eid="JER 42:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 42:22"/>Enti, afei mommma mo werɛ mfiri sɛ mobɛwuwu wɔ akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm ano wɔ baabi a mopɛ sɛ mokɔtena hɔ no.”<verse eid="JER 42:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 42"/>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="JER 43"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 43:1"/>Ɛberɛ a Yeremia wiee nsɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn Onyankopɔn nkyɛn no ka no, <verse eid="JER 43:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 43:2"/>Hosaia babarima Asaria, Karea babarima Yohanan ne mmarima ahomasofoɔ no nyinaa ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, “Woredi atorɔ! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn nsomaa wo sɛ bɛka sɛ, ‘Ɛnsɛ sɛ mokɔ Misraim kɔtena hɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 43:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 43:3"/>Na mmom Neria babarima Baruk na ɔregyegye wo so tia yɛn ama wɔde yɛn ahyɛ Babiloniafoɔ nsa, sɛdeɛ wɔbɛkum yɛn anaa wɔbɛsoa yɛn de yɛn akɔ nkoasom mu wɔ Babilonia.”<verse eid="JER 43:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 43:4"/>Enti, Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ no nyinaa ne nnipa no anni <char style="nd">Awurade</char> hyɛ a ɔhyɛɛ wɔn sɛ wɔntena Yuda asase so no so. <verse eid="JER 43:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 43:5"/>Mmom Karea babarima Yohanan ne asraafoɔ mpanimfoɔ nyinaa de Yuda nkaeɛfoɔ a wɔfifirii amanaman a wɔbɔɔ wɔn pete kɔɔ so no so na wɔaba sɛ wɔrebɛtena Yuda asase so no nyinaa kɔɔeɛ. <verse eid="JER 43:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 43:6"/>Wɔde mmarima, mmaa, mmɔfra ne ɔhene mmammaa a ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔyɛ ɔhene awɛmfoɔ panin no de wɔn gyaa Ahikam babarima Gedalia a ɔyɛ Safan nana kɔɔeɛ. Na odiyifoɔ Yeremia ne Neria babarima Baruk nso ka ho bi. <verse eid="JER 43:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 43:7"/>Enti wɔhyɛnee Misraim a wɔanni <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm so, na wɔkɔduruu Tapanhes.<verse eid="JER 43:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 43:8"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm baa Yeremia nkyɛn wɔ Tapanhes sɛ, <verse eid="JER 43:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 43:9"/>“Ɛberɛ a Yudafoɔ no rehwɛ no, fa aboɔ akɛseɛ, afei tutu fam wɔ birikisi nsɛweeɛ a ɛwɔ Farao ahemfie a ɛwɔ Tapanhes aboboano hɔ, na fa gu mu kata so. <verse eid="JER 43:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 43:10"/>Afei ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ, ‘Sei na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: Mɛsoma me ɔsomfoɔ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar, na mede nʼahennwa bɛsi saa aboɔ a masie wɔ ha no so; na ɔbɛtrɛ nʼadehye kyiniiɛ mu wɔ so. <verse eid="JER 43:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 43:11"/>Ɔbɛba abɛto ahyɛ Misraim so, na ɔbɛkum wɔn a wɔahyɛ sɛ wɔnkum wɔn no, na wɔafa wɔn a wɔahyɛ sɛ wɔnkɔ nnommumfa mu nnommum. Na wɔn a wɔahyɛ sɛ wɔmfa wɔn mma akofena no nso, wɔde wɔn bɛma akofena. <verse eid="JER 43:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 43:12"/>Ɔbɛto Misraim anyame asɔredan mu ogya ahye na wɔafa wɔn anyame no nnommum. Sɛdeɛ odwanhwɛfoɔ de nʼatadeɛ kyekyere ne ho no, saa ara na ɔde Misraim bɛkyekyere ne ho na wafiri hɔ akɔ a ne ho baabiara renti. <verse eid="JER 43:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 43:13"/>Owia asɔredan a ɛwɔ Misraim no, ɔbɛbubu nʼafadum kronkron no, na wahye Misraim anyame asɔredan no dworobɛɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 43:13"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 43"/>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="JER 44"/>
  <para style="s1">Abosomsom Mu Amanehunu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 44:1"/>Saa asɛm yi baa Yeremia nkyɛn. Ɛfa Yudafoɔ a wɔtete Misraim anafoɔ fam wɔ Migdol, Tapanhes, Memfis ne Misraim atifi fam ho. <verse eid="JER 44:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 44:2"/>“Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: Mohunuu amanehunu kɛseɛ a mede baa Yerusalem ne Yuda nkuro nyinaa so. Ɛnnɛ wɔayeyɛ amanfo na wɔasɛe <verse eid="JER 44:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 44:3"/>ɛsiane bɔne a wɔayɛ no enti. Wɔhyee nnuhwam, somm anyame foforɔ a wɔn anaa mo anaa mo agyanom nnim wɔn de hyɛɛ me abufuo. <verse eid="JER 44:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 44:4"/>Mpɛn bebree mesomaa mʼasomfoɔ adiyifoɔ a wɔkaa sɛ, ‘Monnyɛ saa atantanneɛ a mekyiri no!’ <verse eid="JER 44:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 44:5"/>Nanso wɔantie. Wɔamfa anyɛ asɛm, na wɔannane amfiri wɔn amumuyɛsɛm ho na wɔannyae hye a wɔhye nnuhwam ma anyame foforɔ no. <verse eid="JER 44:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 44:6"/>Enti, mehwiee mʼabufuo guiɛ na ɛdɛre kɔɔ Yuda nkuro ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so, ma ɛsɛɛsɛeɛ na ɛdedaa mpan sɛdeɛ ɛteɛ ɛnnɛ yi.<verse eid="JER 44:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 44:7"/>“Na seesei, deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> Onyankopɔn, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ nie: Adɛn enti na mode amanehunu kɛseɛ aba mo ho so, sɛ moyii mmarima ne mmaa, mmɔfra ne mmotafowa firii Yuda a moangya nkaeɛfoɔ biara amma mo ho. <verse eid="JER 44:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 44:8"/>Adɛn enti na mode deɛ mo nsa ayɛ hyɛ me abufuo, na mohye nnuhwam ma anyame foforɔ wɔ Misraim, baabi a moabɛtena hɔ? Mobɛsɛe mo ho, na moayɛ nnomedeɛ ne nsopa wɔ asase so amanaman nyinaa mu. <verse eid="JER 44:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 44:9"/>Mo werɛ afiri amumuyɛsɛm a mo agyanom, Yuda ahemfo ne ahemaa yɛeɛ, na mo ne mo yerenom nso yɛɛ wɔ Yuda asase ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so no anaa? <verse eid="JER 44:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 44:10"/>Ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ yi, wɔmmrɛɛ wɔn ho ase, wɔnnaa anidie adi na wɔnnii me mmara ne ahyɛdeɛ a mede maa mo ne mo agyanom no so.<verse eid="JER 44:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 44:11"/>“Enti, deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ nie: Masi mʼadwene pi sɛ mede amanehunu bɛba mo so na masɛe Yuda nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 44:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 44:12"/>Mɛfa Yuda nkaeɛfoɔ a wɔsii wɔn adwene pi sɛ wɔbɛkɔ Misraim akɔtena hɔ no. Wɔn nyinaa bɛwuwu wɔ Misraim; wɔbɛtotɔ akofena ano anaa ɛkɔm bɛkum wɔn. Ɛfiri akumaa so kɔsi ɔkɛseɛ so, akofena ne ɛkɔm bɛkunkum wɔn. Wɔbɛyɛ nnomedeɛ, ahodwiredeɛ, afɔbudeɛ ne ahohora. <verse eid="JER 44:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 44:13"/>Mede akofena, ɛkɔm ne ɔyaredɔm bɛtwe wɔn a wɔtete Misraim aso, sɛdeɛ metwee Yerusalem aso no. <verse eid="JER 44:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 44:14"/>Yuda nkaeɛfoɔ a wɔakɔtena Misraim no mu biara rennwane, na wɔremfa wɔn ho nni na wɔasane aba Yuda, asase a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔsane bɛtena so no; wɔn mu biara remma bio, gye sɛ adwanefoɔ kakraa bi.”<verse eid="JER 44:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 44:15"/>Afei, mmarima a na wɔnim sɛ wɔn yerenom hye nnuhwam ma anyame foforɔ, wɔne mmaa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Misraim Atifi fam ne Anafoɔ fam ka kyerɛɛ Yeremia sɛ, <verse eid="JER 44:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 44:16"/>“Yɛrentie asɛm a waka akyerɛ yɛn wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> din mu no! <verse eid="JER 44:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 44:17"/>Ampa ara yɛbɛyɛ biribiara a yɛkaa sɛ yɛbɛyɛ: Yɛbɛhye nnuhwam ama Ɔsoro Hemmaa na yɛahwie ahwiesa ama no, sɛdeɛ yɛ ne yɛn agyanom, ahemfo ne adwumayɛfoɔ yɛɛ wɔ Yuda nkuro ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Saa ɛberɛ no na yɛwɔ aduane, na yɛdi yie a yɛnni ɔhaw biara nso. <verse eid="JER 44:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 44:18"/>Nanso ɛfiri ɛberɛ a yɛgyaee nnuhwam a yɛhye ma Ɔsoro Hemmaa, na yɛgyaee ahwiesa a yɛde ma no no, biribiara abɔ yɛn na yɛrewuwu wɔ akofena ne ɛkɔm ano.”<verse eid="JER 44:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 44:19"/>Na mmaa no nso ka kaa ho sɛ, “Ɛberɛ a yɛhyee nnuhwam maa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">44.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mmaa—Ɛsiane sɛ na Ɔsoro Hemmaa no yɛ Babilonia bosom a ɔma awoɔ no enti, na mmaa di ne som no mu akotene.</char></note> Ɔsoro Hemmaa na yɛhwiee ahwiesa maa no no, na yɛn kununom nnim sɛ yɛto ɔfam a ɛyɛ ne sɛso, hwie ahwiesa ma no anaa?”<verse eid="JER 44:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 44:20"/>Na Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa, mmarima ne mmaa a wɔrebua noɔ no sɛ, <verse eid="JER 44:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 44:21"/>“Mosusu sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nnim sɛ na mo ne mo agyanom, mo ahemfo, adwumayɛfoɔ ne ɔmanfoɔ no hye nnuhwam ma ahoni wɔ Yuda nkuro so ne Yerusalem mmɔntene so anaa? <verse eid="JER 44:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 44:22"/>Ɛberɛ a mo amumuyɛ ne akyiwadeɛ a moyɛeɛ no fonoo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no, mo asase danee nnomedeɛ ne amanfo a obiara nte so, sɛdeɛ ɛte ɛnnɛ yi. <verse eid="JER 44:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 44:23"/>Esiane sɛ moahye nnuhwam, ayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, na moannyɛ ɔsetie amma no, na moanni ne mmara, nʼahyɛdeɛ ne nʼadansesɛm soɔ enti, amanehunu aba mo so sɛdeɛ mohunu yi.”<verse eid="JER 44:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 44:24"/>Afei, Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ nnipa no nyinaa a mmaa no ka ho sɛ, “Mo Yudafoɔ a mowɔ Misraim nyinaa montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm. <verse eid="JER 44:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 44:25"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ: Mo ne mo yerenom de mo nneyɛɛ akyerɛ mo bɔ a mohyɛɛ sɛ, ‘Ampa ara yɛbɛdi ɛbɔ a yɛhyɛɛ sɛ, yɛbɛhye nnuhwam ahwie ahwiesa ama Ɔsoro Hemmaa no, no so.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 44:25">“Monkɔ so, monni mo bɔhyɛ ne mo ntam so! <verse eid="JER 44:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 44:26"/>Nanso, montie <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm, mo Yudafoɔ a mowɔ Misraim nyinaa. ‘Mede me din kɛseɛ no ka ntam sɛ,’ deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie, ‘obiara a ɔfiri Yuda a ɔte Misraim asase so baabiara remmɔ me din nka ntam bio da sɛ, “Sɛ Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> te ase yi.” <verse eid="JER 44:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 44:27"/>Na mɛhwɛ ama wɔahunu amane na ɛnyɛ yiedie; Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ Misraim bɛwuwu wɔ akofena ne ɛkɔm ano kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛsɛe wɔn nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 44:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 44:28"/>Wɔn a wɔbɛdwane afiri akofena ano na wasane afiri Misraim akɔ Yuda asase so no bɛyɛ kakraa bi. Afei Yuda nkaeɛfoɔ a wɔbɛtenaa Misraim no nyinaa bɛhunu deɛ nʼasɛm yɛ nokorɛ; me deɛ anaa wɔn deɛ.<verse eid="JER 44:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 44:29"/>“ ‘Yei na ɛbɛyɛ nsɛnkyerɛnneɛ ama mo sɛ mɛtwe mo aso wɔ ha, na mo ahunu sɛ ampa ara mʼahunahuna a ɛfa ɔhaw ho no bɛba mu,’ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ. <verse eid="JER 44:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 44:30"/>‘Mede Misraimhene Farao Hofra rebɛhyɛ nʼatamfoɔ a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkum no no nsa, sɛdeɛ mede Yudahene Sedekia hyɛɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar, ne ɔtamfoɔ a na ɔrepɛ no akum no no nsa. Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.’ ”<verse eid="JER 44:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 44"/>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="JER 45"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Wɔde Ma Baruk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 45:1"/>Yei ne nsɛm a odiyifoɔ Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Neria babarima Baruk wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoiakim adedie afe a ɛtɔ so ɛnan so mu, ɛberɛ a na Baruk atwerɛ nsɛm a ɛfiri Yeremia anom no agu nwoma mmobɔeɛ bi mu. <verse eid="JER 45:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 45:2"/>“Baruk, yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn ka kyerɛ wo: <verse eid="JER 45:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 45:3"/>Wokaa sɛ, ‘Nnome nka me! <char style="nd">Awurade</char> de awerɛhoɔ aka me yeadie ho, na apinisie ne ɔbrɛ ama mʼahoɔden asa.’ <verse eid="JER 45:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 45:4"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: ‘Mɛsɛe deɛ makyekyereɛ na matu deɛ medua no ase wɔ asase no so nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 45:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 45:5"/>Enti ɛsɛ sɛ wopɛ nneɛma akɛseɛ ma wo ho anaa? Ɛnyɛ saa. Ɛfiri sɛ mede amanehunu bɛba nnipa nyinaa so, <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, nanso baabiara a wobɛkɔ no, mɛbɔ wo ho ban.’ ”<verse eid="JER 45:5"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 45"/>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="JER 46"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛfa Misraim Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 46:1"/>Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa odiyifoɔ Yeremia hɔ a ɛfa aman no ho.<verse eid="JER 46:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 46:2"/>Deɛ ɛfa Misraim ho no nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 46:2"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 46:2">Yei ne nsɛm a ɛtia Misraimhene Farao Neko akodɔm a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar dii wɔn so nkonim wɔ Karkemis, Asubɔnten Eufrate ho wɔ Yudahene Yosia babarima Yehoakim adedie afe a ɛtɔ so ɛnan no:<verse eid="JER 46:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 46:3"/>“Siesie wʼakokyɛm, akɛseɛ ne nketewa nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:3">na montu ntene nkɔ ɔsa!<verse eid="JER 46:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 46:4"/>Monsiesie apɔnkɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">na momforo ntenatena wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Monyinagyina mo afa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">a mo dadeɛ kyɛ hyehyɛ mo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:4">Monse mo mpea ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:4">na monhyɛ mo nkataboɔ.<verse eid="JER 46:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 46:5"/>Ɛdeɛn na mehunu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">Wɔabɔ hu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">wɔresane wɔn akyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">wɔn nnɔmmarima adi nkoguo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">Wɔdwane ntɛm so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">a wɔnnhwɛ wɔn akyi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:5">na ehu wɔ baabiara,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:5">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 46:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 46:6"/>Ɔhoɔherɛfoɔ ntumi nnwane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">na ɔhoɔdenfoɔ nso saa ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:6">Atifi fam wɔ Asubɔnten Eufrate ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:6">wɔsuntisunti na wɔhwehwe ase.<verse eid="JER 46:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 46:7"/>“Hwan, na ɔma ne homene so sɛ Asubɔnten Nil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:7">sɛ nsubɔntene a emu nsuo woro soɔ yi?<verse eid="JER 46:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 46:8"/>Misraim ma ne homene so sɛ Nil,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">sɛ nsubɔntene a emu nsuo woro soɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:8">Ɔka sɛ, ‘Mɛsɔre akata asase no so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:8">mɛsɛe nkuropɔn ne emu nnipa.’<verse eid="JER 46:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 46:9"/>Monkɔ mo anim, apɔnkɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Monka wɔn anibereɛ so, Ao teaseɛnamkafoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:9">Montu ntene, Ao nnɔmmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Kus ne Put mmarimma a mokura akokyɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:9">Lidia mmarima a moto agyan.<verse eid="JER 46:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 46:10"/>Nanso, ɛda no yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> dea,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">aweretɔ da, nʼatamfoɔ so aweretɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Akofena bɛkunkum akɔsi sɛ ɔbɛmee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">akɔsi ɛberɛ a ɔde mogya bɛdwodwo ne sukɔm ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:10">Ɛfiri sɛ, <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛbɔ afɔdeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:10">wɔ atifi fam asase a ɛwɔ Asubɔnten Eufrate ho no so.<verse eid="JER 46:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 46:11"/>“Foro kɔ Gilead kɔgye aduro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">Ao, Misraim Babaa Babunu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:11">Nanso, nnuro bebrebe a wofa no yɛ kwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:11">ayaresa biara nni hɔ ma wo.<verse eid="JER 46:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 46:12"/>Amanaman no bɛte wʼanimguaseɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">wʼagyaadwoɔ bɛhyɛ asase so ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:12">Ɔkofoɔ baako bɛsunti ɔfoforɔ so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:12">na wɔn baanu bɛbɔ mu ahwe ase.”<verse eid="JER 46:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 46:13"/>Yei ne asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ka kyerɛɛ odiyifoɔ Yeremia a ɛfa Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ba a ɔbɛba abɛto ahyɛ Misraim so:<verse eid="JER 46:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 46:14"/>“Mommɔ yei ho dawuro wɔ Misraim, na mompae mu nka wɔ Migdol;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">monka wɔ Memfis ne Tapanhes nso sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:14">‘Monnyinagyina na monyɛ krado,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:14">ɛfiri sɛ, akofena rekunkum wɔn a wɔatwa mo ho ahyia.’<verse eid="JER 46:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 46:15"/>Adɛn enti na mo nnɔmmarima bɛboto sei?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:15">Wɔrentumi nnyina, ɛfiri sɛ, Awurade bɛbɔ wɔn ahwe fam.<verse eid="JER 46:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 46:16"/>Wɔbɛsuntisunti atoatoa so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">wɔbɛhwehwe ase adeda wɔn ho wɔn ho so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:16">Wɔbɛka sɛ, ‘Monsɔre, momma yɛnkɔ yɛn nkyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">nkɔ yɛn nkurɔfoɔ nkyɛn ne baabi a wɔwoo yɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:16">na yɛmfiri ɔhyɛsofoɔ no akofena ano.’<verse eid="JER 46:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 46:17"/>Ɛhɔ na wɔbɛteam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">‘Misraimhene Farao dwa nʼanom kwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:17">nʼakwannya a ɔwɔ no atwam.’<verse eid="JER 46:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 46:18"/>“Ampa ara sɛ mete ase yi” Ɔhene a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">ne din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:18">“Ɔbaako bɛba a ɔte sɛ Tabor wɔ mmepɔ no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:18">anaasɛ Karmel a ɛwɔ mpoano.<verse eid="JER 46:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 46:19"/>Mommoaboa mo nneɛma ano ntwɛn nnommumfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">mo a motete Misraim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:19">ɛfiri sɛ wɔbɛsɛe Memfis kuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:19">na ɛbɛda mpan a obiara rentena so.<verse eid="JER 46:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 46:20"/>“Misraim yɛ nantwie ba bereɛ a ne ho yɛ fɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">nanso kawere bi firi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:20">atifi fam reba ne so.<verse eid="JER 46:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 46:21"/>Asraafoɔ apaafoɔ a wɔwɔ wɔn mu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">te sɛ anantwie mma a wɔadɔre sradeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">Wɔn nso bɛdane wɔn ho adwane abom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">wɔrentumi nnyina wɔn nan so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:21">ɛfiri sɛ, amanehunu da no reba wɔn so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:21">ɛberɛ a wɔde bɛtwe wɔn aso no.<verse eid="JER 46:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 46:22"/>Misraim bɛtee so sɛ ɔtweaseɛ a ɔredwane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">ɛberɛ a ɔtamfoɔ de ahoɔden reba ne so no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:22">wɔde mmonnua bɛba ne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:22">te sɛ mmarima a wɔbu nnua.<verse eid="JER 46:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 46:23"/>Wɔbɛsɛe ne kwaeɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">“sɛdeɛ ayɛ kusuu yi mpo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:23">Wɔdɔɔso bebree sene ntutummɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:23">na wɔrentumi nkane wɔn.<verse eid="JER 46:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 46:24"/>Wɔbɛgu Ɔbabaa Misraim anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:24">wɔde no bɛhyɛ atifi fam nnipa no nsa.”<verse eid="JER 46:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 46:25"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, ka sɛ, “Mede asotwe reba Tebes nyame Amon, Farao, Misraim ne nʼanyame ne nʼahemfo ne wɔn a wɔde wɔn ho to Farao soɔ no so. <verse eid="JER 46:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 46:26"/>Mede wɔn bɛhyɛ wɔn a wɔpɛ sɛ wɔkum wɔn no nsa: Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ no. Nanso, akyire no, nnipa bɛtena Misraim asase so te sɛ kane no,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 46:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 46:27"/>“Nsuro, Ao Yakob me ɔsomfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">mma wʼaba mu mmu, Ao Israel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Ampa ara mɛgye wo afiri beaeɛ a ɛwɔ akyirikyiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">ne wʼasefoɔ afiri wɔn nnommumfa asase so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:27">Yakob bɛsane anya asomdwoeɛ ne banbɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:27">na obiara renhunahuna no.<verse eid="JER 46:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 46:28"/>Nsuro, Ao, Yakob me ɔsomfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">na me ne wɔ hɔ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">“Ɛwom sɛ mesɛe aman no nyinaa koraa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">aman a mehwetee mo kɔɔ so no deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">nanso merensɛe mo korakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 46:28">Mede tenenee nko ara na ɛbɛtenetene mo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 46:28">meremma mommfa mo ho nni a merentwe mo aso.”<verse eid="JER 46:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 46"/>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="JER 47"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛfa Filistifoɔ Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 47:1"/>Ansa na Farao bɛto ahyɛ Gasa so no, yei ne <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɛm a ɛfa Filistifoɔ ho a ɛbaa odiyifoɔ Yeremia nkyɛn:<verse eid="JER 47:1"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 47:2"/>Sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">“Monhwɛ sɛdeɛ nsuo retue wɔ atifi fam;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">ɛbɛbu afa asase no ne biribiara a ɛwɔ soɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">nkuro no ne nnipa a wɔtete mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:2">Nnipa no bɛteateam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:2">wɔn a wɔte asase no so nyinaa bɛtwa adwo<verse eid="JER 47:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 47:3"/>ɛberɛ a wɔate apɔnkɔ a wɔdi mmirika no nan ase nnyegyeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">na wɔate atamfoɔ no nteaseɛnam gyegyeegye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">ne wɔn ntwahonan nnyegyeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:3">Agyanom rentwa wɔn ani nhwɛ wɔn mma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:3">wɔn nsa bɛsensɛn wɔn ho kwa.<verse eid="JER 47:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 47:4"/>Na ɛda no aba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">sɛ wɔsɛe Filistifoɔ no nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">na wɔtwa wɔn a wɔaka no nyinaa gu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">wɔn a anka wɔtumi boa Tiro ne Sidon no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:4">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> rebɛsɛe Filistifoɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:4">nkaeɛfoɔ a wɔfiri Kreta mpoano no.<verse eid="JER 47:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 47:5"/>Gasa bɛbɔ tikwa ɛberɛ a ɔretwa adwo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">wɔbɛma Askelon atɔre mum.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:5">Ao nkaeɛfoɔ a mowɔ tata so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:5">mobɛsu akɔsi da bɛn?<verse eid="JER 47:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 47:6"/>“Mosu sɛ, ‘Aa <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akofena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">da bɛn na wobɛhome?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 47:6">Sane kɔhyɛ wo bɔha mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:6">gyae na da dinn.’<verse eid="JER 47:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 47:7"/>Na ɛbɛyɛ dɛn na ada dinn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">ɛberɛ a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyɛ no sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 47:7">ɔnkoto nhyɛ Askelon ne mpoano no so?”<verse eid="JER 47:7"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 47"/>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="JER 48"/>
  <para style="s1">Nsɛm A Ɛfa Moab Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 48:1"/>Asɛm a ɛfa Moab ho no nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 48:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:1">Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:1">“Nebo nnue, na wɔbɛsɛe no.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">Wɔbɛgu Kiriataim anim ase, na wɔakye no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:1">wɔbɛgu aban denden no anim ase, na wɔadwiri agu fam.<verse eid="JER 48:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 48:2"/>Wɔrenkamfo Moab bio;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">Hesbon mmarima bɛbɔ nʼasehweɛ ho pɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">‘Mommra, momma yɛn nkɔbɔ saa ɔman yi.’</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:2">Mo nso, Madmen mmarima mobɛka mo ano atom;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:2">akofena no bɛtaa mo.<verse eid="JER 48:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 48:3"/>Montie osu a ɛfiri Horonaim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:3">adesɛeɛ ne ɔsɛeɛ ho su.<verse eid="JER 48:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 48:4"/>Wɔbɛbɔ Moab:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:4">na ne mma nketewa bɛteateam.<verse eid="JER 48:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 48:5"/>Wɔforo kɔ Luhit,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">wɔde agyaadwotwa a emu yɛ den na ɛrekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:5">ɛkwan a ɛkɔ Horonaim so no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:5">wɔte ahoyera mu agyaadwotwa wɔ adesɛeɛ no ho.<verse eid="JER 48:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 48:6"/>Monnwane! Montu mmirika mpere mo nkwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:6">Momfa mo ho nsie sɛ wira wɔ anweatam so.<verse eid="JER 48:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 48:7"/>Esiane sɛ mode mo ho to mo nneyɛɛ ne mo ahonya so enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">mo nso wɔbɛfa mo nnommum,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:7">na Kemos bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:7">ɔne nʼasɔfoɔ ne adwumayɛfoɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 48:8"/>Ɔsɛefoɔ no bɛtu kuro biara so sa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">na emu biara renya ne ho ntete.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:8">Wɔbɛsɛe bɔnhwa no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">na wɔasɛe mmepɔ mpampam a ɛyɛ tamaa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:8">ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> akasa.<verse eid="JER 48:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 48:9"/>Momfa nkyene nhyɛ Moab,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">ɛfiri sɛ wɔrebɛsɛe no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:9">ne nkuro bɛda mpan a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:9">obiara rentena soɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 48:10"/>“Nnome nka deɛ ɔtwentwɛnee ne nan ase wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> adwumayɛ ho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:10">Nnome nka deɛ ɔmmfa nʼakofena nhwie mogya nguo!<verse eid="JER 48:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 48:11"/>“Moab atena ase asomdwoeɛ mu firi ne mmerante ɛberɛ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">te sɛ nsã ase puo a ataa dinn</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">a wɔnnhwie mfirii ahina mu nkɔguu ahina foforɔ mu da;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">saa ara na Moab nso nkɔɔ nnommumfa mu da.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:11">Enti ɔte sɛ deɛ ɔte ara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:11">na ne ho hwa nsesa.<verse eid="JER 48:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 48:12"/>Nanso, nna bi reba,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">“a mɛsoma mmarima a wɔhwie nsã firi ahina mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">na wɔbɛhwie no agu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:12">wɔbɛma nʼahina mu ayɛ hwee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:12">na wɔabobɔ ne nkuruwa.<verse eid="JER 48:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 48:13"/>Afei Kemos ho bɛyɛ Moab aniwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">sɛdeɛ Israel efie anim guu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:13">ɛberɛ a wɔde wɔn ho too Bet-El soɔ no.<verse eid="JER 48:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 48:14"/>“Ɛyɛ dɛn na wotumi ka sɛ, ‘Yɛyɛ nnɔmmarima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:14">mmarima akokoɔdurufoɔ wɔ ɔsa mu’?<verse eid="JER 48:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 48:15"/>Wɔbɛsɛe Moab na wɔatu ne nkuro so sa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">ne mmeranteɛ a wɔte apɔ no, wɔbɛkunkum wɔn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:15">deɛ Ɔhene a wɔfrɛ no Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no seɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 48:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 48:16"/>“Moab asehweɛ abɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:16">nʼamanehunu bɛba ntɛm.<verse eid="JER 48:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 48:17"/>Monsu no, mo a motete ne ho nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">ne mo a monim ne din nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:17">monka sɛ, ‘Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wɔabubu ahempoma a ɛyɛ den yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:17">Ɛyɛɛ dɛn na wɔabu animuonyam poma fɛfɛ yi mu?’<verse eid="JER 48:17"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 48:18"/>“Firi wʼanimuonyam mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">na bɛtena asase wesee no so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">wo a wote Ɔbabaa Dibon mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">ɛfiri sɛ deɛ ɔsɛe Moab no</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:18">bɛtu aba wo so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:18">abɛsɛe wo nkuropɔn a ɛwɔ banbɔ no.<verse eid="JER 48:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 48:19"/>Gyina kwankyɛn na hwɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">wo a wote Aroer.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:19">Bisa ɔbarima a ɔredwane no ne ɔbaa a ɔrefiri mu afi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:19">bisa wɔn sɛ, ‘Asɛm bɛn na asie?’<verse eid="JER 48:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 48:20"/>Moab anim agu ase, ɛfiri sɛ wɔabubu no pasaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">montwa adwo na monteateam!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:20">Mommɔ dawuro wɔ Arnon ho sɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:20">wɔasɛe Moab.<verse eid="JER 48:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 48:21"/>Atemmuo aba bepɔ tamaa so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:21">wɔ Holon, Yahas ne Mefaat,<verse eid="JER 48:21"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 48:22"/>Dibon ne Nebo ne Bet-Diblataim<verse eid="JER 48:22"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 48:23"/>ne Kiriataim ne Bet Gamul ne Bet Meon<verse eid="JER 48:23"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 48:24"/>ne Keriot ne Bosra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:24">wɔ Moab nkuro nyinaa, deɛ ɛwɔ akyirikyiri ne deɛ ɛbɛn.<verse eid="JER 48:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 48:25"/>Wɔatwa Moab abɛn;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">na ne basa abu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:25">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:25"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 48:26"/>“Momma no mmoro nsã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">ɛfiri sɛ wabu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:26">Momma Moab nyantam wɔ ne feɛ mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:26">momma no nyɛ fɛdideɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 48:27"/>Ɛnyɛ Israel na na ɔyɛ mo fɛdideɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">Wɔkyeree no akorɔmfoɔ mu anaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:27">a enti mowoso mo ti animtiabuo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:27">ɛberɛ biara a mobɛka ne ho asɛm?<verse eid="JER 48:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 48:28"/>Monfifiri mo nkuro so nkɔtena abotan mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">mo a motete Moab.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:28">Monyɛ sɛ aborɔnoma a ɔyɛ ne pirebuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:28">wɔ ɔbodan ano.<verse eid="JER 48:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 48:29"/>“Yɛate Moab ahantan no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">nʼahomasoɔ ne gye a ɔgye ne ho di mmorosoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:29">nʼahantan ne nʼahomasoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:29">ne nʼakoma mu ahohoahoa.<verse eid="JER 48:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 48:30"/>Menim nʼasoɔden nanso ɛyɛ ɔkwa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:30">“na nʼahohoahoa mfa hwee mma.<verse eid="JER 48:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 48:31"/>Enti metwa adwo ma Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:31">mesu team ma Moabfoɔ nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:31">medi awerɛhoɔ ma nnipa a wɔwɔ Kir Hereset.<verse eid="JER 48:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 48:32"/>Mesu ma mo sɛdeɛ Yaser su,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">Ao Sibma bobe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Mo mman dendane kɔɔ ɛpo ho pɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">kɔduruu Yaser ɛpo ho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:32">Ɔsɛefoɔ no abɛgu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:32">mo nnuaba a abereɛ ne mo bobe no so.<verse eid="JER 48:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 48:33"/>Ahosɛpɛ ne anigyeɛ atu afiri</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">Moab nnuaba nturo ne mfuo so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Matwa nsã a ɛtene firi nsakyimena no so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">obiara mmfa ahosɛpɛ ntiatia bobe no so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:33">Ɛwom sɛ nteateam wɔ hɔ deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:33">nanso ɛnyɛ ahosɛpɛ nteateam.<verse eid="JER 48:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 48:34"/>“Wɔn su ano den gyegye firi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">Hesbon de kɔsi Eleale ne Yahas,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:34">firi Soar de kɔsi Horonaim ne Eglat Selisiya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:34">Mpo, nsuo a ɛwɔ Nimrim no awe.<verse eid="JER 48:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 48:35"/>Moab hɔ no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">mede sorɔnsorɔmmea afɔrebɔ ne nnuhwam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:35">a wɔhye ma wɔn anyame no bɛba awieeɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:35">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 48:36"/>“Enti mʼakoma su sɛ atɛntɛbɛn ma Moab;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">esu sɛ atɛntɛbɛn ma nnipa a wɔwɔ Kir Hereset.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:36">Ahonyadeɛ a wɔpɛeɛ no kɔ.<verse eid="JER 48:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 48:37"/>Wɔabɔ etire biara tikwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">na wɔayi abɔgyesɛ biara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:37">nsa nyinaa ho ayɛ akamakam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:37">na ayitoma sisi obiara asene.<verse eid="JER 48:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 48:38"/>Adan a ɛwɔ Moab nyinaa atifi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ne ɔmanfoɔ adwaberem nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:38">biribiara nni hɔ sɛ awerɛhoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ɛfiri sɛ mabubu Moab</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">ayɛ no sɛ ahina a obiara mpɛ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:38">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 48:39"/>“Hwɛ sɛdeɛ wabubuo afa! Hwɛ sɛdeɛ wɔretwa adwoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">Na hwɛ sɛdeɛ Moab de aniwuo dane nʼakyi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:39">Moab ayɛ fɛdideɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:39">ne ahodwiredeɛ ama wɔn a wɔatwa ne ho ahyia nyinaa.”<verse eid="JER 48:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 48:40"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:40">“Monhwɛ! Ɔkɔdeɛ reto hoo aba fam.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:40">Watrɛ ne ntaban mu wɔ Moab so.<verse eid="JER 48:40"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 48:41"/>Wɔbɛfa Keriot nnommum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">na wafa nʼaban denden no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:41">Saa ɛda no Moab nnɔmmarima akoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:41">bɛtu sɛ ɔbaa a ɔrekyem awoɔ so.<verse eid="JER 48:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 48:42"/>Wɔbɛsɛe Moab na ɛrenyɛ ɔman bio,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:42">ɛfiri sɛ, ɔbuu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtia.<verse eid="JER 48:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 48:43"/>Ehu, nkomena ne mfidie retwɛn mo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">Ao Moabfoɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:43">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 48:44"/>“Deɛ ɔdwane deɛ ɛyɛ hu no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">bɛtɔ nkomena mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">deɛ ɔbɛforo afiri nkomena no mu no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">afidie bɛyi no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:44">na mede Moab asotwe afe no bɛba ne so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:44">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 48:44"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 48:45"/>“Hesbon nwunu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">na adwanefoɔ no gyinagyina a wɔnni mmoa biara,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">ɛfiri sɛ ogya bi atu afiri Hesbon;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">ɛgyadɛreɛ bi firi Sihon mfimfini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:45">ɛhye Moabfoɔ moma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:45">ne ahohoahoafoɔ a wɔn ano yɛ den no ti kwankoraa.<verse eid="JER 48:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 48:46"/>Nnome nka wo Ao, Moab!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">Wɔasɛe Kemos nkurɔfoɔ no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 48:46">wɔde wo mmammarima kɔ nnommumfa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:46">na wo mmammaa nso kɔ nkoasom mu.<verse eid="JER 48:46"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 48:47"/>“Nanso mede Moab adenya bɛsane ama no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">wɔ nna a ɛbɛba no mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 48:47">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 48:47">Moab atemmuo no awieeɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 48:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 48"/>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="JER 49"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Amon Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 49:1"/>Deɛ ɛfa Amonfoɔ ho no nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:1"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:1">Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">“Israel nni mmammarima anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Ɔnni wɔn a wɔbɛdi nʼadeɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:1">Ɛnneɛ adɛn enti na Molek afa Gad ayɛ ne dea yi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:1">Adɛn enti na ne nkurɔfoɔ tete ne nkuro mu?<verse eid="JER 49:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 49:2"/>Nanso nna no reba,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">“a mɛbobom de afrɛ ɔko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">atia Raba a ɛwɔ Amonfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">ɛbɛyɛ nkunkumaboɔ sie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">wɔbɛto nkuraaseɛ a atwa ne ho ahyia no mu ogya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:2">Na Israel bɛpamo wɔn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">wɔpamoo noɔ no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:2">sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 49:3"/>“Twa adwo Ao, Hesbon, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔasɛe Ai!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">Monteam Ao, mo a mowɔ Raba!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">Momfira ayitoma na monni awerɛhoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">mommɔ nnyenyen wɔ afasuo no mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:3">ɛfiri sɛ Molek bɛkɔ nnommumfa mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:3">ɔne nʼasɔfoɔ ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ.<verse eid="JER 49:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 49:4"/>Adɛn enti na wode wo bɔnhwa ahodoɔ hoahoa wo ho?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">Sɛdeɛ ɛso aba bebree enti anaa?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:4">Ao ɔbabaa a ɔnni nokorɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">wode wo ho to wʼahonya so na woka sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:4">‘Hwan na ɔbɛto ahyɛ me so?’<verse eid="JER 49:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 49:5"/>Mede ehu bɛba wo so;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">ɛbɛfiri wɔn a wɔatwa wo ho ahyia no nyinaa,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:5">“Wɔbɛpam mo nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:5">na obiara remmoaboa akobɔfoɔ ano.<verse eid="JER 49:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 49:6"/>“Nanso, akyire no, mɛsane de Amonfoɔ adenya ama wɔn,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:6">sei na <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Edom Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 49:7"/>Deɛ ɛfa Edom ho no nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:7"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:7">Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:7">“Nyansa nni Teman bio anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Afutuo ayera wɔ anyansafoɔ mu anaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:7">Wɔn nyansa no aporɔ anaa?<verse eid="JER 49:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 49:8"/>Monnane mo ho na monnwane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">monkɔtetɛ abodan a emu dɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">mo a motete Dedan,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:8">ɛfiri sɛ, mede amanehunu bɛba Esau so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:8">wɔ ɛberɛ a mɛtwe nʼaso no.<verse eid="JER 49:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 49:9"/>Sɛ wɔn a wɔtete bobe no baa mo nkyɛn a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">anka wɔrennya bobe no kakra?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:9">Sɛ akorɔmfoɔ baa ɔdasuo mu a,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:9">anka wɔrenwia deɛ wɔpɛ nko ara?<verse eid="JER 49:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 49:10"/>Na mɛma Esau ada adagya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">Mɛda ne hintabea ahodoɔ adi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">sɛdeɛ ɔrentumi mfa ne ho nsuma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:10">Ne mma, nʼabusuafoɔ ne ne mfɛfoɔ bɛwuwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:10">na wɔrenhunu no bio.<verse eid="JER 49:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 49:11"/>‘Monnya mo nwisiaa, na mɛbɔ wɔn nkwa ho ban.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:11">Mo akunafoɔ nso bɛtumi de wɔn ho ato me so.’ ”<verse eid="JER 49:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 49:12"/>Deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ nie: “Sɛ wɔtwe wɔn a wɔmfata sɛ wɔtwe wɔn aso mpo a, ɛnneɛ adɛn enti na ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔtwe mo aso? Wɔbɛtwe mo aso! <verse eid="JER 49:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 49:13"/>Meka me ho ntam sɛ wɔbɛsɛe Bosra na ayɛ ahodwiredeɛ, ahohoradeɛ ne nnomedeɛ; na ne nkuro nyinaa bɛsɛe afebɔɔ,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 49:14"/>Mate asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">wɔsomaa ananmusini bi sɛ ɔnkɔka nkyerɛ amanaman no sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:14">“Mommoaboa mo ho ano nkɔto nhyɛ ne so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:14">Monsɔre nkɔ ɔko!”<verse eid="JER 49:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 49:15"/>“Na mɛyɛ wo ketewa wɔ amanaman no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:15">na wɔabu wo animtia.<verse eid="JER 49:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 49:16"/>Ehu a wobɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">nkurɔfoɔ akoma mu no adaadaa wo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">wo a wote abotan ntokuro mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">na wote kokoɔ no sorɔnsorɔmmea.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:16">Ɛwom sɛ woyɛ wo pirebuo wɔ soro tɛ sɛ ɔkɔdeɛ deɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">nanso ɛhɔ na mɛfiri de wo aba fam,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:16">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 49:17"/>“Edom bɛyɛ ahodwiredeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">wɔn a wɔtwam hɔ nyinaa ho bɛdwiri wɔn na wɔadi ne ho fɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:17">ɛsiane nʼapirakuro nyinaa enti.<verse eid="JER 49:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 49:18"/>Sɛdeɛ wɔdanee Sodom ne Gomora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">ne wɔn nkurotoɔ guiɛ no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:18">“saa ara na obiara rentena hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:18">onipa biara rentena mu.<verse eid="JER 49:18"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 49:19"/>“Sɛdeɛ gyata firi Yordan nkyɛkyerɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">kɔ adidibea frɔmfrɔm no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">saa ara na mɛtaa Edom so afiri nʼasase so wɔ ɛberɛ tiawa bi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Hwan ne deɛ mayi no sɛ ɔnyɛ yei?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:19">Hwan na ɔte sɛ me na hwan na ɔbɛtumi ne me adi asie?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:19">Na odwanhwɛfoɔ bɛn na ɔbɛtumi asɔre atia me?”<verse eid="JER 49:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 49:20"/>Enti tie deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyehyɛ atia Edom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">deɛ wabɔ ne tirim sɛ ɔbɛyɛ de atia wɔn a wɔte Teman nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:20">Nnwankuo no mu nkumaa no mpo, wɔbɛtwe wɔn akɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:20">wɔn enti wɔbɛsɛe adidibea no koraa.<verse eid="JER 49:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 49:21"/>Wɔn asehweɛ nnyegyeeɛ bɛma asase awoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:21">wɔn nteateam bɛgyegye akɔduru Ɛpo Kɔkɔɔ ho.<verse eid="JER 49:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 49:22"/>Monhwɛ! Ɔkɔdeɛ bi bɛtu akɔ soro na wato hoo aba fam a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">watrɛtrɛ ne ntaban mu wɔ Bosra so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:22">Saa ɛda no, Edom nnɔmmarima akoma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:22">bɛtu sɛ ɔbaa a ɔrekyem wɔ awoɔ so.<verse eid="JER 49:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Damasko Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 49:23"/>Deɛ ɛfa Damasko ho no nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">“Hamat ne Arpad aba mu abu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">ɛfiri sɛ wɔate asɛmmɔne.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:23">Wɔn akoma aboto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:23">te sɛ ɛpo a ɛrehuru soɔ.<verse eid="JER 49:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 49:24"/>Damasko ayɛ mmerɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">wayɛ sɛ ɔrebɛdwane;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">wabɔ huboa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:24">ahoyera ne ɔyea akyekyere no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:24">ɔyea a ɛte sɛ ɔbaa a ɔrekyem wɔ awoɔ so deɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 49:25"/>Adɛn enti na wɔnnyaa kuropɔn a agye din yi ntoo hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:25">kuro a mʼani gye muo?<verse eid="JER 49:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 49:26"/>Ampa ara ne mmeranteɛ bɛhwehwe ase wɔ mmɔntene so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">wɔbɛma nʼasraafoɔ nyinaa aka wɔn ano atom saa ɛda no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:26">sɛi na Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 49:27"/>“Mede ogya bɛto Damasko afasuo mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:27">na ɛbɛhye Ben-Hadad aban.”<verse eid="JER 49:27"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Kedar Ne Hasor Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 49:28"/>Deɛ ɛfa Kedar ne Hasor ahennie a Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar to hyɛɛ soɔ no nie.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 49:28"/>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 49:28">Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:28">“Sɔre na kɔto hyɛ Kedar so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:28">na sɛe nnipa a wɔwɔ apueeɛ fam no.<verse eid="JER 49:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 49:29"/>Wɔbɛfa wɔn ntomadan ne wɔn nnwankuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">wɔbɛfa wɔn nkatasoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">ne wɔn ho nneɛma ne nyoma akɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:29">Nnipa bɛteateam sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:29">‘Ehu wɔ baabiara!’<verse eid="JER 49:29"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 49:30"/>“Monnwane nkɔ ntɛm ntɛm!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">Monhyehyɛ abodan a emu dɔ mu, mo a motete Hasor,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:30">“Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar apam mo tiri so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:30">wayɛ nhyehyɛeɛ a ɛtia mo.<verse eid="JER 49:30"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 49:31"/>“Sɔre kɔto hyɛ ɔman bi so a woremmrɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">ɔman a wɔte ahotosoɔ mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:31">“ɔman a wɔnni apono anaa akwansideɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:31">na emu nnipa nko ara na wɔte hɔ.<verse eid="JER 49:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 49:32"/>Wɔn mfunumu bɛyɛ afodeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">na wɔn anantwikuo akɛseɛ no bɛyɛ asadeɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:32">Mɛbɔ saa nnipa a wɔtete akyirikyiri no ahwete ama mframa no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">na mede amanehunu bɛfiri afa nyinaa aba wɔn so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:32">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 49:33"/>“Hasor bɛdane sakraman atuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">ɛbɛda mpan afebɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:33">Obiara rentena hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:33">onipa biara rentena mu.”<verse eid="JER 49:33"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Elam Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 49:34"/>Yei ne asɛm a ɛfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nkyɛn baa odiyifoɔ Yeremia hɔ a ɛfa Elam ho, wɔ Yudahene Sedekia adedie mfitiaseɛ: <verse eid="JER 49:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 49:35"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">“Hwɛ, mɛbubu Elam agyan mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:35">deɛ wɔn ahoɔden gyina soɔ no.<verse eid="JER 49:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 49:36"/>Mede mframa ɛnan no bɛba Elam so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">afiri ɔsorosoro afanan;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:36">mɛbɔ wɔn ahwete mframa ɛnan no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:36">na Elam atukɔfoɔ akɔ ɔman biara so.<verse eid="JER 49:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 49:37"/>Mɛbɔ Elam ahwete wɔ wɔn atamfoɔ anim,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">wɔ wɔn a wɔrepɛ wɔn akum wɔn no anim;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">mede amanehunu bɛba wɔn so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">mpo mʼabufuhyeɛ no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:37">“Mede akofena bɛtaa wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:37">kɔsi sɛ mɛwie wɔn korakora.<verse eid="JER 49:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 49:38"/>Mɛsi mʼahennwa wɔ Elam</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 49:38">na masɛe ne ɔhene ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:38">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 49:39"/>“Nanso, mɛsane de Elam adenya ama no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">nna a ɛreba no mu,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 49:39">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 49:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 49"/>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="JER 50"/>
  <para style="s1">Asɛm A Ɛfa Babilonia Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 50:1"/>Asɛm a <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nam odiyifoɔ Yeremia so ka faa Babilonia ne Babiloniafoɔ asase ho nie:<verse eid="JER 50:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 50:2"/>“Mommɔ no dawuro na mompae mu nka wɔ amanaman mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">Mompagya frankaa na mompae mu nka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">na momma wɔnte sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">‘Wɔbɛfa Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">wɔbɛgu Bel anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">na ehu bɛhyɛ Merodak ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:2">Wɔbɛgu ne nsɛsodeɛ anim ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:2">na ehu bɛhyɛ nʼahoni ma.’<verse eid="JER 50:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 50:3"/>Ɔman bi firi atifi fam bɛto ahyɛ ne so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">na wɔbɛyɛ nʼasase amanfo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:3">Obiara rentena so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:3">nnipa ne mmoa bɛdwane afiri so.<verse eid="JER 50:3"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 50:4"/>“Nna no mu ne saa ɛberɛ no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:4">“Israelfoɔ ne Yudafoɔ bɛka abom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:4">de nisuo akɔhwehwɛ wɔn <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 50:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 50:5"/>Wɔbɛbisa ɛkwan a ɛkɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">na wɔde wɔn ani akyerɛ hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:5">Wɔbɛba de wɔn ho abɛbɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">wɔ daa apam a wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:5">werɛ remfiri mu.<verse eid="JER 50:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 50:6"/>“Me nkurɔfoɔ ayɛ nnwan a wɔayera;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">wɔn nnwanhwɛfoɔ ama wɔafom ɛkwan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">ma wɔkyinkyinii mmepɔ so.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:6">Wɔkyinkyinii bɛpɔ ne kokoɔ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:6">na wɔn werɛ firii wɔn ankasa homebea.<verse eid="JER 50:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 50:7"/>Obiara a ɔhunuu wɔn no tetee wɔn mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">wɔn atamfoɔ kaa sɛ, ‘Yɛn nni fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:7">ɛfiri sɛ wɔyɛɛ bɔne tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, wɔn nokorɛ didibea no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:7">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔn agyanom anidasoɔ no.’<verse eid="JER 50:7"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 50:8"/>“Monnwane mfiri Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">momfiri Babiloniafoɔ asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:8">na monyɛ sɛ mpapo a wɔdi nnwankuo anim.<verse eid="JER 50:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 50:9"/>Mɛkanyane amanaman akɛseɛ nkabom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">afiri atifi fam asase so de wɔn abɛtia Babilonia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Wɔbɛgyinagyina wɔn afa atia no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">wɔbɛfiri atifi fam ako afa no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:9">Wɔn agyan bɛyɛ sɛ nnɔmmarima a wɔakwadare akodie mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:9">wɔn a wɔmmfa nsapan nsane wɔn akyi.<verse eid="JER 50:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 50:10"/>Enti wɔbɛfom Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">wɔn a wɔfom no nyinaa bɛnya afodeɛ bebree,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:10">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 50:11"/>“Esiane sɛ mo ani gye na modi ahurisie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">mo a mofom mʼagyapadeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:11">sɛ mohurihuri anigyeɛ so te sɛ nantwiforo a ɔwɔ ɛserɛ frɔmm mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:11">na mosu te sɛ apɔnkɔnini enti,<verse eid="JER 50:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 50:12"/>Wo maame ani bɛwu pa ara;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">deɛ ɔwoo woɔ anim bɛgu ase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:12">Ɔbɛyɛ akumaa wɔ amanaman no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:12">ɛserɛ, asase wesee ne anweatam.<verse eid="JER 50:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 50:13"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo enti, obiara rentena hɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">na ɛbɛda mpan korakora.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:13">Wɔn a wɔtwam wɔ Babilonia nyinaa ho bɛdwiri wɔn na wɔadi ne ho fɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:13">ɛsiane nʼapirakuro nyinaa enti.<verse eid="JER 50:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 50:14"/>“Monnyinagyina mo afa ntwa Babilonia ho nhyia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">mo a moto agyan nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:14">Monto no! Monnnya bɛmma biara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:14">ɛfiri sɛ wayɛ bɔne atia <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 50:15"/>Monteam ntia no wɔ afanan nyinaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">Ɔma ne nsa so, nʼaban denden bubu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">wɔdwiri nʼafasuo gu fam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:15">Esiane sɛ yei yɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aweretɔ no enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">montɔ ne so were;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:15">monyɛ no sɛdeɛ wayɛ afoforɔ no.<verse eid="JER 50:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 50:16"/>Monyi ogufoɔ mfiri Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">ɔne ɔtwafoɔ a ɔkura ne kantankrankyi wɔ ɔtwa berɛ mu no.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:16">Esiane ɔhyɛsofoɔ no akofena enti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">obiara nsane nkɔ ne nkurɔfoɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:16">obiara nnwane nkɔ nʼankasa asase so.<verse eid="JER 50:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 50:17"/>“Israel yɛ nnwankuo a wɔahwete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">a agyata apam wɔn.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">Deɛ ɔdii ɛkan tetee ne mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">yɛ Asiriahene;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:17">na deɛ ɔdwerɛɛ ne nnompe akyire no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:17">yɛ Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar.”<verse eid="JER 50:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 50:18"/>Ɛno enti, yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:18">“Mɛtwe Babiloniahene ne nʼasase aso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:18">sɛdeɛ metwee Asiriahene aso no.<verse eid="JER 50:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 50:19"/>Na mede Israel bɛsane aba nʼankasa adidibea.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">Ɔbɛdidi wɔ Karmel ne Basan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:19">ɔbɛmee wɔ Efraim ne Gilead nkokoɔ so.<verse eid="JER 50:19"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 50:20"/>Saa nna no ne saa ɛberɛ no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔsɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">“Wɔbɛhwehwɛ Israel afɔbuo mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">nanso wɔrennya bi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">wɔbɛhwehwɛ Yuda nnebɔne mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:20">nanso wɔrenhunu bi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:20">ɛfiri sɛ, mede nkaeɛfoɔ a megyaa wɔn no bɔne bɛkyɛ wɔn.<verse eid="JER 50:20"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 50:21"/>“Monto nhyɛ Merataim asase so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">ne nnipa a wɔte Pekod.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:21">Montaa wɔn, monkunkum wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">na monsɛe wɔn korakora,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:21">“Monyɛ biribiara a mahyɛ mo no.<verse eid="JER 50:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 50:22"/>Ɔko mu gyegyeegye wɔ asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:22">ɔsɛeɛ kɛseɛ nnyegyeɛ!<verse eid="JER 50:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 50:23"/>Hwɛ sɛdeɛ wɔabubu na wɔabobɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">asase nyinaa so asaeɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:23">Hwɛ sɛdeɛ Babilonia ada mpan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:23">wɔ amanaman no mu!<verse eid="JER 50:23"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 50:24"/>Mesum wo afidie Ao Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:24">na ɛyii wo ansa na worehunu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">wɔhunu wo kyeree wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:24">ɛfiri sɛ woko tiaa <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.<verse eid="JER 50:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 50:25"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abue nʼakodeɛ akoradan</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">na wayi nʼabufuhyeɛ akodeɛ de apue,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:25">ɛfiri sɛ Otumfoɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ adwuma yɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:25">wɔ Babiloniafoɔ asase so.<verse eid="JER 50:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 50:26"/>Momfiri akyirikyiri mmra ne so.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">Mommubu nʼasan no ani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">monhɔre no sie sɛ ayuo akuakuo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:26">Monsɛe no korakora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:26">na monnnya no nkaeɛfoɔ biara.<verse eid="JER 50:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 50:27"/>Monkunkum nʼanantwinini nyinaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">momfa wɔn nkɔ ma wɔnkum wɔn!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:27">Musuo nka wɔn! Ɛfiri sɛ wɔn da no aduru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:27">ɛberɛ a wɔde bɛtwe wɔn aso no.<verse eid="JER 50:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 50:28"/>Montie akobɔfoɔ ne adwanefoɔ a wɔfiri Babilonia no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">sɛ wɔreka wɔ Sion</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:28">sɛdeɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, yɛn Onyankopɔn atɔ were</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:28">nʼasɔrefie ho aweretɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:28"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 50:29"/>“Momfrɛ agyantofoɔ nkɔtoa Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">wɔn a wɔto agyan nyinaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Montwa ne ho nhyia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">momma obiara nnwane.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Montua ne nneyɛɛ so ka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">monyɛ no sɛdeɛ wayɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:29">Ɛfiri sɛ, wabu <char style="nd">Awurade</char> animtia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:29">Israel kronkronni no.<verse eid="JER 50:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 50:30"/>Enti ne mmeranteɛ bɛtotɔ wɔ mmɔntene so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">wɔbɛtɔre nʼasraafoɔ nyinaa ase saa ɛda no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:30">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 50:31"/>“Hwɛ, mekyiri wo, Ao ɔhantanni.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:31">“ɛfiri sɛ wo da no aduru</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:31">ɛberɛ a wɔde bɛtwe wʼaso no.<verse eid="JER 50:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 50:32"/>Ɔhantanni no bɛsunti na wahwe ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">obiara rempagya no;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:32">mɛto ne nkuro mu ogya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:32">na ahye wɔn a atwa ne ho ahyia nyinaa.”<verse eid="JER 50:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 50:33"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">“Wɔhyɛ Israelfoɔ so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">na Yudafoɔ nso saa ara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:33">Wɔn nnommumfafoɔ no kura wɔn denden</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:33">a wɔmpɛ sɛ wɔgyaa wɔn ma wɔkɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:33"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 50:34"/>Nanso, wɔn Gyefoɔ yɛ ɔhoɔdenfoɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">ne din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:34">Ɔbɛdi wɔn asɛm ama wɔn anibereɛ so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">sɛdeɛ ɔde ahotɔ bɛba wɔn asase no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:34">na wɔn a wɔte Babilonia no deɛ, wahyɛ wɔn ahometeɛ.<verse eid="JER 50:34"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 50:35"/>“Akofena bi bɛsɔre atia Babiloniafoɔ!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:35">“Ɛbɛtia wɔn a wɔte Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:35">na atia nʼadwumayɛfoɔ ne nʼanyansafoɔ!<verse eid="JER 50:35"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 50:36"/>Akofena bi bɛsɔre atia nʼadiyifoɔ atorofoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:36">Wɔbɛdane nkwaseafoɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Akofena bi bɛsɔre atia nʼakofoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:36">Ehu bɛhyɛ wɔn ma.<verse eid="JER 50:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 50:37"/>Akofena bi bɛsɔre atia nʼapɔnkɔ ne ne nteaseɛnam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">ne amanfrafoɔ a wɔwɔ wɔn mu nyinaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Wɔbɛdane mmaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:37">Akofena bi bɛsɔre atia nʼademudeɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:37">Wɔbɛfom.<verse eid="JER 50:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 50:38"/>Ɔweɛ wɔ ne nsuo ahodoɔ so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">Ɛbɛwewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:38">Ɛfiri sɛ ɛyɛ ahoni asase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:38">ahoni a ehu bɛma wɔabobɔ adam.<verse eid="JER 50:38"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 50:39"/>“Enti ɛserɛ so mmoa ne mpataku bɛtena hɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">na ɛhɔ na ɔpatuo bɛtena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:39">Obiara rentena so bio</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:39">ɛfiri awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ kɔsi awoɔ ntoatoasoɔ.<verse eid="JER 50:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 50:40"/>Sɛdeɛ Onyankopɔn tuu Sodom ne Gomora</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">ne wɔn nkurotoɔ guiɛ no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:40">“saa ara na obiara rentena hɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:40">onipa biara rentena mu.<verse eid="JER 50:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 50:41"/>“Monhwɛ! Akodɔm bi firi atifi fam reba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">ɔman kɛseɛ ne ahemfo bebree,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:41">wɔrehwanyane wɔn afiri nsase ano.<verse eid="JER 50:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 50:42"/>Wɔkurakura bɛmma ne pea;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">wɔn tirim yɛ den, na wɔnni ahummɔborɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">Wɔn nnyegyeeɛ te sɛ ɛpo a ɛrehuru soɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">Sɛ wɔtete wɔn apɔnkɔ so a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:42">wɔba sɛ mmarima a wɔrekɔ sa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:42">abɛto ahyɛ wo so, Ao Ɔbabaa Babilonia.<verse eid="JER 50:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 50:43"/>Babiloniahene ate wɔn ho nsɛm,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ne nsa sesa ne ho kwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:43">Ahohiahia akyekyere no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:43">ɔyea a ɛte sɛ ɔbaa a ɔrekyem awoɔ so.<verse eid="JER 50:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 50:44"/>Sɛdeɛ gyata a ɔfiri Yordan nkyɛkyerɛ mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">rekɔ adidibea frɔmfrɔm no,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">saa ara na mɛtaa Babilonia so afiri nʼasase so wɔ ɛberɛ tiawa bi mu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Hwan ne deɛ mayi no sɛ ɔnyɛ yei?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:44">Hwan na ɔte sɛ me, na hwan na ɔbɛtumi ne me adi asie?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:44">Na odwanhwɛfoɔ bɛn na ɔbɛtumi asɔre atia me?”<verse eid="JER 50:44"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 50:45"/>Enti tie deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahyehyɛ atia Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">deɛ wabɔ ne tirim sɛ ɔbɛyɛ de atia Babiloniafoɔ asase nie:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 50:45">Nnwankuo no mu nkumaa no mpo, wɔbɛtwe wɔn akɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:45">wɔn enti ɔbɛsɛe adidibea no koraa.<verse eid="JER 50:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 50:46"/>Babilonia nnommumfa nnyegyeeɛ bɛma asase awoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 50:46">ne nteateam bɛgyegye wɔ amanaman no mu.<verse eid="JER 50:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 50"/>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="JER 51"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 51:1"/>Yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:1">“Monhwɛ, mɛkanyane ɔsɛefoɔ bi honhom</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:1">atia Babilonia ne nnipa a wɔwɔ Leb Kamai.<verse eid="JER 51:1"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 51:2"/>Mɛsoma amanfrafoɔ akɔ Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">sɛ wɔnkɔhuhu ne so na wɔnsɛe nʼasase;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:2">wɔbɛtia no wɔ afanan nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:2">wɔ nʼamanehunu da no.<verse eid="JER 51:2"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 51:3"/>Mma agyantoni mpoma nʼagyan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">mma ɔnhyɛ ne nkataboɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:3">Mma ne mmeranteɛ mfa wɔn ho nni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:3">sɛe nʼakodɔm no pasaa.<verse eid="JER 51:3"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 51:4"/>Wɔbɛhwehwe ase a wɔatotɔ wɔ Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:4">a wɔapirapira yie wɔ ne mmɔntene so.<verse eid="JER 51:4"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 51:5"/>Na Asafo Onyankopɔn <char style="nd">Awurade</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">nnyaa Israel ne Yuda hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:5">Ɛwom sɛ afɔdie ahyɛ wɔn asase no so ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:5">wɔ Israel Ɔkronkronni no anim, nanso ɔkɔ so ara yɛ wɔn Onyankopɔn.<verse eid="JER 51:5"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 51:6"/>“Monnwane mfiri Babilonia!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Montu mmirika mpere mo nkwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">Mommma wɔnsɛe mo ɛsiane wɔn bɔne enti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:6">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aweretɔberɛ aso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:6">ɔde deɛ ɛfata no bɛtua wɔn ka.<verse eid="JER 51:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 51:7"/>Na Babilonia yɛ sikakɔkɔɔ kuruwa wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> nsam;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">ɔmaa asase nyinaa boroo nsã.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:7">Aman no nom ne nsã;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:7">ɛno enti, afei, wɔabobɔ adam.<verse eid="JER 51:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 51:8"/>Babilonia bɛhwe ase abubu mpofirim.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">Montwa ne ho agyaadwoɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:8">Mompɛ ne yea no ano aduro;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:8">ebia ne ho bɛtɔ no.<verse eid="JER 51:8"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 51:9"/>“ ‘Anka yɛbɛsa Babilonia yadeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">nanso wɔntumi nsa no yadeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:9">momma yɛnnya no hɔ na obiara nkɔ nʼankasa asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">ɛfiri sɛ nʼatemmuo aduru ɔsorosoro.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:9">Ɛforo ɔsoro te sɛ omununkum.’<verse eid="JER 51:9"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 51:10"/>“ ‘<char style="nd">Awurade</char> abu yɛn bem.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">Mommra, momma yɛnka wɔ Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:10">deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛn Onyankopɔn ayɛ.’<verse eid="JER 51:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 51:11"/>“Monse agyan no ano!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">Momfa nkataboɔ no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ahwanyane Mede ahemfo no,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">ɛfiri sɛ ne botaeɛ ne sɛ ɔbɛsɛe Babilonia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:11">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛtɔ were</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:11">aweretɔ ama nʼasɔrefie no.<verse eid="JER 51:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 51:12"/>Mompagya frankaa bi ntia Babilonia afasuo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Mommia banbɔ mu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">momma awɛmfoɔ no nnyinagyina.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">Monsiesie ahintaeɛ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:12">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛma nʼatirimpɔ aba mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:12">deɛ wahyɛ atia Babilonia no.<verse eid="JER 51:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 51:13"/>Mo a motete nsuwansuwa bebree ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">na akoradeɛ abu mo so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:13">mo awieeɛ aba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:13">ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwa mo twene no.<verse eid="JER 51:13"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 51:14"/>Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> aka ne ho ntam sɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:14">mede nnipa bɛhyɛ wo ma sɛ mmɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:14">na wɔabɔ ose wɔ wo so.<verse eid="JER 51:14"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 51:15"/>“Ɔde ne tumi bɔɔ asase;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:15">ɔtoo ewiase fapem wɔ ne nyansa mu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:15">na ɔde ne nhunumu trɛɛ ɔsorosoro mu.<verse eid="JER 51:15"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 51:16"/>Sɛ ɔbobɔm a, ɔsoro nsuo woro so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">ɔma omununkum ma ne ho so firi nsase ano.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:16">Ɔsoma anyinam ka ɔsutɔ ho</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:16">na ɔma mframa bɔ firi nʼakoradan mu.<verse eid="JER 51:16"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 51:17"/>“Onipa biara nnim nyansa, na ɔnni nimdeɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">sikadwumfoɔ biara anim agu ase, ɛsiane nʼahoni enti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:17">Ne nsɛsodeɛ yɛ atorɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:17">wɔnni ahome biara wɔ wɔn mu.<verse eid="JER 51:17"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 51:18"/>Wɔn ho nni mfasoɔ, wɔyɛ aseredeɛ nneɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:18">sɛ wɔn atemmuo duru so a, wɔbɛyera.<verse eid="JER 51:18"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 51:19"/>Deɛ ɔyɛ Yakob Kyɛfa no nte sɛ yeinom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">ɛfiri sɛ ɔno ne adeɛ nyinaa Yɛfoɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:19">a nʼadedie abusuakuo ka ho bi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:19">Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ne ne din.<verse eid="JER 51:19"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 51:20"/>“Woyɛ me ko asaeɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">mʼakodeɛ a mede kɔ ɔsa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:20">mede wo dwerɛ amanaman,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:20">mede wo sɛe ahennie bebree,<verse eid="JER 51:20"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 51:21"/>mede wo bobɔ apɔnkɔ ne wɔn sotefoɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:21">teaseɛnam ne wɔn kafoɔ,<verse eid="JER 51:21"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 51:22"/>mede wo dwerɛ mmarima ne mmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">mede wo dwerɛ nkɔkoraa ne mmabunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:22">mede wo dwerɛ mmeranteɛ ne mmabaawa,<verse eid="JER 51:22"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 51:23"/>mede wo dwerɛ nnwanhwɛfoɔ ne nnwankuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">mede wo dwerɛ akuafoɔ ne anantwie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:23">mede wo dwerɛ amradofoɔ ne adwumayɛfoɔ.<verse eid="JER 51:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 51:24"/>“Mɛtua Babilonia ne wɔn a wɔtete Babilonia ka wɔ mfomsoɔ a wɔayɛ wɔ Sion nyinaa, wɔ wʼanim,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:24"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 51:25"/>“Ao, bepɔ sɛefoɔ me ne wo anya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">wo a wosɛe asase nyinaa no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:25">“Mɛtene me nsa wɔ wo so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">mɛpia wo afiri abotan no so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:25">na mayɛ wo sɛ bepɔ a ɛnka hwee.<verse eid="JER 51:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 51:26"/>Wɔremfa ɔboɔ biara mfiri wo so nyɛ tweatiboɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">anaa sɛ fapem mpo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:26">ɛfiri sɛ wobɛda mpan afebɔɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:26">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:26"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 51:27"/>“Mompagya frankaa wɔ asase no so!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Monhyɛn totorobɛnto no wɔ amanaman no mu!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Monsiesie amanaman no ma wɔnkɔko ntia no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Momfrɛfrɛ saa ahennie ahodoɔ yi ntia no:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">Ararat, Mini ne Askenas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:27">Monnyi ɔsahene ntia no;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:27">momfa apɔnkɔdɔm te sɛ mmɛbɛ mmra.<verse eid="JER 51:27"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 51:28"/>Monsiesie amanaman no ma wɔntu ne so sa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">mo ne Mede ahemfo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:28">wɔn amradofoɔ ne wɔn adwumayɛfoɔ nyinaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:28">ne aman a wɔdi wɔn so nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 51:28"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 51:29"/>Asase no woso, na ɔnukanuka ne mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> atirimpɔ a ɛtia Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:29">sɛ ɔbɛsɛe Babilonia asase a</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:29">obiara rentumi ntena so no nsesaeɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:29"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 51:30"/>Babilonia nnɔmmarima agyae ko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">wɔhyehyɛ wɔn aban mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Wɔn ahoɔden asa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">wɔayɛ sɛ mmaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:30">Wɔatoto nʼatenaeɛ ahodoɔ no mu ogya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:30">na wɔabubu nʼapono akyi adaban.<verse eid="JER 51:30"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 51:31"/>Abɔfoɔ didi so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">asomafoɔ didi so a</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:31">wɔrekɔbɔ Babiloniahene amaneɛ sɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:31">wɔafa ne kuropɔn no,<verse eid="JER 51:31"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 51:32"/>wɔagye atwaeɛ a ɛdeda asubɔnten no so afa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">na wɔde ogya ato ɔwora no mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:32">na asraafoɔ no abɔ huboa.”<verse eid="JER 51:32"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 51:33"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, Israel Onyankopɔn, seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:33">“Ɔbabaa Babilonia ayɛ sɛ ayuporobea</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">wɔ ɛberɛ a wɔretiatia hɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:33">Aka kakraa bi, na ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ sɛ wɔtwa no sɛ nnɔbaeɛ no aduru.”<verse eid="JER 51:33"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 51:34"/>“Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar adwerɛ yɛn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">ɔde yɛn ato ɔhaw mu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">wayɛ yɛn sɛ ahina a hwee nni muo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:34">Wamene yɛn sɛ ɔtweaseɛ no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">na ɔde yɛn nneɛma a ɛyɛ dɛ ahyɛ ne yafunu ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:34">na wape yɛn afiri nʼanom agu.<verse eid="JER 51:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JER 51:35"/>Ma ayakayakadeɛ a wɔde dii yɛn honam no mmra Babilonia so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">nnipa a wɔtete Sion na wɔka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:35">“Ma yɛn mogya ngu wɔn a wɔtete Babilonia so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:35">Yerusalem na ɔka.<verse eid="JER 51:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JER 51:36"/>Enti yei ne deɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">“Hwɛ, mɛdi mo asɛm ama mo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">na matɔ were ama mo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:36">Mɛma ɛpo a ɛwɔ no no awe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:36">na mama ne asutene awewe.<verse eid="JER 51:36"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JER 51:37"/>Babilonia bɛyɛ mmubuiɛ sie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">sakraman atu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:37">ahodwiredeɛ ne fɛdideɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:37">baabi a obiara nteɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:37"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JER 51:38"/>Ne nkurɔfoɔ nyinaa bobom sɛ agyata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:38">wɔpɔ so te sɛ agyata mma.<verse eid="JER 51:38"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JER 51:39"/>Nanso ɛberɛ a wɔahwanyane wɔn ho no</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">mɛto ɛpono ama wɔn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">na mama wɔaboboro nsã</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:39">sɛdeɛ wɔde nteateam bɛdi ahurisie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">na wɔadeda a wɔrennyane bio,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:39">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JER 51:40"/>“Mede wɔn bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">te sɛ nnwammaa a wɔrekɔkum wɔn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:40">te sɛ, nnwennini ne mpapo.<verse eid="JER 51:40"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JER 51:41"/>“Wɔbɛfa Sesak,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">Sesak a agye asase nyinaa ayɛyie no!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:41">Babilonia bɛyɛ ahodwiredeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:41">wɔ amanaman no mu!<verse eid="JER 51:41"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JER 51:42"/>Ɛpo bɛbunkam afa Babilonia so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:42">na nʼasorɔkye bɛkata ne so.<verse eid="JER 51:42"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JER 51:43"/>Ne nkuro bɛda mpan.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">Ɛbɛyɛ anweatam a ɛso awo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:43">asase a obiara nte soɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:43">na obiara nntu ɛkwan mfa so.<verse eid="JER 51:43"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JER 51:44"/>Mɛtwe Bel aso wɔ Babilonia</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">na mama wape deɛ wamene agu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:44">Amanaman no nnto santene nkɔ ne nkyɛn bio.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:44">Na Babilonia ɔfasuo bɛbubu.<verse eid="JER 51:44"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JER 51:45"/>“Me nkurɔfoɔ, Momfiri ne mu mfi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Montu mmirika mpere mo nkwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:45">Monnwane mfiri <char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuhyeɛ ano.<verse eid="JER 51:45"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JER 51:46"/>Mommma mo bo ntu na monnsuro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">sɛ mote atesɛm wɔ asase no so a;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:46">atesɛm bɛba afeɛ yi na foforɔ bɛba afedan,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">basabasayɛ ho atesɛm bɛba asase no so</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:46">a ɛfa sodifoɔ a wɔsɔre tia afoforɔ ho.<verse eid="JER 51:46"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JER 51:47"/>Na ampa ara ɛberɛ no bɛba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">a mɛtwe Babilonia ahoni aso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:47">nʼasase no nyinaa anim bɛgu ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:47">na nʼatɔfoɔ nyinaa bɛhwehwe ase wɔ ne so.<verse eid="JER 51:47"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JER 51:48"/>Ɔsoro ne asase ne deɛ ɛwo mu nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">de ahosɛpɛ bɛteam agu Babilonia so,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:48">ɛfiri sɛ ɔsɛefoɔ bɛfiri atifi fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">abɛto ahyɛ ne so,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:48">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:48"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JER 51:49"/>“Ɛsɛ sɛ Babilonia hwe ase, ɛsiane Israel atɔfoɔ enti,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">sɛdeɛ atɔfoɔ a wɔwɔ ewiase nyinaa ahwehwe ase</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:49">ɛsiane Babilonia enti no.<verse eid="JER 51:49"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JER 51:50"/>Mo a mo adwane afiri akofena ano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">monkɔ na monntwentwɛn mo nan ase!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:50">Monkae <char style="nd">Awurade</char> wɔ akyirikyiri asase so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:50">na monnwene Yerusalem ho.”<verse eid="JER 51:50"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JER 51:51"/>“Wɔagu yɛn anim ase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">ɛfiri sɛ wasopa yɛn</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">na fɛreɛ akata yɛn anim,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:51">ɛfiri sɛ amanfrafoɔ ahyɛne</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:51">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> efie kronkronbea ahodoɔ hɔ.”<verse eid="JER 51:51"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JER 51:52"/>“Nanso nna bi reba,” <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">“a mɛtwe nʼahoni aso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:52">na nʼasase so nyinaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:52">apirafoɔ bɛsi apinie.<verse eid="JER 51:52"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JER 51:53"/>Sɛ Babilonia kɔka ɔsoro mpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">na ɔmiamia nʼaban tenten banbɔ mu a,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:53">mɛsoma ɔsɛefoɔ abɛtia no,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:53">
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> na ɔseɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:53"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JER 51:54"/>“Osu nnyegyeeɛ bi firi Babilonia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">ɔsɛeɛ kɛseɛ bi nnyegyeeɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:54">firi Babiloniafoɔ asase so.<verse eid="JER 51:54"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JER 51:55"/>
    <char style="nd">Awurade</char> bɛsɛe Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">ɔbɛma nʼasotuatua nnyegyeeɛ no agyae.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:55">Atamfoɔ a wɔte sɛ ahum bɛtu sɛ nsuo akɛseɛ aba ne so;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:55">wɔn mmobom bɛgyegye.<verse eid="JER 51:55"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="JER 51:56"/>Ɔsɛefoɔ bi bɛba abɛtia Babilonia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">wɔbɛfa ne nnɔmmarima nnommum</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">na wɔbɛbubu wɔn tadua mu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:56">Ɛfiri sɛ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> yɛ Onyankopɔn a ɔhyɛ anan mu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:56">ɔbɛtua so ka pɛpɛɛpɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:56"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="JER 51:57"/>Mɛma nʼadwumayɛfoɔ ne nʼanyansafoɔ aboro nsã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">nʼamradofoɔ, ne mpanimfoɔ ne nnɔmmarima nso saa ara;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:57">wɔbɛdeda afebɔɔ a wɔrennyane,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:57">sei na ɔhempɔn a ne din ne Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> no seɛ.<verse eid="JER 51:57"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="JER 51:58"/>Yei ne deɛ Asafo <char style="nd">Awurade</char> seɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">“Wɔbɛdwiri Babilonia afasuo a ɛtrɛ no agu fam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">na wɔbɛto nʼapono a ɛwoware no mu ogya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JER 51:58">nnipa no ha wɔn ho kwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JER 51:58">ɔman no adwumayɛ ma ogya no dɛre mmom.”<verse eid="JER 51:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="JER 51:59"/>Yei ne asɛm a Yeremia ka kyerɛɛ Neria babarima Seraia a ɔyɛ adwumayɛfoɔ panin na ɔyɛ Maseia nana no, ɛberɛ a ɔne Yudahene Sedekia kɔɔ Babilonia wɔ nʼadedie afe a ɛtɔ so ɛnan no mu. <verse eid="JER 51:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="JER 51:60"/>Na Yeremia atwerɛ amanehunu a ɛbɛba Babilonia so no nyinaa agu nwoma mmobɔeɛ so, deɛ watwerɛ a ɛfa Babilonia ho nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 51:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JER 51:61"/>Ɔka kyerɛɛ Seraia sɛ, “Sɛ woduru Babilonia a, hwɛ sɛ wo bɛkenkan saa nsɛm yi nyinaa sɛdeɛ obiara bɛte. <verse eid="JER 51:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JER 51:62"/>Afei, ka sɛ, ‘Ao <char style="nd">Awurade</char>, woaka sɛ wobɛsɛe beaeɛ yi sɛdeɛ onipa anaa aboa biara rentumi ntena so; na ɛbɛda mpan afebɔɔ.’ <verse eid="JER 51:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JER 51:63"/>Sɛ wokenkane nwoma mmobɔeɛ yi wie a, kyekyere fam ɛboɔ ho, na to twene Asubɔnten Eufrate mu. <verse eid="JER 51:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JER 51:64"/>Afei ka sɛ, ‘Sei na Babilonia ne ne nkurɔfoɔ bɛmem a wɔrensɔre bio, ɛsiane amanehunu a mede bɛba ne so no enti.’ ”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 51:64">Yeremia nsɛm no awieeɛ nie.<verse eid="JER 51:64"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 51"/>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="JER 52"/>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalem Asehweɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JER 52:1"/>Sedekia dii adeɛ no, na wadi mfirinhyia aduonu baako. Ɔdii adeɛ wɔ Yerusalem mfirinhyia dubaako. Na ne maame din de Hamutal a ɔyɛ Yeremia babaa a ɔfiri Libna. <verse eid="JER 52:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JER 52:2"/>Ɔyɛɛ bɔne wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> ani so, sɛdeɛ Yehoiakim yɛeɛ no. <verse eid="JER 52:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JER 52:3"/><char style="nd">Awurade</char> abufuo enti na yeinom nyinaa baa Yerusalem ne Yuda so, na akyire no, ɔyii nʼani firii wɔn so.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:3">Afei, Sedekia sɔre tiaa Babiloniahene.<verse eid="JER 52:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JER 52:4"/>Enti Sedekia adedie afe a ɛtɔ so nkron no, bosome a ɛtɔ so edu ne da a ɛtɔ so edu no, Babiloniahene Nebukadnessar ne nʼakodɔm nyinaa tuu Yerusalem so sa; Wɔtuaa kuropɔn no, na wɔyɛɛ mpie twaa ho hyiaeɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JER 52:5"/>Wɔkaa Yerusalem hyɛɛ kɔsii ɔhene Sedekia ahennie no mfeɛ dubaako so.<verse eid="JER 52:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JER 52:6"/>Ɛduruu Tammus bosome (bɛyɛ Kitawonsa) da a ɛtɔ so dunwɔtwe no, Sedekia ahennie mfeɛ dubaako mu no, na ɛkɔm a aba kuropɔn no mu no ano ayɛ den yie, ama wɔn aduane a aka no nyinaa asa. <verse eid="JER 52:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JER 52:7"/>Na kuropɔn no ɔfasuo fa bi abu agu fam enti, asraafoɔ no nyinaa yɛɛ adwene sɛ, wɔbɛdwane afiri kuropɔn no mu. Nanso, ɛsiane sɛ na Babiloniafoɔ atwa kuropɔn no ho ahyia enti, wɔtwɛn kɔsii anadwo, na wɔdwane faa ɛpono a ɛda afasuo mmienu a ɛwɔ ɔhene no nturo no mu mu. Wɔyɛɛ ntɛm faa wiramkwan de wɔn ani kyerɛɛ Yordan bɔnhwa no. <verse eid="JER 52:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JER 52:8"/>Nanso, Babilonia akodɔm no taa Ɔhene Sedekia kɔtoo no wɔ Yeriko tata so. Na nʼasraafoɔ no nyinaa afiri ne ho abɔ apete, <verse eid="JER 52:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JER 52:9"/>na wɔkyeree no.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:9">Wɔfaa no dedua de no kɔmaa Babiloniahene wɔ Ribla a ɛwɔ Hamat asase so, na ɛhɔ na ɔbuu no atɛn. <verse eid="JER 52:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JER 52:10"/>Ribla hɔ na Babiloniahene kunkumm Sedekia mmammarima wɔ nʼanim na ɔkumm Yudafoɔ adwumayɛfoɔ nyinaa nso. <verse eid="JER 52:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JER 52:11"/>Afei ɔtutuu Sedekia ani, de kɔbere mfrafraeɛ mpokyerɛ guu no sɛ ɔde no rekɔ Babilonia. Ɛhɔ na ɔde no too afiase kɔsii ne wu da.<verse eid="JER 52:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JER 52:12"/>Ab bosome (bɛyɛ Ɔsannaa) ɛda a ɛtɔ so dunan wɔ afe a ɛyɛ Nebukadnessar mfeɛ dunkron adedie mu no, Nebusaradan a ɔyɛ awɛmfoɔ so panin a ɔyɛ Babiloniahene mpanimfoɔ nu mu baako no kɔɔ Yerusalem. <verse eid="JER 52:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JER 52:13"/>Ɔde ogya too <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan, ahemfie ne afie a ɛwɔ Yerusalem nyinaa mu. Ɔhyee efie biara a ɛdi mu. <verse eid="JER 52:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JER 52:14"/>Babiloniafoɔ akodɔm a wɔhyɛ ɔhene awɛmfoɔ so sahene ase no bubuu afasuo a atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia no nyinaa. <verse eid="JER 52:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JER 52:15"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua awɛmfoɔ ano no faa wɔn a wɔdi hia no mu bi, wɔn a wɔkaa kuropɔn no mu, adwumfoɔ a wɔaka ne wɔn a wɔkɔdɔm Babiloniahene no kɔɔ nnommumfa mu. <verse eid="JER 52:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JER 52:16"/>Nanso, Nebusaradan gyaa wɔn a wɔdi hia wɔ asase no so no nkaeɛ sɛ wɔnhwɛ bobe nturo ne mfuo no.<verse eid="JER 52:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JER 52:17"/>Babiloniafoɔ no bubuu kɔbere mfrafraeɛ afadum, nnyinasodeɛ a wɔtumi moma soɔ ne kɔbere mfrafraeɛ Po a na ɛwɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu, na wɔde kɔbere mfrafraeɛ no nyinaa kɔɔ Babilonia. <verse eid="JER 52:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JER 52:18"/>Afei, wɔfaa nkukuo, nsofi, kaneahoma twitwasoɔ, ɔpete nkuruwa, nwowaa ne kɔbere mfrafraeɛ nneɛma a wɔde yɛ ɔsom adwuma wɔ asɔredan mu no nso kɔeɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JER 52:19"/>Ɔhene awɛmfoɔ sahene no faa nkankyee, nkankyee ntrawantrawa, ɔpete nkuruwa, nkukuo, kaneannua, nwowaa ne nkuruwa a wɔde di ɔnom afɔrebɔ ho dwuma no kɔeɛ; wɔde sikakɔkɔɔ amapa anaa dwetɛ na ɛyɛɛ yeinom nyinaa.<verse eid="JER 52:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JER 52:20"/>Na wɔntumi nkari kɔbere mfrafraeɛ a wɔde yɛɛ afadum mmienu no, Ɛpo no ne anantwinini dumienu a ɛwɔ nʼase ne nnyinasoɔ a wɔmoma soɔ a Ɔhene Salomo yɛɛ wɔ <char style="nd">Awurade</char> asɔredan mu yi mu duru. <verse eid="JER 52:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JER 52:21"/>Na afadum no biara ɔsorokɔ yɛ anammɔn aduonu nson ɛnna ne kanko mu nso yɛ anammɔn dunwɔtwe. Emu da tokuro na nʼafaban no mu pipiripie yɛ nsateakwaa ɛnan. <verse eid="JER 52:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JER 52:22"/>Na kɔbere mfrafraeɛ ntaasoɔ a ɛsi afadum baako so no ɔsorokɔ yɛ anammɔn nson ne fa a wɔde kɔbere mfrafraeɛ ateaa ahyehyɛ ho nyinaa ahyia. Afadum a aka no nso a wɔde kɔbere mfrafraeɛ ateaa ahyehyɛ ho no te sɛ baako no. <verse eid="JER 52:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JER 52:23"/>Na Kɔbere mfrafraeɛ ateaa aba a ɛsensɛn ntaasoɔ no ano no yɛ aduɔkron nsia, ɛnna deɛ ɛkata ntaasoɔ no ho yɛ ɔha.<verse eid="JER 52:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JER 52:24"/>Awɛmfoɔ no sahene no faa ɔsɔfopanin Seraia, abadiakyire Sefania ne ɔpono ano hwɛfoɔ baasa no sɛ nneduafoɔ. <verse eid="JER 52:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JER 52:25"/>Ɔfaa ɔpanin a ɔtua asraafoɔ no ano, ne adehyeɛ afotufoɔ baason firii nnipa a na wɔda so wɔ kuropɔn no mu no. Afei ɔfaa ɔtwerɛfoɔ a na ɔyɛ adwumayɛfoɔ panin ma wɔn a wɔfa nnipa ma wɔkɔyɛ asraafoɔ wɔ asase no so, ne nʼadwumayɛfoɔ no mu aduosia a ɔhunuu wɔn wɔ kuropɔn no mu. <verse eid="JER 52:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JER 52:26"/>Ɔsahene Nebusaradan faa wɔn nyinaa de wɔn brɛɛ Babiloniahene wɔ Ribla. <verse eid="JER 52:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JER 52:27"/>Wɔ Ribla a ɛwɔ Hamat hɔ no, ɔhene no ma wɔkunkum wɔn.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JER 52:27">Enti wɔtwaa Yuda asuo firii nʼasase so.<verse eid="JER 52:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="li4">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JER 52:28"/>Nnipa dodoɔ a Nebukadnessar de wɔn kɔɔ nkoasom mu nie:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:28"/>
  <para style="li1" vid="JER 52:28">nʼadedie afe a ɛtɔ so nson mu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:28">Yudafoɔ 3,023;<verse eid="JER 52:28"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JER 52:29"/>Nebukadnessar adedie afe a ɛtɔ so dunwɔtwe mu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:29">nnipa a wɔfiri Yerusalem, 832;<verse eid="JER 52:29"/></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JER 52:30"/>nʼadedie afe a ɛtɔ so aduonu mmiɛnsa mu,</para>
  <para style="li2" vid="JER 52:30">ɔsahene Nebusaradan a ɔtua ɔhene awɛmfoɔ ano no de Yudafoɔ 745 kɔɔ nnommumfa mu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="JER 52:30"/>
  <para style="li4" vid="JER 52:30">Nnipa no nyinaa dodoɔ yɛ 4,600.<verse eid="JER 52:30"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wɔgyaa Yehoiakin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JER 52:31"/>Ɔhene Yehoiakin dii mfeɛ aduasa nson wɔ nʼasutwa mu wɔ Babilonia no, Ewil-Merodak bɛdii Babiloniahene. Ɔhunuu Yehoiakyin mmɔbɔ, enti ɔyii no firii afiase saa afe no ara mu Adar bosome (bɛyɛ Oforisuo) da a ɛtɔ so mmienu. <verse eid="JER 52:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JER 52:32"/>Ɔkaa abodwosɛm kyerɛɛ no, na ɔmaa no diberɛ a ɛwɔ animuonyam sene ahemfo a wɔne no wɔ Babilonia no deɛ. <verse eid="JER 52:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JER 52:33"/>Enti Yehoiakin yii nʼafiase ntadeɛ guu nkyɛn, na ɛfiri saa ɛda no ɔdidii wɔ ɔhene didipono so ɛberɛ biara kɔsii ne wu da. <verse eid="JER 52:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JER 52:34"/>Na Babiloniahene no sane maa Yehoiakin sika berɛ ano berɛ ano, ma ɔde tuatua ne ho aka kɔsii ne owuda.<verse eid="JER 52:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JER 52"/>
</usx>
